{"abstract":"Opgavesamling til Lærebog om indkomstskat rummer flere end 400 test din viden-spørgsmål og over 200 opgaver, der kan anvendes som forberedelse til en skriftlig eller mundtlig eksamen i skatteret. I nogle opgaver ligger fokus på den juridiske afvejning, mens andre har mere fokus på konkrete beregninger. Opgavesamlingen kan derfor bruges ved professionshøjskoler og universiteter, for eksempel på jura-, erhvervsjura- og revisorkandidatstudiet.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Larsen, Anders","Rasmussen, Rene Yssing","Andersen, Henrik Vestergaard","Christensen, Jacob Engelsted"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-823521"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Eksamen","Opgavesamling","Skatteret"],"level":"edu","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"opgavesamling til lærebog om indkomstskat 000000000002 udgave","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-823521","ids":["aau-5ce8ff86-6fe7-4a27-a3ab-49362078fe8f"],"keyword":["Opgavesamling","eksamen","skatteret"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Educational","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A14F59440C879257533334D97AD3A340"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law, Forskningsgruppen - Offentligret","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Law, Ta