{"abstract":"I denne rapport dokumenteres datagrundlag og de udviklede modeller for kvælstofretention i overfladevand, som anvendes i den nationale kvælstofmodel v2025 til beregning af retentionskort.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Thodsen, Hans","Tornbjerg, Henrik","Audet, Joachim","Petersen, Rasmus Jes","Sørensen, Peter Borgen","Kronvang, Brian","Frederiksen, Rasmus Rumph","Kjeldgaard, Ane","Larsen, Søren Erik","Hoffmann, Carl Christian","Andersen, Anne Hasselholt","Hermansen, Nichlas","Christiansen, Ditte Asmussen","Muff, Emil","Conradsen, Albert Rosenkrantz","Iversen, Bo Vangsø","Pugliese, Lorenzo","Molis, Martin","Højberg, Anker Lajer"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-825012"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Nordic"],"country":["Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland"],"keyword":["Søer","Vandløb","Vådområder"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kvælstofretention i overfladevand modeller for overfladevandsretention i den nationale kvælstofmodel v000000002025","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce.au.dk/fileadmin/dce.au.dk/Udgivelser/Videnskabelige_rapporter_600-699/SR665.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-825012","ids":["au-47841c6e-24a3-4c61-934f-95c94c1142a1"],"keyword":["Kvælstofretention","NKMv2025","National kvælstofmodel","minivådområder","søer","vandløb","vådområder"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E24242F126B3C9548AF153E34D8824D6"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce.au.dk/fileadmin/dce.au.dk/Udgivelser/Videnskabelige_rapporter_600-699/SR665.pdf","version":"Other Ve