{"abstract":"Motivation While preamplifier decoupling is a widely accepted technique, which is based on impedance mismatching, it appears counter-intuitive and still introduces confusion in the MRI community and scientists, who are not electrical engineers by training. Goals This work aims to develop a simulation setup, which clearly illustrates the signal-to-noise ratio (SNR) in preamplifier decoupled and power matched receive coils. Approach Circuit simulations are used to compare SNR at the output of power matched and preamplifier decoupled coils in 3T MRI systems. Results The networks yield similar SNR, despite having significantly different input reflection coefficients; demonstrating that preamplifier decoupling and power matching approaches lead to equivalent SNR. Impact The developed demonstrator is useful in understanding properties of preamplifier decoupling and breaking down a range of associated misconceptions. This can facilitate mastering a proper use of this decoupling method.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Jepsen, Rasmus","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Zhurbenko, Vitaliy"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-747110"],"event":{"end":"2024-05-09","place":"Singapore, sg","start":"2024-05-04","title":"2024 ISMRM &amp; ISMRT Annual Meeting &amp; Exhibition","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Matching networks","Noise matching","Preamplifier decoupling","Preamplifiers","RF Arrays Systems"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"simulation setup for demonstrating snr performance of preamplifier decoupled versus power matched receive coils","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/364500971/Simulation_Setup_for_Demonstrating_SNR_Performance_of_Preamplifier_Decoupled_versus_Power_Matched_Receive_Coils_Orbit.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-747110","ids":["dtu-e4311090-19f1-423e-b7d8-f587c9477fe1"],"keyword":["Antennas & Waveguides","Matching networks","Noise matching","Non-Array RF Coils","Power matching","Preamplifier decoupling","Preamplifiers","RF Arrays & Systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-282C725D2F90985E755E92291FF88D3B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/364500971/Simulation_Setup_for_Demonstrating_SNR_Performance_of_Preamplifier_Decoupled_versus_Power_Matched_Receive_Coils_Orbit.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance, Hyperpolarization & Metabolism","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology, Electromagnetic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rasmus","key":"jepsenpau","last":"Jepsen","locid":"aa87dc83-1462-4474-a3ce-2256db39cfcf","name":"Jepsen, Rasmus","orcid":"0009-0000-5282-7470","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Vitaliy","key":"zhurbenkopau","last":"Zhurbenko","locid":"8449f428-fe8f-4ade-ad94-2e052869c1f4","name":"Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","orcid":"0000-0002-1515-733X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["15246965"],"publisher":"The International Society for Magnetic Resonance in Medicine","series":"International Society for Magnetic Resonance in Medicine. Scientific Meeting and Exhibition. Proceedings","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 2024 ISMRM"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-e4311090-19f1-423e-b7d8-f587c9477fe1"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Simulation Setup for Demonstrating SNR Performance of Preamplifier Decoupled versus Power Matched Receive Coils","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-747110","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Ulcerative colitis is a chronic, immune-mediated disease with increasing incidence.1 There is a clinical need to identify biomarkers of severe disease to capture subgroups requiring intensified monitoring and treatment to avoid repeat hospitalizations and surgical procedures.2 This study aimed to identify biomarkers by conducting a Danish nationwide genome-wide association study (GWAS) on severe vs less severe ulcerative colitis.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Vestergaard, Marie Vibeke","Nøhr, Anne Krogh","Allin, Kristine H.","Krarup, Henrik","Larsen, Lone","Sazonovs, Aleksejs","Jess, Tine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-762552"],"filters":{"added":"2024-11","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Vestergaard, Marie Vibeke"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hla drb000000000001 000000000001 000000000003 and severe ulcerative colitis","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85209250051&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This study was funded by the Danish National Research Foundation (grant no. DNRF148), the Lundbeck Foundation (grant no. R313-2019-857), the Novo Nordisk Foundation (grant no. NNF23OC0087616), and the Danish Colitis Crohn Association (ccf.dk)."],"id":"S01-000.00-762552","identifier":[{"id":"85209250051","type":"scopus"},{"id":"39403737","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-e609d1bf-abd3-436d-8eba-ddbb1d0d1fe0"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-1C503AC2DA3A0B4F0D577F2C16F84BBF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg Univers