","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"36bbf99a-f2ff-4406-b1ca-f9cb7be18f17","name":"Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["ku-7753f106-9c76-45b7-aab3-6582211393cd"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Danmark og EU’s udenrigspolitik : Indflydelse, påvirkning og engagement?\"","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-739319","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The natural development of static lower limb varus/valgus alignments during early childhood is well understood. However, our understanding of dynamic lower limb frontal plane alignments is limited, and we lack normative descriptions of this phenomenon for both boys and girls. This study investigated dynamic lower limb alignment during jump-landings in preschool children, focusing on associations with sex, age, and motor performance. Dynamic lower limb alignment was measured as the Knee-to-Ankle Separation Ratio (KASR) in 605 children aged 3–6 years using markerless motion capture. Based on KASR measurements, we categorized the children into three kinematic groups: Valgus, Intermediate, and Varus. Median KASR scores were 0.86 (0.80–0.96) overall, 0.89 (0.81–0.98) for boys, and 0.85 (0.78–0.92) for girls. Over 75% of the children exhibited some level of dynamic knee valgus during jump-landings (KASR < 1). However, roughly two-thirds of the children in the Valgus group were girls. Age-adjusted differences in motor performance were small and only statistically significant for jump height and length in girls. These findings suggest that dynamic knee valgus during jump-landings is a common occurrence in preschool children, especially among girls. The potential relationship between dynamic lower limb alignment and age and motor performance warrants further investigation.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Harsted, Steen","Hestbæk, Lise","Holsgaard-Larsen, Anders","Lauridsen, Henrik Hein"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-740774"],"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Harsted, Steen"],"keyword":["Motor performance"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Chiropractic Knowledge Hub"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dynamic lower limb alignment during jumping in preschool children normative profiles and sex differences","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1123/jmld.2023-0013","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-740774","identifier":[{"id":"85189373907","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-a956ec7d-0c54-4efa-9af0-0cd76b5dd7f8"],"keyword":["dynamic knee valgus","jump-landing","knee-to-ankle separation ratio","motor performance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D44660D1A6C2CB14602AB036CFB900EE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/260030376/jmld-article-p68.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1123/jmld.2023-0013","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS - Sygehus Lillebælt, Forskningsenhed for Rygmedicin (Kolding)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics, Center for Muscle and Joint Health","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics, Research Unit of Clinical Biomechanics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Chiropractic Knowledge Hub"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Steen","key":"harstedpau","last":"Harsted","locid":"ff230edf-3d7c-4d44-b496-51c32c6c8a4f","name":"Harsted, Steen","orcid":"0000-0002-1879-2224","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lise","key":"hestbækpau","last":"Hestbæk","locid":"033861d4-b80b-485c-90d5-2f1f6b9f686b","name":"Hestbæk, Lise","orcid":"0000-0002-1620-4556","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"holsgaardlarsenpau","last":"Holsgaard-Larsen","locid":"3c1cf5a4-81b1-49f3-ad79-d086b74b1561","name":"Holsgaard-Larsen, Anders","orcid":"0000-0003-4106-6930","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"heinlauridsenpau","last":"Hein Lauridsen","locid":"f7e4b9ef-9405-42c2-9a11-7a982af019c5","name":"Lauridsen, Henrik Hein","name_org":"Hein Lauridsen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-5198-5215","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1123/jmld.2023-0013","issn":["23253193","23253215"],"issn_org":["23253193"],"issue":"1","journal":"Journal of Motor Learning and Development","pages":"68-89","publisher":"Human Kinetics Publishers Inc.","status":"p","title":"Journal of Motor Learning and Development","volume":"12"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85189373907"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-a956ec7d-0c54-4efa-9af0-0cd76b5dd7f8"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Dynamic Lower Limb Alignment During Jumping in Preschool Children: Normative Profiles and Sex Differences","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-740774","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
