{"abstract":"Combined in-plane (longitudinal) shear and out-of-plane (vertical) shear has received very little research attention and the models and evidence in the literature cannot be transferred directly to a real bridge structure. This paper aims to establish a new experimental setup that can provide experimental evidence on the capacity of combined in-plane and out-of-plane shear of non-shear reinforced concrete elements. The paper proposes a novel experimental setup that adopts the advantages of a push-off specimen and an asymmetric four-point bending. The experimental programme includes 7 non-shear reinforced concrete elements tested in combined in-plane and out-of-plane shear. The test results show that there is a strong interaction between in-plane and out-of-plane shear on the overall shear capacity of the element. Furthermore, the paper shows how the failure mechanism changes significantly with different combinations of combined shear.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Larsen, Jens Skovgaard","Jørgensen, Henrik Brøner","Hansen, Søren Gustenhoff"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-802601"],"event":{"end":"2024-08-30","place":"Budapest, hu","start":"2024-08-28","title":"15th fib International PhD Symposium in Civil Engineering","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2025-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Larsen, Jens Skovgaard"],"keyword":["Concrete bridges","Experimental investigation","In plane shear","Out of plane shear","Shear capacity","Shell structures"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-COWI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-COWI","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"experimental investigation of combined in plane and out of plane shear in non shear reinforced concrete elements","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/281248954/Experimental_investigation_of_combined_in-plane_and_out-of-plane_shear_in_non-shear_reinforced_concrete_elements.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-802601","identifier":[{"id":"85216748359","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-9d922940-8294-4c88-a42a-531e42d159c3"],"keyword":["Concrete bridges","Experimental investigation","In-plane shear","Out-of-plane shear","Shear capacity","Shell structures"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-196E44EA0929B9DFFFA5BDA53D0A4EFA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/281248954/Experimental_investigation_of_combined_in-plane_and_out-of-plane_shear_in_non-shear_reinforced_concrete_elements.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Technology and Innovation","SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Technology and Innovation, SDU Civil and Architectural Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"cowi","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-COWI","l3nl":"COWI A/S","l3nn":"COWI","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"COWI","namevar":["Transport Infrastructure, DK South, COWI A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-COWI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Skovgaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"16ed0cc6-9023-47b0-ae40-0443d6d379b8","name":"Larsen, Jens Skovgaard","orcid":"0009-0001-8697-1515","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hen