{"abstract":"Forudsætningen for at kunne træde i eksistens er evnen til at få og forme ideer om hvem man selv er og hvem man ønsker at være. Derfor er kreativ tænkning en nødvendig for alle.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik Wøhlk","Byrge, Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-792681"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Lithuania"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Vilnius University"],"keyword":["Arendt","Creative thinking","Eksistensfilosofi","IDE","Kierkegaard","Ledelse organisationsudvikling og innovation","Læring pædagogik og undervisning","Værdier","kreativ tænkning"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kronik uden kreativ tænkning er der ingen sand eksistens","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://mo.infomedia.dk/ShowArticle.aspx?Duid=ea53d34e&UrlID=61514e26-bc69-425a-a1ba-2e382c291110&Link=","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-792681","ids":["via-c413b223-faa0-46dd-a157-641ecf8e4923"],"keyword":["Ledelse, organisationsudvikling og innovation","Læring, pædagogik og undervisning","arendt","creative thinking","eksistensfilosofi","ide","kierkegaard","kreativ tænkning","værdier"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3D0454325DB8A382D36D9074A12C0748"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://mo.infomedia.dk/ShowArticle.aspx?Duid=ea53d34e&UrlID=61514e26-bc69-425a-a1ba-2e382c291110&Link=","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for pædagogik og dannelse, Forsk.center for professionsstudier","VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for pædagogik og dannelse, Program for Transformationer i Professioner og Uddannelser (TPU)","VIA, Uddannelser, Læreruddannelsen, HF og FIF-kurser, Læreruddannelsen Silkeborg team 2"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"lt","key":"vilnius university","loc":["Lithuania","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Vilnius University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Wøhlk","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"ee25a99f-efad-420b-baff-7dadb13706de","name":"Larsen, Henrik Wøhlk","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Christian","key":"byrgepau","last":"Byrge","name":"Byrge, Christian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["09046054"],"newspaper":"Kristeligt Dagblad","status":"p","title":"Kristeligt Dagblad"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["via-c413b223-faa0-46dd-a157-641ecf8e4923"],"src":["VIA University College"],"title":"Kronik: Uden kreativ tænkning er der ingen sand eksistens","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-792681","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"The DEXamethasone twice for pain treatment after Total Knee Arthroplasty (DEX-2-TKA) trial showed that adding one and two doses of 24 mg intravenous dexamethasone to paracetamol, ibuprofen and local infiltration analgesia, reduced morphine consumption (primary outcome) within 48 h after TKA. We aimed to explore the differences in the effect of dexamethasone on morphine consumption in different subgroups. Quantile regression adjusted for site was used to test for significant interaction between the predefined dichotomised subgroups and treatment group. The subgroups were defined based on baseline data: sex (male/female), age (≤65 years/>65 years), American Society of Anaesthesiologists (ASA)-score (ASA I + II/III), visual analogue score of preoperative pain at rest (≤30 mm/>30 mm), pain during mobilisation (≤30 mm/>30 mm), type of anaesthesia (spinal anaesthesia/general anaesthesia and spinal converted to general anaesthesia), and prior daily use of analgesics (either paracetamol and/or NSAID/neither). These analyses were supplemented with post hoc multivariate linear regression analyses. Test of interaction comparing sex in the pairwise comparison between DX2 (dexamethasone [24 mg] + dexamethasone [24 mg]) versus placebo (p =.02), showed a larger effect of dexamethasone on morphine consumption in male patients compared to females. Test of interaction comparing age in the pairwise comparison between DX1 (dexamethasone [24 mg] + placebo) versus placebo (p =.04), showed a larger effect of dexamethasone on morphine consumption in younger patients (≤65 years) compared to older. All remaining subgroup analyses showed no evidence of a difference. The supplemental multivariate analyses did not support any significant interaction for sex (p =.256) or age (p =.730) but supported a significant interaction with the type of anaesthesia (p <.001). Our results from the quantile regression analyses indicate that the male sex and younger age (≤65 years) may be associated with a larger analgesic effect of dexamethasone than the effects in other types of patients. However, this is not supported by post-hoc multivariate linear regression analyses. The two types of analyses both supported a possible interaction with the type of anaesthesia.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Gasbjerg, Kasper S.","Lunn, Troels Haxholdt","Hägi-Pedersen, Daniel","Overgaard, Søren","Pedersen, Niels A.","Lindholm, Peter","Lindberg-Larsen, Martin","Brorson, Stig","Schrøder, Henrik M.","Thybo, Kasper H.","Olsen, Markus H.","Mathiesen, Ole","Jakobsen, Janus C."],"cuid":["S02-086.61-735475"],"filters":{"added":"2024-05","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Gasbjerg, Kasper S."],"keyword":["Acetaminophen therapeutic use","Aged","Analgesics Opioid therapeutic use","Arthroplasty Replacement Knee","Dexamethasone therapeutic use","Double Blind Method","Female","Glucocorticoids","Humans","Male","Morphine therapeutic use","Multimodal analgesia","Pain Postoperative drug therapy","Postoperative pain","Subgroup analysis","Total knee arthroplasty"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-OTH","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"associations of dexamethasone s effect on morphine consumption after total knee arthroplasty subgroup analyses","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aas.14377","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-086.61-735475","identifier":[{"id":"38267221","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85183051147","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-35f128a3-03ae-44bf-aaa6-b4347272257e","sdu-8a10abda-c0d6-438c-9ff7-319b804e9992"],"keyword":["Acetaminophen/therapeutic use","Aged","Analgesics, Opioid/therapeutic use","Arthroplasty, Replacement, Knee","Dexamethasone/therapeutic use","Double-Blind Method","Female","Humans","Male","Morphine/therapeutic use","Pain, Postoperative/drug therapy","glucocorticoids","multimodal analgesia","postoperative pain","subgroup analysis","total knee arthroplasty"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-A88AE777529913674626346FA2B90A68"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/385576332/Acta_Anaesthesiol_Scand_2024_Gasbjerg_Associations_of_dexamethasone_s_effect_on_morphine_consumption_after_total_knee.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aas.14377","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/259408266/Open_Access_Version.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"region zealand","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-ZEA","l3nl":"Region Zealand","l3nn":"Region Zealand","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region Zealand","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Næstved, Slagelse and Ringsted","Zealand University Hospital - Køge"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-ZEA","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Anaesthesiology","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","countr