{"abstract":"Dette års rapport beskriver status og udvikling i vandkemiske forhold i vandløb, stoftransport af kvælstof og fosfor til kystvandene for perioden før og under NOVANA – og frem til og med 2023","author_count":6,"contributors":["Thodsen, Hans","Tornbjerg, Henrik","Larsen, Søren Erik","Conradsen, Albert Rosenkrantz","Muff, Emil","Blicher-Mathiesen, Gitte"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-787492"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Fosfor","Hydrologi","Kvælstof","NOVANA","Nitrat","Overvågning","Vandløb","stoftransport","vandkemi"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vand og stoftransport 000000002023","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce.au.dk/fileadmin/dce.au.dk/Udgivelser/Videnskabelige_rapporter_600-699/SR629.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-787492","ids":["au-844486d9-39a7-41a6-9664-392358e7a158"],"keyword":["Alkalinitet","Fosfor","Hydrologi","NOVANA","Nitrat","Vandløb","havbelastning","kvælstof","overvågning","stoftransport","vandkemi"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1069BE4BE29A693B5828D15684A2CBC3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce.au.dk/fileadmin/dce.au.dk/Udgivelser/Videnskabelige_rapporter_600-699/SR629.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Catchment Science and Environmental Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans","key":"thodsenpau","last":"Thodsen","locid":"32bff5cf-3478-427f-a25a-edc45f21b300","name":"Thodsen, Hans","orcid":"0000-0002-6542-4934","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"tornbjergpau","last":"Tornbjerg","locid":"673f9989-b651-4f14-8190-b60c45f9cde2","name":"Tornbjerg, Henrik","orcid":"0009-0008-7385-7490","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"fc89ca38-79d9-4781-a6b1-8394e722b334","name":"Larsen, Søren Erik","orcid":"0000-0001-8428-2065","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Albert Rosenkrantz","key":"conradsenpau","last":"Conradsen","locid":"ca94e5cb-97d9-4691-91c7-e53f605203e7","name":"Conradsen, Albert Rosenkrantz","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Emil","key":"muffpau","last":"Muff","locid":"6af6fe9f-c257-4e43-8627-b28b5b326dcb","name":"Muff, Emil","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gitte","key":"blichermathiesenpau","last":"Blicher-Mathiesen","locid":"c1194af9-f1ac-4cdb-9312-8696066200b9","name":"Blicher-Mathiesen, Gitte","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788771569087"],"issn":["22449981"],"pages":"71","publisher":"Aarhus University, DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy","repno":"Videnskabelig rapport fra DCE - Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi","series":"Videnskabelig rapport fra DCE - Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-844486d9-39a7-41a6-9664-392358e7a158"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Vand- og Stoftransport 2023","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-787492","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"Today, Germanic languages, including German, English, Frisian, Dutch and the Nordic languages, are widely spoken in northwest Europe. However, key aspects of the assumed arrival and diversification of this linguistic group remain contentious1–3. By adding 712 new ancient human genomes we find an archaeologically elusive population entering Sweden from the Baltic region by around 4000 BP. This population became widespread throughout Scandinavia by 3500 BP, matching the contemporaneous distribution of Palaeo-Germanic, the Bronze Age predecessor of Proto-Germanic4–6. These Baltic immigrants thus offer a new potential vector for the first Germanic speakers to arrive in Scandinavia, some 800 years later than traditionally assumed7–12. Following the disintegration of Proto-Germanic13–16, we find by 1650 BP a southward push from Southern Scandinavia into presumed Celtic-speaking areas, including Germany, Poland and the Netherlands. During the Migration Period (1575–1375 BP), we see this ancestry representing West Germanic Anglo-Saxons in Britain, and Langobards in southern Europe. We find a related large-scale northward migration into Denmark and South Sweden corresponding with historically attested Danes and the expansion of Old Norse. These movements have direct implications for multiple linguistic hypotheses. Our findings show the power of combining genomics with historical linguistics and archaeology in creating a unified, integrated model for the emergence, spread and diversification of a linguistic group.","author_count":116,"contributors":["McColl, Hugh","Kroonen, Guus","Moreno-Mayar, J. Víctor","Valeur Seersholm, Frederik","Scorrano, Gabriele","Pinotti, Thomaz","Vimala, Tharsika","Sindbæk, Søren M.","Ethelberg, Per","Fyfe, Ralph","Gaillard, Marie-José","Ellegård Larsen, Hanne Marie","Mortensen, Morten Fischer","Demeter, Fabrice","Jørkov, Marie Louise S.","Bergerbrant, Sophie","Damgaard, Peter de Barros","Allentoft, Morten E.","Vinner, Lasse","Gaunitz, Charleen","Ramsøe, Abigail","Altinkaya, Isin","Amund Henriksen, Rasmus","Irving-Pease, Evan K.","Sabatini, Serena","Fischer, Anders","Barrie, William","Ingason, Andrés","Rosengren, Anders","Vaughn, Andrew","Cao, Jialu","Staring, Jacqueline","Stenderup, Jesper","Yediay, Fulya Eylem","Ahlström, Torbjörn","Albris, Sofie Laurine","Atabiev, Biyaslan","Bangsgaard, Pernille","Belcastro, Maria Giovanna","Card, Nick","Charlier, Philippe","Chernykh, Elizaveta","Christiansen, Torben Trier","Coppa, Alfredo","De Coster, Maura","Denham, Sean Dexter","Desenne, Sophie","Downes, Jane","Frei, Karin Margarita","Gábor, Olivér","Gårdsvoll, Johan Zakarias","Glørstad, Zanette Tsigaridas","Hansen, Jesper","Heeren, Stijn","Henriksen, Merete","Heyd, Volker","Høj, Mette","Holst, Mads Kähler","Jankauskas, Rimantas","Janson, Henrik","Dengsø Jessen, Mads","Winther Johannsen, Jens","Johansen, Torkel","Kastholm, Ole Thirup","Kern, Anton","Khaskhanov, Ruslan","Kjær, Katrine","Kolosov, Vladimir","Kootker, Lisette M.","Larsen, Anne Christine","Lejars, Thierry","Løvschal, Mette","Lynnerup, Niels","Magnusson, Yvonne","Mannermaa, Kristiina","Masyakin, Vyacheslav","Melheim, Anne Lene","Merkyte, Inga","Moiseyev, Vyacheslav","Møller, Stig Bergmann","Molnár, Erika","Mortensen, Nadja","Murphy, Eileen","Nielsen, Bjarne Henning","Pany-Kucera, Doris","Paulsson, Bettina Schulz","Ponce de León, Marcia S","Reiersen, Håkon","Reinhard, Walter","Sajantila, Antti","Skar, Birgitte","Slavchev, Vladimir","Smrčka, Václav","Sørensen, Lasse","Tiefengraber, Georg","Uldum, Otto Christian","Vega, Jorge","Vitali, Daniele","Voloshinov, Alexey","Wåhlin, Sidsel","Wendling, Holger","Wessman, Anna","Wilhelmson, Helene","Wiltschke, Karin","Zilhao, João","Zollikofer, Christoph PE","Sand Korneliussen, Thorfinn","Chaume, Bruno","Demoule, Jean-Paul","Werge, Thomas","Olsen, Line","Nielsen, Rasmus","Hedeager, Lotte","Kristiansen, Kristian","Sikora, Martin","Willerslev, Eske"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-811617"],"filters":{"added":"2025-06","altsr