{"abstract":"Motivation Lattice baluns are traditionally used in receive arrays to achieve common mode rejection and preamplifier decoupling. They, however, are limited to real impedance transformations only. Goals New matching networks are sought that achieve noise matching and preamplifier decoupling, as well as common-mode rejection. Approach In this abstract, new network topologies are introduced and their bandwidths are studied. Results In addition to being more compact, the new networks offer a wider bandwidth as well as higher common-mode rejection. Thus, it is expected that the new networks are more resilient to component tolerances and loading effects, and they may enable multinuclear imaging. Impact New topologies of preamplifier decoupling networks with integrated balun functionality are introduced. They offer wider bandwidth and higher common-mode rejection compared to traditional networks.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Jepsen, Rasmus","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Zhurbenko, Vitaliy"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-746920"],"event":{"end":"2024-05-09","place":"Singapore, sg","start":"2024-05-04","title":"2024 ISMRM &amp; ISMRT Annual Meeting &amp; Exhibition","year":"2024"},"filters":{"added":"2024-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Baluns","Matching networks","Noise matching","Preamplifier decoupling","RF Arrays Systems"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"studying bandwidths of balancing preamplifier decoupling networks","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/364500819/Studying_Bandwidths_of_Balancing_Preamplifier_Decoupling_Networks_Orbit.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-746920","ids":["dtu-b41094c8-e8c7-4cb9-864d-f95b0a617bcf"],"keyword":["Baluns","Common-modes","Matching networks","New Devices","Noise matching","Preamplifier decoupling","RF Arrays & Systems"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-B31A65ECDC13EFC707B8034653B160B5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/364500819/Studying_Bandwidths_of_Balancing_Preamplifier_Decoupling_Networks_Orbit.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance, Hyperpolarization & Metabolism","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Space Research and Technology, Electromagnetic Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rasmus","key":"jepsenpau","last":"Jepsen","locid":"aa87dc83-1462-4474-a3ce-2256db39cfcf","name":"Jepsen, Rasmus","orcid":"0009-0000-5282-7470","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Vitaliy","key":"zhurbenkopau","last":"Zhurbenko","locid":"8449f428-fe8f-4ade-ad94-2e052869c1f4","name":"Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","orcid":"0000-0002-1515-733X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"i