{"abstract":"Forskning viser at kunstig intelligens er bedre til at finde nye og meningsfulde ideer end de fleste almindelige mennesker. Hvis vi styrker brugen af AI vil det give flere bedre mulighed for at udfolde sig.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik Wøhlk","Byrge, Christian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-792549"],"filters":{"added":"2025-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Lithuania"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Vilnius University"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kronik kunstig intelligens er klogere end de fleste de der forstår at bruge den får et stort forspring","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://jyllands-posten.dk/debat/kronik/ECE17205772/kunstig-intelligens-er-klogere-end-de-fleste-de-der-forstaar-at-bruge-den-faar-et-stort-forspring/.","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-792549","ids":["via-32671fe0-f4bd-481c-ad81-bc30bc979122"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E461680DB242EDADB23DC6FCB1023D99"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://jyllands-posten.dk/debat/kronik/ECE17205772/kunstig-intelligens-er-klogere-end-de-fleste-de-der-forstaar-at-bruge-den-faar-et-stort-forspring/.","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for pædagogik og dannelse, Forsk.center for professionsstudier","VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskning