,"last":"Andersen","name":"Andersen, Trine Rune Høgh","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Thomas","key":"kallemosepau","last":"Kallemose","name":"Kallemose, Thomas","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lona","key":"christruppau","last":"Christrup","locid":"acf7258c-1e63-48a1-9bef-d6b6c5b8eeca","name":"Christrup, Lona Louring","name_org":"Christrup, Lona","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels","key":"westergaardpau","last":"Westergaard","locid":"724878cd-d318-4aec-a0a7-bdb6af7bd8c4","name":"Westergaard, Niels","orcid":"0000-0002-2663-8040","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["38403838"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/bcpt.13990","issn":["17427835"],"issue":"5","journal":"Basic & Clinical Pharmacology & Toxicology","pages":"756-763","publisher":"Wiley","status":"p","title":"Basic & Clinical Pharmacology & Toxicology","title_org":"Basic and Clinical Pharmacology and Toxicology","volume":"134"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85186630007"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","All University Colleges","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University College Absalon","University Colleges","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-46d7566d-378a-4e85-bb53-152947ed9996","pha-3fdbe866-4971-4d58-83d5-014275491682","sdu-b0d95f2f-2c76-4fc2-aac9-1b5ae96a297a"],"src":["AB University College Absalon","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Pharmacogenetic testing of <i>CYP2D6</i>, <i>CYP2C19</i> and <i>CYP2C9</i> in Denmark : Agreement between publicly funded genotyping tests and the subsequent phenotype classification","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-092.26-735485","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE: To describe clinical features and outcomes of viral lumbosacral radiculitis (Elsberg syndrome). METHODS: Nationwide population-based cohort study of all adults hospitalised for viral lumbosacral radiculitis at departments of infectious diseases in Denmark from 2015 to 2020. RESULTS: Twenty-eight patients with viral lumbosacral radiculitis were included (mean annual incidence: 1.2/1,000,000 adults). The median age was 35 years (IQR 27-43), and 22/28 (79%) were female. All patients had urinary retention, with 17/28 (61%) needing a catheter. On admission, at least one sign or symptom of meningitis (headache, neck stiffness, photophobia/hyperacusis) was present in 18/22 (82%). Concurrent genital herpetic lesions were present in 11/24 (46%). The median cerebrospinal fluid leukocyte count was 153 cells/µL (IQR 31-514). Magnetic resonance imaging showed radiculitis/myelitis in 5/19 (26%). The microbiological diagnosis was herpes simplex virus type 2 in 19/28 (68%), varicella-zoster virus in 2/28 (7%), and unidentified in 7/28 (25%). Aciclovir/valaciclovir was administered in 27/28 (96%). At 30 days after discharge, 3/27 (11%) had persistent urinary retention with need of catheter. At 180 days after discharge, moderate disabilities (Glasgow Outcome Scale score of 4) were observed in 5/25 (20%). CONCLUSIONS: Urinary retention resolved within weeks in most patients with viral lumbosacral radiculitis, but moderate disabilities according to the Glasgow Outcome Scale were common at the end of follow-up.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Petersen, Pelle Trier","Bodilsen, Jacob","Jepsen, Micha Phill Grønholm","Larsen, Lykke","Storgaard, Merete","Hansen, Birgitte Rønde","Lüttichau, Hans Rudolf","Helweg-Larsen, Jannik","Wiese, Lothar","Andersen, Christian Østergaard","Nielsen, Henrik","Brandt, Christian Thomas"],"cuid":["S03-095.33-741610"],"filters":{"added":"2023-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corpau":["Danish Study Group of Infections of the Brain","Danish Study Group of Infections of the Brain (DASGIB)"],"corresponding_author":["Petersen, Pelle Trier"],"keyword":["Aciclovir","Adult","Aseptic meningitis","Cohort Studies","Denmark epidemiology","Female","Herpes Zoster epidemiology","Herpesviridae","Herpesvirus 2 Human isolation purification","Herpesvirus 3 Human isolation purification","Humans","Lumbosacral Region","Male","Middle Aged","Myelitis","Radiculopathy virology","Urinary Retention virology","Urinary retention","Viral meningitis"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"viral lumbosacral radiculitis elsberg syndrome in denmark","src":["aau","au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s15010-023-02113-9","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["Open access funding provided by Royal Library, Copenhagen University Library. This work was supported by Helsefonden (grant number 21-B-0437), Helen Rudes Fond (grant number 60988), A & J C Tvergaards Fond, Minister Erna Hamiltons Legat for Videnskab og Kunst (grant number 24-2022), and Nordsjællands Hospital to PTP."],"id":"S03-095.33-741610","identifier":[{"id":"PMC11143033","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"37917395","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85175633619","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-f5452f8a-a195-4381-9f7a-b11c4253c4cb","au-a28c81db-b87d-4dc7-a6ad-18ab1fd26323","sdu-b735756c-4a5d-4adb-b338-be418222f956"],"keyword":["Aciclovir","Adult","Aseptic meningitis","Cohort Studies","Denmark/epidemiology","Female","Herp