,"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-24679033-9c8d-45dd-bb5c-07c3276c4547"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Manipulating Bandwidth of Cryogenically Cooled Receive-Only MRI Detectors","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-669183","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"As an alternative to Gadolinium, metabolically inert hyperpolarized contrast agents have been used in perfusion studies. For myocardial perfusion measurements, it is challenging to reliably obtain perfusionrelated signals due to partial volume effects. We propose a constrained decomposition approach, enforcing prior knowledge of the residue function being temporally decreasing. The method is capable of separating the arterial and perfusion components and the quantified perfusion map is not visibly affected by partial volume effects.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Zhao, Yupeng","Hansen, Rie Beck","Søvsø Szocska Hansen, Esben","Laustsen, Christoffer","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Hanson, Lars G."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-676792"],"event":{"end":"2023-06-08","place":"Toronto, ca","start":"2023-06-03","title":"2023 ISMRM &amp; ISMRT Annual Meeting &amp; Exhibition","year":"2023"},"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Myocardium","Perfusion"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a constrained decomposition method for myocardial perfusion quantification using hyperpolarized mri","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/328416419/ISMRM2023_Yupeng0174_decomp.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-676792","ids":["dtu-6d5830e1-f2bc-47f4-a4d6-8eb304c0a587"],"keyword":["Myocardium","Perfusion"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-ECF0ACF17FA53B3C0967E25A1A66B717"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/328416419/ISMRM2023_Yupeng0174_decomp.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance, Hyperpolarization & Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Yupeng","key":"zhaopau","last":"Zhao","locid":"2b1ccf6e-22a6-4eb4-a789-3dfc4348f5ad","name":"Zhao, Yupeng","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rie Beck","key":"olinpau","last":"Olin","locid":"8214cd7c-cdb4-4678-b17b-bbd3f5d87ece","name":"Hansen, Rie Beck","name_org":"Olin, Rie Beck","orcid":"0000-0003-1718-8196","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Esben","key":"søvsøszocskahansenpau","last":"Søvsø Szocska Hansen","name":"Søvsø Szocska Hansen, Esben","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Christoffer","key":"laustsenpau","last":"Laustsen","name":"Laustsen, Christoffer","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,