, Sisse R.","orcid":"0000-0001-5288-3851","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"13 14 15","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin L.","key":"olssonmartinlpau","last":"Olsson","name":"Olsson, Martin L.","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 6","first":"Ole B.","key":"pedersenolebirgerpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"0d43956a-6e43-42d7-8b29-4505d03ea5c8","name":"Pedersen, Ole Birger","name_org":"Pedersen, Ole B.","orcid":"0000-0003-2312-5976","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["37921035"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/trf.17575","issn":["00411132","15372995"],"issn_org":["00411132"],"issue":"12","journal":"Transfusion","pages":"2297-2310","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Transfusion","volume":"63"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85175740684"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","Non-Profit Organisations","North Denmark Region","Region Zealand","Region of Southern Denmark","Roskilde University","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-5877af24-7f63-4a94-9bda-1d9e306a89e5","au-d31acf3a-bd94-4379-8bfc-73ddb781f267","ku-272f130c-39f3-49a3-8e78-7dc4c35c8b99","ruc-1ea63b49-19de-439e-bf03-8897c822297b","sdu-74686168-0a3f-483e-945e-173e99c9e7ab"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","RUC Roskilde University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Genetic prediction of 33 blood group phenotypes using an existing genotype dataset","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S05-099.93-715668","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"INTRODUCTION: While the incidence of inflammatory bowel disease (IBD) is rising globally, it has been suggested to stabilize in westernized countries, but this has not yet been shown in exhaustive and large cohorts. We generated an IBD cohort in North Denmark (NorDIBD) of 6,158 patients with IBD diagnosed from 1978 to 2020, based on all recorded and verified IBD diagnoses in the region. While describing the establishment of this cohort, we aimed to present the accurate incidence and prevalence of IBD over 4 decades. METHODS: The NorDIBD cohort covered all pediatric and adult patients with an IBD diagnosis dated between January 1, 1978, and December 31, 2020, and living in North Denmark, hence forming an unselected population-based patient cohort. IBD incidence rates between 1978 and 2020 and IBD point prevalences between 2003 and 2020 were calculated. RESULTS: We observed a 4-fold increase in the incidence of IBD from 11.5 per 100,000 persons (95% confidence interval [CI] 8.4-14.6) in the year 1978 to 51.3/100,000 (95% CI 45.5-57.1) in the year 2014, whereas in 2020, this rate stabilized. The overall prevalence of IBD more than doubled from 2003 to 2020, from 424 (95% CI 407-443) in 2003 to 872 (95% CI 849-896) IBD cases per 100,000 persons in 2020. DISCUSSION: Our population-based NorDIBD cohort suggests stabilizing of the incidence of IBD in Denmark, whereas the prevalence continues to rise. Because the data represent a 10% sample of the entire Danish IBD population, we believe that data can be extrapolated to the IBD population in general and used for healthcare planning.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Larsen, Lone","Karachalia Sandri, Anastasia","Fallingborg, Jan","Jacobsen, Bent Ascanius","Jacobsen, Henrik Albæk","Bøgsted, Martin","Drewes, Asbjørn Mohr","Jess, Tine"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-053264"],"filters":{"added":"2023-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Larsen, Lone"],"keyword":["Crohn s disease","Incidence","Inflammatory bowel disease","Prevalence","Ulcerative colitis"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"has the incidence of inflammatory bowel disease peaked evidence from the population based nordibd cohort 000000001978 000000002020","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85149425085&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-053264","identifier":[{"id":"85149425085","type":"scopus"},{"id":"36728238","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-0b14fe9e-07b2-4e8e-84df-b6456597a630"],"keyword":["Crohn's disease","incidence","inflammatory bowel disease","prevalence","ulcerative colitis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E7C15E377261B1C2160C4100E9EBC0DF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Gastroenterology and Hepatology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine, Center for Molecular Prediction of Inflammatory Bowel Disease"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lone","key":"larsenlonepau","last":"Larsen","locid":"dee3a5a6-2573-46b3-a97d-599871808a77","name":"Larsen, Lone","orcid":"0000-0003-4067-2381","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Anastasia","key":"karachaliasandrianastasiapau","last":"Karachalia Sandri","locid":"575a4e0f-bbaa-46f2-a544-4b829b28baf4","name":"Karachalia Sandri, Anastasia","orcid":"0000-0003-2557-2251","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan","key":"fallingborgjanpau","last":"Fallingborg","locid":"357d63a3-f307-4592-88f3-dde901ed59db","name":"Fallingborg, Jan","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bent Ascanius","key":"jacobsenbentascaniuspau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"671cf935-2739-479c-8575-bd32880a8281","name":"Jacobsen, Bent Ascanius","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Albæk","key":"jacobsenhenrikalbækpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"f8250b02-4973-4c0f-8791-b55cc62d8aa8","name":"Jacobsen, Henrik Albæk","orcid":"0000-0001-7939-0715","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Martin","key":"bøgstedmartinpau","last":"Bøgsted","locid":"a51116b7-e9b7-4f83-a74b-2d76bb8b1475","name":"Bøgsted, Martin","orcid":"0000-0001-9192-1814","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Asbjørn Mohr","key":"drewesasbjørnmohrpau","last":"Drewes","locid":"988c3f0b-931f-4206-a88d-95fce5ae3a37","name":"Drewes, Asbjørn Mohr","orcid":"0000-0001-7465-964X","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Tine","key":"jesstinepau","last":"Jess","locid":"ab65eac5-33fc-4361-882d-e595188169d3","name":"Jess, Tine","orcid":"0000-0002-4391-7332","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["36728238"],"pub":{"doi":"10.14309/ajg.0000000000002187","issn":["00029270","15720241"],"issn_org":["00029270"],"issue":"3","journal":"The American Journal of Gastroenterology","pages":"501-510","publisher":"Wolters Kluwer","status":"p","title":"The American Journal of Gastroenterology","volume":"118"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85149425085"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-0b14fe9e-07b2-4e8e-84df-b6456597a630"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Has the Incidence of Inflammatory Bowel Disease Peaked? Evidence From the Population-Based NorDIBD Cohort 1978-2020","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-053264","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Indeklima er for mange mennesker en diffus og uhåndgribelig størrelse. Hvilke parametre snakker vi om, når vi snakker om indeklima? Hvad er godt indeklima? Og hvad kan man som almindelig beboer i en bolig gøre for at forbedre indeklimaet? En ny mærkningsordning for indeklima er blevet lanceret og vil fremadrettet muliggøre en mere klar dialog omkring kvaliteten af indeklima ud fra den velkendte A-G-bogstavskala. Samtidig har ny forskning bag ordningen lært os, hvordan prioriteringen af indeklima er steget gennem årene og nu er en væsentlig del af beslutningsgrundlaget ved bolighandler.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Larsen, Tine Steen","Rohde, Lasse","Knudsen, Henrik Nellemose","Sonne, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-087240"],"filters":{"added":"2023-04","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Indeklima","Indeklima mærkning"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Bolius"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"få klar besked om boligens indeklima","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/545624681/2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-087240","ids":["aau-7fcd88f3-dbbd-43b3-ac0a-243f9ada3408"],"keyword":["Indeklima","Indeklima mærkning"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BCF2E3ACAB0396FCC3720C6BE203306B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ipaper.ipapercms.dk/TechMedia/HVACMagasinet/2023/2/?page=26","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/545624681/2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University"