,"locid":"04de6e58-b8ca-4a60-95e7-849dde928efb","name":"Windolf, Jørgen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"tornbjergpau","last":"Tornbjerg","locid":"673f9989-b651-4f14-8190-b60c45f9cde2","name":"Tornbjerg, Henrik","orcid":"0009-0008-7385-7490","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jonas","key":"rolighedpau","last":"Rolighed","locid":"bdaf0e47-f2a1-4a23-a1da-d30cee160e19","name":"Rolighed, Jonas","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Søren Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"fc89ca38-79d9-4781-a6b1-8394e722b334","name":"Larsen, Søren Erik","orcid":"0000-0001-8428-2065","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-c9c867d7-27ab-43e8-aec2-159171702f75"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"A novel machine learning national model for diffuse source total phosphorus concentrations in streams","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-668681","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Dette kapitelt giver et rids af nykritikkens udvikling i 1920’ernes og 1930’erenes angelsaksiske universitetsmiljøer (Eliot, Richards, Empson, Brooks, Tate, Warren, Wellek osv.), men også i Skandinavien og Danmark fra omkring 1960 (Holmqvist, Fjord Jensen, Brostrøm osv.). Nykritikkens hovedpointer opsummeres i tre punkter, nemlig digtningens særsprog, værket som en autonom enhed af betydningsmæssige modsætninger og den metodiske nærlæsning. I forhold til det faktum, at nykritikken er en litteraturkritisk retning, der har været uhyre slidstærk og været anvendt vedholdende i det sidste århundrede, diskuterer kapitlet en række af de kritikker, der har været rettet mod nykritikken, af hvilke de vigtigste er påstandene om det æsteticistiske, det ahistoriske, det uvidenskabelige og det poetisk-anglofilt orienterede. En læsning af den eksemplarisk tekst “Frihavnen” af Klaus Rifbjerg forholder sig til ovennævnte pointer, og i en afsluttende diskussion overvejes det, hvordan nykritikken er blevet og kan anvendes i praktiske undervisningssammenhænge.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Larsen, Peter Stein"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-673768"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["New Criticism","Nykritik"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"nykritik","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://hansreitzel.dk/products/litteraturens-tilgange-bog-16290-9788702384413","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-673768","ids":["aau-72cca880-0c81-480d-b12f-eced52f0ead6"],"keyword":["Nykritik","new criticism"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C39084AD0E98528C7B5E3A85E07F4737"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Social Sciences and Humanities, Department of Culture and Learning, Litterature, Media and Society - LMS"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter Stein","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"83e6463d-057d-435c-8520-9cd3ecba0509","name":"Larsen, Peter Stein","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"juulpedh","last":"Juul","name":"Juul, Henrik","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"edition":"3","isbn":["9788702384413"],"pages":"57-78","publisher":"Hans Reitzels Forlag","status":"p","title":"Litteraturens tilgange"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-72cca880-0c81-480d-b12f-eced52f0ead6"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Nykritik","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-673768","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Mutations in the TMEM260 gene cause structural heart defects and renal anomalies syndrome, but the function of the encoded protein remains unknown. We previously reported wide occurrence of O-mannose glycans on extracellular immunoglobulin, plexin, transcription factor (IPT) domains found in the hepatocyte growth factor receptor (cMET), macrophage-stimulating protein receptor (RON), and plexin receptors, and further demonstrated that two known protein O-mannosylation systems orchestrated by the POMT1/2 and transmembrane and tetratricopeptide repeat-containing proteins 1-4 gene families were not required for glycosylation of these IPT domains. Here, we report that the TMEM260 gene encodes an ER-located protein O-mannosyltransferase that selectively glycosylates IPT domains. We demonstrate that disease-causing TMEM260 mutations impair O-mannosylation of IPT domains and that TMEM260 knockout in cells results in receptor maturation defects and abnormal growth of 3D cell models. Thus, our study identifies the third protein-specific O-mannosylation pathway in mammals and demonstrates that O-mannosylation of IPT domains serves critical functions during epithelial morphogenesis. Our findings add a new glycosylation pathway and gene to a growing group of congenital disorders of glycosylation.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Larsen, Ida Signe Bohse","Povolo, Lorenzo","Zhou, Luping","Tian, Weihua","Mygind, Kasper Johansen","Hintze, John","Jiang, Chen","Hartill, Verity","Prescott, Katrina","Johnson, Colin A.","Mullegama, Sureni V.","McConkie-Rosell, Allyn","McDonald, Marie","Hansen, Lars","Vakhrushev, Sergey Y.","Schjoldager, Katrine T.","Clausen, Henrik","Worzfeld, Thomas","Joshi, Hiren J.","Halim, Adnan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-677942"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chapel Allerton Hospital","Duke University","GeneDX Inc","Max Planck Institute for Heart and Lung Research","University of Leeds","University of Marburg"],"keyword":["Congenital disorders of glycosylation","Glycoproteomics","Glycosylation","plexin"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the shdra syndrome associated gene i tmem000000000260 i encodes a protein specific o mannosyltransferase","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2302584120","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-677942","identifier":[{"id":"37186866","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC10214176","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85159499805","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-37ed9483-7df3-4710-afce-da630b828289"],"keyword":["O-mannosylation","congenital disorders of glycosylation","glycoproteomics","glycosylation","plexin"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E4089844E947689CF53AD9D052833A7A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2302584120","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/347698503/pnas.2302584120.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Cellular and Molecular Medicine, Glycomics Program"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"university of marburg","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Marburg","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"university of leeds","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Leeds","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"chapel allerton hospital","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Chapel Allerton Hospital","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"genedx inc","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"GeneDX Inc","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"us","key":"duke university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Duke University","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"de","key":"max planck institute for heart and lung research","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Max Planck Institute for Heart and Lung Research","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Ida Signe Bohse","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"f2869bf8-54a4-49ae-9db2-434d2714b362","name":"Larsen, Ida Signe Bohse","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lorenzo","key":"povolopau","last":"Povolo","locid":"819e0294-0479-423e-98f5-b7d5c140ae1d","name":"Povolo, Lorenzo","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Luping","key":"zhoupau","last":"Zhou","name":"Zhou, Luping","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Weihua","key":"tianpau","last":"Tian","locid":"9c94707a-e04c-4c99-b4b6-3adce8a13103","name":"Tian, Weihua","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kasper Johansen","key":"mygindpau","last":"Mygind","locid":"9ba97a00-b2e3-417f-83b5-30d09bdd38fc","name":"Mygind, Kasper Johansen","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"John","key":"hintzepau","last":"Hintze","locid":"3ee29743-9ef3-4111-b7f3-552694e5a79e","name":"Hintze, John","orcid":"0000-0003-1420-7398","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Chen","key":"jiangpau","last":"Jiang","name":"Jiang, Chen","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","first":"Verity","key":"h