{"abstract":"Chapter 4 identified local problems or potentials and suggested possible design interventions to solve or enhance them in all of the locations. We now discuss how we – in dialogue with the municipal planners focus on one specific ‘design problem’ and prototype. Our designs follow a localised approach to designing places and altering behaviour. They respond to unique local problems identified through our studies of these places and their associated walking and public life practices (Carmona, 2017).","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Jonas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-713231"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"prototyping","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/98482477/5_Prototyping.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-713231","ids":["ruc-19f4894e-6a19-4adc-b0af-6dfd89564ca0"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D9A63E52E0B0B1515C7409271981D596"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/98482477/5_Prototyping.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Mobility, Space, Place and Urban Studies (MOSPUS)","Roskilde University, Department of Social Sciences and Business, Centre for Tourism Research"],"nora_cod