e Bagge","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Katrine Bagge","rank":18,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Kristian","key":"karstoftpau","last":"Karstoft","locid":"80f306e9-a560-493c-b7d4-4e18b694660f","name":"Karstoft, Kristian","rank":19,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34784247"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1139/apnm-2021-0194","issn":["17155312","17155320"],"issn_org":["17155312"],"issue":"3","journal":"Applied Physiology, Nutrition and Metabolism","pages":"309-320","status":"p","title":"Applied Physiology, Nutrition and Metabolism","volume":"47"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85125882448"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-a64ae10a-385d-41e8-8d10-227fc24a5914"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Skeletal muscle adaptations to exercise are not influenced by metformin treatment in humans: secondary analyses of 2 randomised, clinical trials","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-492756","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"This chapter investigates the responses of front-line managers and technicians to organisational change in a Scandinavian telecommunications company from a temporal perspective. Based on an ethnographic study in the company’s operations department 25 years after the privatisation of the company, it shows how temporal assumptions impacted managers’ and technicians’ responses to change and their experience of work life quality. Drawing on Bourdieu’s temporalisation of practice, the chapter unfolds an alternative understanding of time as both a structured and a structuring structure and it demonstrates how Bourdieu’s temporal epistemology offers an alternative theorisation of the responses of workers and managers to sweeping organisational change. The chapter asserts that the temporal dimension of Bourdieu’s work deserves more attention in organisation and management studies.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Koll, Henrik","Ernst, Jette"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-557818"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Malmö University"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"caught between times explaining resistance to change through the tale of don quixote","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.routledge.com/Pierre-Bourdieu-in-Studies-of-Organization-and-Management-Societal-Change/Robinson-Ernst-Larsen-Thomassen/p/book/9780367893354","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-557818","ids":["ruc-1b5973d2-4cdf-4d5d-86ca-4e8d912bacd6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EE3992D4F4918D13A6AA80A5B63EE253"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"se","key":"malmö university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Malmö University","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Social Sciences and Business"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"kollpau","last":"Koll","name":"Koll, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","first":"Jette","key":"ernstpau","last":"Ernst","locid":"6a0897e9-0f48-4db5-a024-7770c3e620b1","name":"Ernst, Jette","orcid":"0000-0003-0095-4544","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sarah","key":"robinsonpedh","last":"Robinson","name":"Robinson, Sarah","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jette","key":"ernstpedh","last":"Ernst","name":"Ernst, Jette","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kristian","key":"larsenpedh","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Kristian","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ole Jacob","key":"thomassenpedh","last":"Thomassen","name":"Thomassen, Ole Jacob","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.4324/9781003022510-3","edition":"1","eisbn":["9781003022510"],"isbn":["9780367893354","9781032107509"],"pages":"23-40","place":"New York","publisher":"Routledge","series":"Routledge Studies in Management, Organizations and Society","status":"p","subtitle":"Societal Change and Transforming Fields","title":"Pierre Bourdieu in Studies of Organization and Management"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-1b5973d2-4cdf-4d5d-86ca-4e8d912bacd6"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Caught between Times : Explaining Resistance to Change through the Tale of Don Quixote","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-557818","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"In 1979 the Swedish leftist journal Häften för kritiska studier, involving young geographers from the three Scandinavian countries, published a special issue on ‘Geography and society: capitalism and the analysis of space’. A group of geographers from University of Uppsala, Sweden, decided to arrange a small two-day seminar around the topics of the issue. This event can be claimed to mark the beginning of a ‘Nordic’ critical geography. The seminar surprisingly attracted more than 100 participants from Denmark, Finland, Iceland, Norway and Sweden, and fruitful discussions rendered the participants convinced that it was an occasion worthy of repetition. This evolved into the annual Nordic meetings (or symposia) of critical geographers.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Lehtinen, Ari","Simonsen, Kirsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-571093"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Finland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Eastern Finland"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"moments of renewal critical conversion of nordic samhällsgeografi","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-571093","ids":["ruc-e098ce39-4e62-464b-ae2f-950e09fca018"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-6C112B1996DF6DA9B3EADF8E1737E8B0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"fi","key":"university of eastern finland","loc":["Finland","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Eastern Finland","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark"