{"abstract":"The levels of non-proportionality in fatigue stress-time series are difficult to determine. Approaches from literature are not easy to interpret and predicts different levels for variable and constant amplitude stresses. In this paper, an extension to the PCA-based method is proposed in which variable amplitude stresses are transformed into equivalent constant amplitude stresses by scaling the stress reversal points. This ensures robust and easily interpretable results. The proposed method is compared with other approaches given in literature using published experiments and a designed offshore jacket structure. The results show that the proposed method can predict the levels of non-proportionality accurately.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Larsen, Mikkel Løvenskjold","Baumgartner, Jörg","Clausen, Henrik Bisgaard","Arora, Vikas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-597386"],"filters":{"added":"2023-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Larsen, Mikkel Løvenskjold"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Fraunhofer LBF"],"keyword":["Multiaxial fatigue","Non proportional fatigue","Variable amplitude loading","Welded joints"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-RAM"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-RAM","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a new constant amplitude equivalent principal component analysis based method for non proportionality quantification of variable amplitude loaded welded joints in large scale structures","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijfatigue.2022.107008","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-597386","identifier":[{"id":"85130589930","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["sdu-54480f95-554a-472d-8b5b-b59256c699cc"],"keyword":["Multiaxial fatigue","Non-proportional fatigue","Variable amplitude loading","Welded joints"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-987085E0E7AE9975959EF61A76E4D472"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/227091203/1_s2.0_S0142112322002730_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijfatigue.2022.107008","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2022","yearSub":"2022"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Institute of Mechanical and Electrical Engineering","SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Institute of Mechanical and Electrical Engineering, SDU Mechanical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"fraunhofer lbf","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Fraunhofer LBF","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"ramboll group","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-RAM","l3nl":"Rambøll Group","l3nn":"Ramboll Group","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Ramboll Group","namevar":["Ramboll Offshore Wind"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-RAM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mikkel Løvenskjold","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"1e448908-ddff-4e12-811d-0e9d88a3dff9","name":"Larsen, Mikkel Løvenskjold","orcid":"0000-0003-2853-6563","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jörg","key":"baumgartnerpau","last":"Baumgartner","name":"Baumgartner, Jörg","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Bisgaard","key":"clausenpau","last":"Clausen","name":"Clausen, Henrik Bisgaard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vikas","key":"arorapau","last":"Arora","locid":"825c3f36-eeab-4635-980b-01218adb6f82","name":"Arora, Vikas","orcid":"0000-0002-4369-7851","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ijfatigue.2022.107008","issn":["01421123","18793452"],"issn_org":["01421123"],"journal":"International Journal of Fatigue","paperid":"107008","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Fatigue","volume":"163"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85130589930"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Private Research","Rambøll Group","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-54480f95-554a-472d-8b5b-b59256c699cc"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"A new constant amplitude equivalent principal component analysis-based method for non-proportionality quantification of variable amplitude loaded welded joints in large-scale structures","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-597386","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
