ty of Copenhagen"],"title":"Effects of an exercise-based lifestyle intervention on systemic markers of oxidative stress and advanced glycation endproducts in persons with type 2 diabetes : Secondary analysis of a randomised clinical trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-447109","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
