{"author_count":4,"contributors":["Arndt, Kristine Bollerup","Schrøder, Henrik","Troelsen, Anders","Lindberg-Larsen, Martin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-589679"],"event":{"end":"2022-06-24","place":"Lissabon, pt","start":"2022-06-22","title":"23rd annual Congress, EFORT","year":"2022"},"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"opioid and analgesics use before and after revision knee arthroplasty for the indications pain without loosening versus aseptic loosening a danish nationwide study","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-589679","ids":["sdu-3986adf8-a5cd-44c5-b4be-4eb13903ddfd"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-FEB9FF2391951BECCF1F13714990D1D0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of orthopaedic surgery (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital","Hvidovre Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kristine Bollerup","key":"arndtpau","last":"Arndt","locid":"a2513ef2-9214-48ee-b84f-bea6ef1717ac","name":"Arndt, Kristine Bollerup","orcid":"0000-0001-8258-7922","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"schrøderpau","last":"Schrøder","name":"Schrøder, Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 4","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders","key":"troelsenpau","last":"Troelsen","name":"Troelsen, Anders","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"lindberglarsenpau","last":"Lindberg-Larsen","locid":"299608f9-db43-4744-984b-a7c428aca95b","name":"Lindberg-Larsen, Martin","orcid":"0000-0002-4483-677X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-3986adf8-a5cd-44c5-b4be-4eb13903ddfd"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Opioid And Analgesics Use Before And After Revision Knee Arthroplasty For The Indications Pain Without Loosening Versus Aseptic Loosening; A Danish Nationwide Study","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-589679","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Autosomal recessive polycystic kidney disease is a cystic kidney disease with early onset and clinically characterized by enlarged echogenic kidneys, hypertension, varying degrees of kidney dysfunction, and liver fibrosis. It is most frequently caused by sequence variants in the PKHD1 gene, encoding fibrocystin. In more rare cases, sequence variants in DZIP1L are seen, encoding the basal body protein DAZ interacting protein 1-like protein (DZIP1L). So far, only four different DZIP1L variants have been reported. METHODS: Four children from three consanguineous families presenting with polycystic kidney disease were selected for targeted or untargeted exome sequencing. RESULTS: We identified two different, previously not reported homozygous DZIP1L sequence variants: c.193 T > C; p.(Cys65Arg), and c.216C > G; p.(Cys72Trp). Functional analyses of the c.216C > G; p.(Cys72Trp) variant indicated mislocalization of mutant DZIP1L. CONCLUSIONS: In line with published data, our results suggest a critical role of the N-terminal domain for proper protein function. Although patients with PKHD1-associated autosomal recessive polycystic kidney disease often have liver abnormalities, none of the present four patients showed any clinically relevant liver involvement. Our data demonstrate the power and efficiency of next-generation sequencing-based approaches. While DZIP1L-related polycystic kidney disease certainly represents a rare form of the disease, our results emphasize the importance of including DZIP1L in multigene panels and in the data analysis of whole-exome sequencing for cystic kidney diseases. A higher resolution version of the Graphical abstract is available as Supplementary information.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Hertz, Jens Michael","Svenningsen, Per","Dimke, Henrik","Engelund, Morten Buch","Nørgaard, Hanne","Hansen, Anita","Marcussen, Niels","Thiesson, Helle","Bergmann, Carsten","Larsen, Martin Jakob"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-627024"],"f