{"abstract":"Denne artikel er skrevet på baggrund af erfaringer med at inddrage QR-koder i historie- og samfundsfagsundervisning på Læreruddannelsen i Skive og på kurser for lærere i folkeskolen.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik Smedegaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-659643"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bevægelse i undervisningen","Historiebrug","Læring pædagogik og undervisning","QR koder"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"qr kode løb i historie og samfundsfagsundervisningen","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://historielab.dk/qr-kode-loeb-i-historie-og-samfundsfagsundervisningen/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-659643","ids":["via-a7c3e0d2-a19b-4cdb-9392-d2be0b41f99b"],"keyword":["Læring, pædagogik og undervisning","QR-koder","bevægelse i undervisningen","historiebrug","legende element"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EDCB79C3F1F0AF14EC911DA22FC4A2CA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://historielab.dk/qr-kode-loeb-i-historie-og-samfundsfagsundervisningen/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Uddannelser, Læreruddannelsen, HF og FIF-kurser, Læreruddannelsen Skive alle fag"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Smedegaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"979be23f-372e-42c4-b96a-a4517db8f2e8","name":"Larsen, Henrik Smedegaard","orcid":"0000-0002-0881-9745","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["24464309"],"issue":"2022","journal":"RADAR - Historiedidaktisk Tidsskrift","pages":"1-8","publisher":"Nationalt Videnscenter for Historie- og Kulturformidling","status":"p","title":"RADAR - Historiedidaktisk Tidsskrift","title_org":"RADAR – Historiedidaktisk Tidsskrift","volume":"September"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["via-a7c3e0d2-a19b-4cdb-9392-d2be0b41f99b"],"src":["VIA University College"],"title":"QR-kode-løb i historie- og samfundsfagsundervisningen","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-659643","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
{"abstract":"The structure and cellular location make RNA susceptible to oxidation especially by reactive oxygen species generated in the cytosol. Oxidative modifications of RNA modify both protein synthesis and cellular signaling, which may have pathophysiological consequences given that observational studies have associated RNA oxidation positively with development of neurodegenerative and cardiovascular diseases. Until now, only limited literature has investigated the relationship between exercise and RNA oxidation. However, the current evidence suggests that RNA oxidation may increase to a minor extent immediately after exercise. Hereafter, a decreased RNA oxidation level has been observed, suggesting adaptative effects of exercise on RNA oxidation. In agreement, individuals that exercise regularly have lower RNA oxidation levels than individuals who do not exercise. The changes in oxidative RNA modifications following exercise seem different and more pronounced than changes in DNA modifications. Thus, effects of exercise on RNA oxidation may be important for cellular homeostasis and contribute to understanding the protective effects of exercise against neurodegenerative and cardiovascular diseases","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Emil List","Karstoft, Kristian","Poulsen, Henrik Enghusen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-670815"],"filters":{"added":"2023-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exercise and rna oxidation","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-670815","ids":["ku-b39b0245-a016-4158-9b3e-10519d0b99e0"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-AF32BA514E01C8E8113AEA1B3390B46F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Bispebjerg and Frederiksberg"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Clinical Pharmacology","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Emil List","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Emil List","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Kristian","key":"karstoftpau","last":"Karstoft","locid":"80f306e9-a560-493c-b7d4-4e18b694660f","name":"Karstoft, Kristian","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Henrik Enghusen","key":"poulsenpau","last":"Poulsen","locid":"8fb54acd-3a26-48f0-9111-b8e5535a0431","name":"Poulsen, Henrik Enghusen","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1201/9781003051619","eisbn":["9781003051619"],"publisher":"CRC Press","status":"p","title":"Oxidative Eustress in Exercise Physiology"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-b39b0245-a016-4158-9b3e-10519d0b99e0"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Exercise and RNA Oxidation","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-670815","year":"2022","yearsub":"2022"}
