{"abstract":"We perform a preliminary security analysis of the initial boot stage for the OpenTitan silicon root of trust, including formalisation and verification of relevant security goals using both bounded model checking and (unbounded) model checking. We further report on a potential vulnerability in the platform and show how it can be reproduced using formal modelling and argue that co-verification would be able to detect such vulnerabilities for high assurance projects.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Møller, Bjarke Hilmer","Søndergaard, Jacob Gosch","Jensen, Kristoffer Skagbæk","Pedersen, Magnus Winkel","Bøgedal, Tobias Worm","Christensen, Anton","Poulsen, Danny Bøgsted","Larsen, Kim Guldstrand","Hansen, Rene Rydhof","Rosted Jensen, Thomas","Juvoll Madsen, Heino","Uhrenfeldt, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-056753"],"event":{"end":"2021-11-30","place":"Virtual, Online","start":"2021-11-29","title":"26th Nordic Conference on Secure IT Systems, NordSec 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"corresponding_author":["Christensen, Anton"],"country":["China"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd."],"keyword":["Formal methods","Security"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"preliminary security analysis formalisation and verification of opentitan secure boot code","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=85119856071&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-056753","identifier":[{"id":"85119856071","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-16cec89e-036d-435c-a30e-f4b9ffcaf90e"],"keyword":["Co-verification","Formal m