{"abstract":"Flexible Query Answering Systems (FQAS) is a multidisciplinary research field at the crossroad of Information retrieval, databases, data mining, multimedia and geographic information systems, knowledge based systems, social networks, Natural Language Processing (NLP) and semantic web technologies, whose aim is to improve human ability to retrieve relevant information from databases, libraries, heterogeneous archives, the Web and the Web 2.0. The present paper has the objective to outline the perspectives and challenges offered by the heterogeneous panorama of current techniques.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Andreasen, Troels","De Tré, Guy","Kacprzyk, Janusz","Larsen, Henrik Legind","Bordogna, Gloria","Zadrożny, Sławomir"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-565107"],"event":{"end":"2021-09-24","place":"Bratislava, sk","start":"2021-09-19","title":"14th International Conference on Flexible Query Answering Systems, FQAS 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Belgium","Italy","Poland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Ghent University","National Research Council of Italy","Polish Academy of Sciences"],"keyword":["Data driven approaches","Model based approaches","Perspectives of flexible query answering"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Legind Technologies"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"perspectives and views of flexible query answering","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-565107","identifier":[{"id":"85115844823","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ruc-87ba2cee-1392-4fd8-a61c-f10a1d934ab1"],"keyword":["Data driven approaches","Model based approaches","Perspectives of flexible query answering"],"lang":"English","l