{"abstract":"A cryogenic coil for 13C human head imaging is developed, showing 1.90-fold SNR improvement over a room-temperature coil. Based on this coil design, a 4-channel cryogenic array is developed showing 1.54-fold SNR gain over a room-temperature array.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Wang, Wenjun","Sanchez, Juan Diego","Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-306510"],"event":{"end":"2021-05-20","place":"Online","start":"2021-05-15","title":"2021 ISMRM &amp; SMRT Annual Meeting &amp; Exhibition","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"towards a cryogenic rf coil array for sup 000000000013 sup c human head imaging first experience","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/265179985/ISMRM2021_WEWAN.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-306510","ids":["dtu-0669f176-27ad-4f0e-a327-bbb6c8d0635d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-374C38E550AC9984DD6CF8116D7E7AC4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/265179985/ISMRM2021_WEWAN.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Electromagnetic Systems","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance, Hyperpolarization & Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wenjun","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","locid":"21310cb6-dd90-4add-b43a-5ada0e7d9da9","name":"Wang, Wenjun","orcid":"0000-0001-7781-9856","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Juan Diego","key":"sanchezpau","last":"Sanchez","locid":"2d24121b-877e-4bfe-a434-9c7c3e7a34e0","name":"Sanchez, Juan Diego","orcid":"0000-0002-8201-4136","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vitaliy","key":"zhurbenkopau","last":"Zhurbenko","locid":"8449f428-fe8f-4ade-ad94-2e052869c1f4","name":"Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","orcid":"0000-0002-1515-733X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-0669f176-27ad-4f0e-a327-bbb6c8d0635d"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Towards a cryogenic RF coil array for <sup>13</sup>C human head imaging: first experience","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-306510","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Cloud-Radio Access Network (C-RAN) is seen as a key enabler of energy efficient mobile networks, as it limits the energy consumption at the cell site and provides capacity sharing for multiple cells. C-RAN splits the traditional mobile base station's functional composition into three units, connected by a fronthaul and midhaul network, which together with the backhaul network forms the crosshaul network. This work investigates the crosshaul network energy consumption by the use of network simulations. Network simulations are used to model a realistic user behavior, and provide information about network energy consumption in different scenarios. This work presents results from the simulation of a model implemented by different C-RAN functional compositions. The simulation results can predict the energy consumption in the crosshaul network under realistic application loads. Results illustrate that when scaling up the network, it is more energy efficient to use a functional composition with much processing before transmission on the cross haul network. Results show a 40 times variation in energy consumption among possible scenarios and thus, this work enlighten the importance of choosing the right functional split.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Larsen, Line Maria Pyndt","Ruepp, Sarah Renée","Berger, Michael Stübert","Christiansen, Henrik L."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-308957"],"event":{"end":"2021-12-08","place":"Melbourne, au","start":"2021-12-06","title":"17<sup>th</sup> IEEE International Conference on Green Computing and Communications","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-07","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Crosshaul","Ethernet","Fronthaul","Functional split","Green Networks"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"energy consumption modelling of next generation mobile crosshaul networks","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85127376687","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-308957","identifier":[{"id":"85127376687","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-0e878302-e3db-4e2e-8d4e-806205f7ea88"],"keyword":["Crosshaul","Ethernet","Fronthaul","Functional split","Green Networks","Midhaul"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-69D9D65C3772AFDCBB9624329359F20D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical and Photonics Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["TDC NET A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Line M.P.","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"e76034cd-61d0-43dd-8c6d-0aa95c672b80","name":"Larsen, Line Maria Pyndt","name_org":"Larsen, Line M.P.","orcid":"0000-0002-6402-5851","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sarah","key":"ruepppau","last":"Ruepp","locid":"92dfeab4-28ff-437d-9f5d-e7d8d6a67b93","name":"Ruepp, Sarah Renée","name_org":"Ruepp, Sarah","orcid":"0000-0003-0205-5067","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael S.","key":"berg