{"abstract":"The report is Denmark’s National Inventory Report 2021, which serves as documentation for the Danish greenhouse gas inventories submitted to the European Union and the United Nations. The report contains information on Denmark’s emission inventories for all years’ from 1990 to 2018 for CO2, CH4, N2O, HFCs, PFCs and SF6.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Winther, Morten","Nielsen, Malene","Gyldenkærne, Steen","Mikkelsen, Mette Hjorth","Albrektsen, Rikke","Thomsen, Marianne","Hjelgaard, Katja Hossy","Fauser, Patrik","Bruun, Henrik Gundorph","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Nord-Larsen, Thomas","Vesterdal, Lars","Stupak, Inge","Bentsen, Niclas Scott","Rasmussen, Erik","Petersen, Susanne Bødtker","Olsen, Tuperna Maliina","Hansen, Maria Gunnleivsdóttir"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-774091"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["CO2","Emission inventory","Greenhouse gases","IPCC","UNFCCC"],"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Danish Ministry of Climate, Energy and Utilities"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"denmark s national inventory report 000000002021 emission inventories 000000001990 000000002019 submitted under the united nations framework convention on climate change and the kyoto protocol","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR437.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-774091","ids":["au-f8188d11-c549-4eea-b5f7-a9d4e7dedf04"],"keyword":["CO2","Emission inventory","Greenhouse gases","IPCC","UNFCCC"],"lang":"English","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-709E54DEF819D7D713345B9103631C5B"],"oa_link":[{"access"