{"abstract":"Seksuel chikane er ikke blot et spørgsmål om, hvad person A gør imod person B. Det skal forstås i sin organisatoriske kontekst, og her spiller du som leder en afgørende rolle. Som leder er du nemlig både bærer af samt eksponent og ambassadør for den værdibaserede ledelse. Og det bliver kompliceret, når det gælder følsomme, ømtålelige områder som fx seksuel chikane. Læs her, hvordan de organisatoriske rammer har betydning for seksuel chikane, og hvad din rolle som leder er i det.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-291502"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fremmer jeres kultur seksuel chikane","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/fremmer-jeres-kultur-seksuel-chikane/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-291502","ids":["cbs-a9983883-746e-46c4-af67-575d52fedc71"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B80137C45BF64CD84E5F4B203E6274B8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/fremmer-jeres-kultur-seksuel-chikane/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["cbs-a9983883-746e-46c4-af67-575d52fedc71"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Fremmer jeres kultur seksuel chikane?","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-291502","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"This chapter investigates the responses of front-line managers and technicians to organisational change in a Scandinavian telecommunications company from a temporal perspective. Based on an ethnographic study in the company’s operations department 25 years after the privatisation of the company, it shows how temporal assumptions impacted managers’ and technicians’ responses to change and their experience of work life quality. Drawing on Bourdieu’s temporalisation of practice, the chapter unfolds an alternative understanding of time as both a structured and a structuring structure and it demonstrates how Bourdieu’s temporal epistemology offers an alternative theorisation of the responses of workers and managers to sweeping organisational change. The chapter asserts that the temporal dimension of Bourdieu’s work deserves more attention in organisation and management studies.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Koll, Henrik","Ernst, Jette"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-293787"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"caught between times explaining resistance to change through the tale of don quixote","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-293787","ids":["cbs-c1b6df30-fe74-42f2-869c-ab9d6fa37992"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-65D2229626789F10EE3FDF3B8D17CD2F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"kollpau","last":"Koll","locid":"894ea7b8-3c5e-4707-969c-e2c8a5043b31","name":"Koll, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-1019-1002","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jette","key":"ernstpau","last":"Ernst","name":"Ernst, Jette","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sarah","key":"robinsonpedh","last":"Robinson","name":"Robinson, Sarah","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jette","key":"ernstpedh","last":"Ernst","name":"Ernst, Jette","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kristian","key":"larsenpedh","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Kristian","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Ole","key":"jacobthomassenpedh","last":"Jacob Thomassen","name":"Jacob Thomassen, Ole","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9781003022510"],"isbn":["9780367893354"],"pages":"23-40","place":"Abingdon","publisher":"Routledge","status":"p","subtitle":"Societal Change and Transforming Fields","title":"Pierre Bourdieu in Studies of Organization and Management"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-c1b6df30-fe74-42f2-869c-ab9d6fa37992"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Caught between Times : Explaining Resistance to Change through the Tale of Don Quixote","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-293787","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
