","Non-Profit Organisations","Region Zealand","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-111b79dc-dcbb-4418-83ec-cfe332bf20a0","sdu-6c14a2e8-8332-4fd8-8c62-2bc782248965"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"MCM3 upregulation confers endocrine resistance in breast cancer and is a predictive marker of diminished tamoxifen benefit","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-040262","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Background: Venous thromboembolism (VTE) prophylaxis is much debated within total hip and knee arthroplasty (THA/TKA). Revision hip and knee arthroplasty (rTHA/rTKA) are more extensive procedures, but data on the risk of postoperative VTE is conflicting and there are no specific guidelines for thromboprophylaxis. Furthermore, data on rTHA/rTKA within a fast-track protocol is sparse. Thus, we aimed at evaluating the incidence and time course of VTE in unselected elective rTHA/rTKA within our established multicentre fast-track collaboration with in-hospital only thromboprophylaxis if length of stay (LOS) ≤ 5 days. Methods: We used an observational study design of unselected consecutive fast-track elective major component rTHA/rTKA from 6 dedicated fast-track centres between 2010 and 2018. We obtained information on revisions through Danish hip and knee arthroplasty registers and complete (>99%) 90 days follow-up through the Danish National Patient Registry in combination with chart review. Results: We included 2814 procedures with median LOS 3 days [2–5] and 21% had LOS >5 days. The 90-day incidence of VTE was 0.42% (n = 12), with 8 (0.28%) DVT and 4 (0.14%) PE, after median 14 days [IQR: 11–23] with the latest on day 31. Conclusion: The 90-day incidence of VTE after elective fast-track rTHA and rTKA was about 0.4% which is comparable to the 90-day VTE incidence after primary fast-track THA, TKA and unicompartmental knee arthroplasty. Future investigations should focus on identification of high-risk patients while the surgical trauma per se may be less important.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Petersen, Pelle Baggesgaard","Lindberg-Larsen, Martin","Jørgensen, Christoffer Calov","Kehlet, Henrik","Madsen, Frank","Hansen, Torben Bæk","Gromov, Kirill","Kjærsgaard-Andersen, Per","Solgaard, Soren","Bagger, Jens"],"cuid":["S03-085.72-024115"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"corpau":["Lundbeck Foundation Centre for Fast-track Hip and Knee Arthroplasty collaborating group"],"corresponding_author":["Petersen, Pelle Baggesgaard"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR"],"OT":["The Lundbeck Centre for fast‐track Hip and Knee Arthroplasty"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"venous thromboembolism after fast track elective revision hip and knee arthroplasty a multicentre cohort study of 000000002814 unselected consecutive procedures","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85099622156","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-085.72-024115","identifier":[{"id":"85099622156","type":"scopus"},{"id":"33485092","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-9ceb2b9a-886e-45a8-b99a-8ef6bd678c1e","ku-b7bb47de-25bf-4e4c-9f0b-ed1f8d775f99","sdu-e4cdad25-04bd-410b-89b9-d028923f8175"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-28BF4403940E0BA0DD237142C4B315A1"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU Un