{"abstract":"We propose a design concept for flexible human head coil arrays, where the array is built into a neoprene EEG cap, and made of regular-copper flexible wire. A 32-channel prototype for 13C at 3T (32.1 MHz) is presented and evaluated, showing SNR performance superior to a 13C-dedicated volume coil.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Sanchez, Juan Diego","Wang, Wenjun","Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-307924"],"event":{"end":"2021-05-20","place":"Online","start":"2021-05-15","title":"2021 ISMRM &amp; SMRT Annual Meeting &amp; Exhibition","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"flexible 000000000032 channel sup 000000000013 sup c mri head array an eeg lookalike design approach","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/265179537/ISMRM2021_JD2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-307924","ids":["dtu-0b12454f-78b5-4812-90aa-4f50f9819285"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3189E21099C1668C2DA7E1183FD90D43"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/265179537/ISMRM2021_JD2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance, Hyperpolarization & Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Juan Diego","key":"sanchezpau","last":"Sanchez","locid":"2d24121b-877e-4bfe-a434-9c7c3e7a34e0","name":"Sanchez, Juan Diego","orcid":"0000-0002-8201-4136","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wenjun","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","locid":"21310cb6-dd90-4add-b43a-5ada0e7d9da9","name":"Wang, Wenjun","orcid":"0000-0001-7781-9856","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vitaliy","key":"zhurbenkopau","last":"Zhurbenko","locid":"8449f428-fe8f-4ade-ad94-2e052869c1f4","name":"Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","orcid":"0000-0002-1515-733X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-0b12454f-78b5-4812-90aa-4f50f9819285"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Flexible 32-Channel <sup>13</sup>C MRI Head Array: An EEG-Lookalike Design Approach","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-307924","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"In this work, a design of an 8-element ultra-flexible array for 13C imaging is presented. The design is based on a compact low-noise preamplifier and includes 13C/1H active and passive decoupling. Due to flexibility, the array is easily adoptable to different parts of the body.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","Sanchez, Juan Diego","Wang, Wenjun","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-323859"],"event":{"end":"2021-05-20","place":"Online","start":"2021-05-15","title":"2021 ISMRM &amp; SMRT Annual Meeting &amp; Exhibition","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ultra flexible 000000000008 channel receive array for sup 000000000013 sup c imaging","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/265180101/ISMRM2021_LIC_final_OrbitReady.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-323859","ids":["dtu-40d0a538-fc92-45ae-8525-2f1e270e4f87"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-753376542E522AA3E617BDB8B3ADD37D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/265180101/ISMRM2021_LIC_final_OrbitReady.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Electromagnetic Systems","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance, Hyperpolarization & Metabolism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vitaliy","key":"zhurbenkopau","last":"Zhurbenko","locid":"8449f428-fe8f-4ade-ad94-2e052869c1f4","name":"Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","orcid":"0000-0002-1515-733X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Juan Diego","key":"sanchezpau","last":"Sanchez","locid":"2d24121b-877e-4bfe-a434-9c7c3e7a34e0","name":"Sanchez, Juan Diego","orcid":"0000-0002-8201-4136","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Wenjun","key":"wangpau","last":"Wang","locid":"21310cb6-dd90-4add-b43a-5ada0e7d9da9","name":"Wang, Wenjun","orcid":"0000-0001-7781-9856","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-40d0a538-fc92-45ae-8525-2f1e270e4f87"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Ultra-Flexible 8-Channel Receive Array for <sup>13</sup>C Imaging","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-323859","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Dissolution-DNP is a method to boost liquid-state NMR sensitivity by several orders of magnitude. The technique consists in hyperpolarizing samples by solid-state dynamic nuclear polarization at low temperature and moderate magnetic field, followed by an instantaneous melting and dilution of the sample happening inside the polarizer. Although the technique is well established and the outstanding signal enhancement paved the way towards many applications precluded to conventional NMR, the race to develop new methods allowing higher throughput, faster and higher polarization, and longer exploitation of the signal is still vivid. In this work, we review the most recent advances on dissolution-DNP methods trying to overcome the original technique's shortcomings. The review describes some of the new approaches in the field, first, in terms of sample formulation and properties, and second, in terms of instrumentation.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Pinon, Arthur César","Capozzi, Andrea","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-376277"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"keyword":["Cross polarization","Dynamic nuclear polarization","Hyperpolarization","dDNP"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hyperpolarization via dissolution dynamic nuclear polarization new technological and methodological advances","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/259473075/Hyperpolarization_via_dDNP_rev2_clean.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-376277","identifier":[{"id":"33185800","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85096018207","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-efa7d2b9-d08a-4894-9a0e-7055ceac5604"],"keyword":["Bullet-DNP","Cross-polarization","Cryogen-free","Dynamic nuclear polarization","Hyperpolarization","Non-persistent radicals","dDNP"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D70816684F5954C6D57ABE8FBE769E54"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/259473075/Hyperpolarization_via_dDNP_rev2_clean.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Centers, Center for Hyperpolarization in Magnetic Resonance","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Health Technology, Magnetic Resonance"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Arthur César","key":"pinonpau","last":"Pinon","locid":"646f6efc-6714-4f43-bbc4-3f1f7b4fe28f","name":"Pinon, Arthur César","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andrea","key":"capozzipau","last":"Capozzi","locid":"b0cf62b2-059b-44b4-bcf7-c10bdbeda7b9","name":"Capozzi, Andrea","orcid":"0000-0002-2306-9049","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["33185800"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s10334-020-00894-w","issn":["09685243","13528661"],"issn_o