{"abstract":"Natural logics are formal logics whose sentences resemble simplified natural language. As such they are suitable for knowledge bases. The offered logical proof rules apply directly to the natural logic sentences, ensuring explainability of query inferences. We describe a natural logic, NaturaLog, suited for ontology-structured knowledge bases, and explain how it can be implemented in a database system for conducting deductive querying.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Andreasen, Troels","Bulskov, Henrik","Nilsson, Jørgen Fischer"],"cuid":["S02-089.38-035138"],"event":{"end":"2021-09-24","place":"Bratislava, sk","start":"2021-09-19","title":"14th International Conference on Flexible Query Answering Systems, FQAS 2021","year":"2021"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Andreasen, Troels"],"keyword":["Deductive querying","Explainability","Natural logics"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"realization of a natural logic in a database system","src":["dtu","ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85115861884","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-089.38-035138","identifier":[{"id":"85115861884","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-6f2e7ba4-be43-47e9-8f52-92e0bd2d547a","ruc-35ce9b39-bfcf-4ff5-9b33-aae21a86d23c"],"keyword":["Deductive querying","Explainability","Natural logics"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-46E850EC2E385065C985FF6A42D82C66"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology","Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, Programming, Logic and Intelligent Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Algorithms and Logic"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Troels","key":"andreasenpau","last":"Andreasen","locid":"f31701bc-1bef-45ac-b9fa-3e931672bcd4","name":"Andreasen, Troels","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"bulskovpau","last":"Bulskov","locid":"8a99af70-eb39-45a5-bc5f-5a070b0299aa","name":"Bulskov, Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jørgen Fischer","key":"nilssonpau","last":"Nilsson","locid":"da831c67-15f1-47cb-9eba-85371dc55686","name":"Nilsson, Jørgen Fischer","orcid":"0000-0003-1263-7669","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Troels","key":"andreasenpedh","last":"Andreasen","name":"Andreasen, Troels","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Guy","key":"detrépedh","last":"De Tré","name":"De Tré, Guy","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Janusz","key":"kacprzykpedh","last":"Kacprzyk","name":"Kacprzyk, Janusz","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"legindlarsenpedh","last":"Legind Larsen","name":"Legind Larsen, Henrik","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Gloria","key":"bordognapedh","last":"Bordogna","name":"Bordogna, Gloria","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Sławomir","key":"zadrożnypedh","last":"Zadrożny","name":"Zadrożny, Sławomir","rank":9,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-86967-0_5","isbn":["9783030869663"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"54-66","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","title":"Flexible Query Answering Systems - 14th International Conference, FQAS 2021, Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85115861884"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-6f2e7ba4-be43-47e9-8f52-92e0bd2d547a","ruc-35ce9b39-bfcf-4ff5-9b33-aae21a86d23c"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Realization of a Natural Logic in a Database System","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-089.38-035138","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Background: Restless Legs Syndrome (RLS) is a neurological sensorimotor disorder that occurs in the evening and night, thereby often impacting quality of sleep in sufferers. The aetiology of RLS is not completely understood although iron dysregulation has been suggested as a likely pathway. The relationship between RLS and the iron regulatory protein hepcidin has not been studied in large cohorts. We aimed to assess whether an association between plasma hepcidin variation and RLS exists in a large cohort of healthy individuals. Methods: Plasma hepcidin levels were measured in 9708 Danish blood donors from the Danish Blood Donor Study all of whom correctly completed the validated Cambridge–Hopkins RLS-questionnaire for RLS assessment. Results: A total of 466 blood donors were determined as current RLS cases in the sample (4.8%). RLS cases had a significantly higher proportion of females (56.7% vs 46.7%; P < 0.001) and were older (median age [IQR] 40.6 years vs 38.0 years; P = 0.010) than controls. RLS cases were also more frequent smokers (P = 0.004). No significant differences were found in body mass index (BMI), alcohol consumption, time of donation and donation history between cases and controls. No difference in plasma hepcidin levels was observed between RLS cases and controls (median concentration [IQR]: 10.5 ng/ml [6.3–16.4] in RLS cases vs 10.5 ng/ml [6.0–16.5] in controls). Using a logistic regression model, we found that hepcidin levels were not associated with RLS after adjusting for age, sex, alcohol consumption, smoking status, donation time and donation history (OR = 1.00 [0.99–1.02] per 1 ng/ml increase of hepcidin; P = 0.429). Conclusion: Our study in Danish blood donors did not find an association between RLS and plasma hepcidin levels. Our findings suggest that plasma hepcidin's role as a potential diagnostic biomarker of RLS is inadequate.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Dowsett, Joseph","Didriksen, Maria","Larsen, Margit Hørup","Burgdorf, Kristoffer Sølvsten","Thørner, Lise Wegner","Sørensen, Erik","Erikstrup, Christian","Pedersen, Ole Birger","Ostrowski, Sisse Rye","Ullum, Henrik"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-017819"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Dowsett, Joseph"],"keyword":["Adult","Blood Donors","Denmark epidemiology","Female","Hepcidin","Hepcidins","Humans","Iron","RLS","Restless legs syndrome"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"no association between plasma hepcidin levels and restless legs syndrome results from the danish blood donor study","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.sleep.2021.10.008","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-017819","identifier":[{"id":"34736065","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85118331178","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-47023963-fe0f-4c8d-af96-d23b687610fe","ku-d2109cb2-e0be-4db5-8c63-aebd658784b6"],"keyword":["Adult","Blood Donors","Denmark/epidemiology","Female","Hepcidin","Hepcidins","Humans","Iron","RLS","Restless Legs Syndrome/epidemiology","Restless legs syndrome"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-70946099B09AFB486C80210D94480CD4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.sleep.2021.10.008","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/274448886/1_s2.0_S138994572100513X_main.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/305025965/No_association_between_plasma_hepcidin_levels_and_restless_legs.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Clinical Immunology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"region zealand","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-ZEA","l3nl":"Region Zealand","l3nn":"Region Zealand","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region Zealand","namevar":["Zealand University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-ZEA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Joseph","key":"dowsettpau","last":"Dowsett","locid":"ff31418e-30f5-4c51-ad13-1424ca51296e","name":"Dowsett, Joseph","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Maria","key":"didriksenpau","last":"Didriksen","locid":"f9b540ae-451e-487f-a608-fccd271e6533","name":"Didriksen, Maria","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Margit Hørup","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Margit Hørup","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Kristoffer Sølvsten","key":"burgdorfpau","last":"Burgdorf","name":"Burgdorf, Kristoffer Sølvsten","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Lise Wegner","key":"thørnerpau","last":"Thørner","name":"Thørner, Lise Wegner","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Erik","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, Erik","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"erikstruppau","last":"Erikstrup","locid":"523ae417-65a9-46aa-b665-0d88271dc0b9","name":"Erikstrup, Christian","orcid":"0000-0001-6551-6647","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 4","first":"Ole Birger","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"0d43956a-6e43-42d7-8b29-4505d03ea5c8","name":"Pedersen, Ole Birger","orcid":"0000-0003-2312-5976","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sisse Rye","key":"ostrowskipau","last":"Ostrowski","locid":"ba497828-2322-4b15-bfae-1e8a8c3895e7","name":"Ostrowski, Sisse Rye","orcid":"0000-0001-5288-3851","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"ullumpau","last":"Ullum","locid":"ef594d49-5aeb-4d32-80b4-4bfc281b5cbb","name":"Ullum, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-7306-9058","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["34736065"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.sleep.2021.10.008","issn":["13899457","18785506"],"issn_org":["13899457"],"journal":"Sleep Medicine","pages":"68-73","publisher":"Elsevier BV","publisher_org":"Elsevier B.V.","status":"p","title":"Sleep Medicine","volume":"88"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85118331178"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Region Zealand","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-47023963-fe0f-4c8d-af96-d23b687610fe","ku-d2109cb2-e0be-4db5-8c63-aebd658784b6"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"No association between plasma hepcidin levels and restless legs syndrome - results from the Danish Blood Donor Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-017819","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Maternal stressors during pregnancy are potential risk factors for asthma in offspring. However, previous studies have been limited by the use of self-reported data focusing on stressors either in private life or at work. This study examined the association between maternal stressors both in private life and at work during pregnancy and asthma in offspring. METHODS: In the Danish National Birth Cohort, 75 156 live-born singletons born during 1996-2002 were identified. Maternal information on job title were available around weeks 12-16 of gestation. Data on maternal bereavement, life-threatening illness, suicide attempt and alcohol or drug abuse of a close relative and offspring childhood asthma (3-10 years of age) were obtained from Danish nationwide registers. Maternal psychosocial work stressors (job control, psychological job demands, emotional job demands, work-related violence and threats of work-related violence) were estimated by the use of job-exposure matrices. The association between maternal stress and childhood asthma was analysed in Cox models adjusted for maternal age, comorbidity and parity. RESULTS: Neither private-life nor work stressors were related to onset of asthma in offspring. Separate analyses by parental atopy or onset of asthma in offspring supported the main findings. CONCLUSIONS: This study does not support an elevated risk of childhood asthma related to exposure to stress during pregnancy.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Pape, Kathrine","Liu, Xiaoqin","Sejbæk, Camilla Sandal","Andersson, Niklas Worm","Larsen, Ann Dyreborg","Bay, Hans","Kolstad, Henrik A.","Bonde, Jens Peter Ellekilde","Olsen, Jørn","Svanes, Cecilie","Hansen, Kirsten Skamstrup","Rugulies, Reiner","Hougaard, Karin Sørig","Schlünssen, Vivi"],"cuid":["S03-095.69-767737"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corres