{"abstract":"Rapporten gennemgår en række modeller til klimanormalisering af kvælstoftilførslen til havet og en ny metode til klimanormalisering anbefales.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Larsen, Søren Erik","Thodsen, Hans","Tornbjerg, Henrik","Windolf, Jørgen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-174001"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"klimanormalisering af kvælstofafstrømning","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR393.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-174001","ids":["au-4e76064d-fe14-474b-841d-0ade8f36296f"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E5AAAC1A1D8CB4FBB866B42193733BDA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR393.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Catchment Science and Environmental Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"fc89ca38-79d9-4781-a6b1-8394e722b334","name":"Larsen, Søren Erik","orcid":"0000-0001-8428-2065","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans","key":"thodsenpau","last":"Thodsen","locid":"32bff5cf-3478-427f-a25a-edc45f21b300","name":"Thodsen, Hans","orcid":"0000-0002-6542-4934","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"tornbjergpau","last":"Tornbjerg","locid":"673f9989-b651-4f14-8190-b60c45f9cde2","name":"Tornbjerg, Henrik","orcid":"0009-0008-7385-7490","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jørgen","key":"windolfpau","last":"Windolf","locid":"04de6e58-b8ca-4a60-95e7-849dde928efb","name":"Windolf, Jørgen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788771565164"],"issue":"393","pages":"33","place":"Aarhus","publisher":"Aarhus University, DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy","repno":"Videnskabelig rapport fra DCE - Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi, No. 393","series":"Videnskabelig rapport fra DCE - Nationalt Center for Miljø og Energi","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-4e76064d-fe14-474b-841d-0ade8f36296f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Klimanormalisering af kvælstofafstrømning","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-174001","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"The feed sector requires new sustainable sources of protein, and at the same time better waste management practices are required to decrease and upcycle post-consumers’ food waste (catering and organic household waste), which is currently used for energy production or discharged as waste. The production of Hermetia illucens larvae (L.) (BSFL) was conducted in 15 batches at pilot scale. Furthermore, a feeding strategy experiment was conducted to optimize feedings and decrease handling, followed by a digestibility study for assessing the applicability of BSFL as a feed ingredient. About 190 kg of food waste was used to produce 79 kg of BSFL. The bioconversion of food waste into BSFL was found to be highly efficient, with feed conversion rate (FCR) values ranging between 1.7 and 3.6, when assessed on dry matter. The feeding experiment showed similar BSFL and insect frass production as well as similar FCR, revealing that a decrease in handling can be obtained if two feeding episodes are used. The digestibility of protein and fat was high at 86.2 and 90.4% and revealed that BSFL meal can be successfully used as a protein and fat source in feed for carnivore animals outside the food chain (e.g., pet food).","author_count":5,"contributors":["Gligorescu, Anton","Fischer, Christian Holst","Larsen, Peter Foged","Nørgaard, Jan Værum","Heckman, Lars Henrik Lau"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-236161"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Gligorescu, Anton"],"keyword":["Circular economy","Feed application","Food waste","Insects","Sustainability","Upcycling"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"production and optimization of i hermetia illucens i l larvae reared on food waste and utilized as feed ingredient","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/su12239864","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-236161","identifier":[{"id":"85096578208","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-bb14648b-8019-4b90-8e49-9421172919ce"],"keyword":["Circular economy","Feed application","Food waste","Insects","Pilot production","Sustainability","Upcycling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4CD0A4418A15C5D886EDAA4E496E0D44"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/su12239864","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Animal and Veterinary Sciences, Department of Animal and Veterinary Sciences - ANIS Nutrition"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country