{"abstract":"Det er et dilemma at skulle hjælpe en medarbejder, som du er glad for, videre i karrieren, men det kan være nødvendigt. Det er også et dilemma, når du er nødt til at afskedige en medarbejder, som du ved vil have svært ved at finde et nyt arbejde.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik","Mogensen, Lilian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-289165"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000004 dilemmaer du skal tackle når medarbejdere stopper","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/4-dilemmaer-du-skal-tackle-naar-medarbejdere-stopper/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-289165","ids":["cbs-910bcb3b-9e46-4a10-9b0a-6060b58a9fb4"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-8945F4B31C7659C2D10011AD82CAE11A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/4-dilemmaer-du-skal-tackle-naar-medarbejdere-stopper/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau