{"abstract":"Dette års rapport beskriver status og udvikling i vandkemiske forhold i vandløb, stoftransport af kvælstof og fosfor til kystvandene for perioden før og under NOVANA – og frem til og med 2018. Ligeledes beskrives den tidslige udvikling i Dansk Vandløbs Fauna Indeks (DVFI) på cirka 250 tidsseriestationer for perioden 1994-2018.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Thodsen, Hans","Tornbjerg, Henrik","Rasmussen, Jes","Bøgestrand, Jens","Larsen, Søren Erik","Ovesen, Niels Bering","Blicher-Mathiesen, Gitte","Kjeldgaard, Ane","Windolf, Jørgen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-209558"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"com","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vandløb 000000002018 novana","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR353.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-209558","ids":["au-8caa1095-c2be-46c4-9fd1-99f99baa4a4e"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Commissioned","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-252EFAFC358ACACCE627C4F54F9B3D15"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/SR353.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Ecoscience, Department of Ecoscience - Catchment Science and Environmental Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Hans","key":"thodsenpau","last":"Thodsen","locid":"32bff5cf-3478-427f-a25a-edc45f21b300"