{"abstract":"Det sprog, vi bruger, når det handler om ledelse, er lige så afgørende som lagen i gammeldags modnede Christiansøsild. Ofte tænker vi ikke over sprogbrugen i ledelse, andre gange gør vi, bl.a. fordi sprog kan bruges til meget præcist at udtrykke, hvad det handler om, men også til at camouflere det. Artiklen præsenterer ti forskellige måder at bruge sproget på i ledelse.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-288834"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ud med sproget ledelsessprogets ti ansigter","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/ud-med-sproget-ledelsessprogets-ti-ansigter/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-288834","ids":["cbs-8d931b9f-2632-4f0e-92b1-b783cbc2bc90"],"keyword":["Kommunikere"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D6045D20FFDB1D8BD245B66E2508EF55"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/ud-med-sproget-ledelsessprogets-ti-ansigter/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid"