{"abstract":"I antologien Streaming for viderekomne undersøger tidsskriftet 16:9 og VIA Film & Transmedia streaminglandskabet anno 2020. Bogen indeholder bidrag fra en lang række film- og tv-eksperter som eksempelvis Vilde Schanke Sundet, Amanda D. Lotz, Andreas Halskov, Christian Monggaard og Jakob Isak Nielsen og behandler en række af tidens mest interessante tendenser og værker.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Halskov, Andreas","Højer, Henrik","Korsgaard, Mathias Bonde","Larsen, Thomas Schwartz","Nielsen, Jakob Isak"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-658390"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Medier kommunikation og sprog"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"streaming for viderekomne fra doggystyle til black mirror og the jinx","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.16-9.dk/2020/03/streaming-for-viderekomne/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-658390","ids":["via-7b8eed44-3f83-4c56-89fd-747f41b6d83f"],"keyword":["Medier, kommunikation og sprog"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C0E47656B5955004DD76DA5B91EE047A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forsk.center Kreative erhverv og professioner","VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for teknologi og erhverv, Program for film og transmedia"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Andreas","key":"halskovped","last":"Halskov","name":"Halskov, Andreas","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"højerped","last":"Højer","locid":"14db21da-b74d-4b3d-b602-9331d253ee5e","name":"Højer, Henrik","orcid":"0009-0008-6378-3440","rank":2,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mathias Bonde","key":"korsgaardped","last":"Korsgaard","name":"Korsgaard, Mathias Bonde","rank":3,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Schwartz","key":"larsenped","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Thomas Schwartz","rank":4,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jakob Isak","key":"nielsenped","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Jakob Isak","rank":5,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788793709683"],"pages":"255","place":"Aarhus","publisher":"16:9 bøger og VIA Film and Transmedia","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Universities","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["via-7b8eed44-3f83-4c56-89fd-747f41b6d83f"],"src":["VIA University College"],"title":"Streaming for viderekomne : fra Doggystyle til Black Mirror og The Jinx","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-658390","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Arbejdet med indeklima i REBUS spænder vidt og omfatter både kortlægning af de centrale parametre, der bør indgå ved vurdering af indeklima samt kvantificering og håndtering af parametrene fx ved måling og registrering eller ved brug af spørgeskema. Herudover udvikles et værktøj til vurdering af indeklimaet, IK-kompas, og i sammenhæng med dette en metode til indeklimaklassificering. Arbejdet og de løsninger, der udvikles i forbindelse hermed, er alle målrettet almene boliger som udgangspunkt, men vil på et senere tidspunkt kunne videreudvikles til andre bygningstyper. I forlængelse af arbejdet med indeklima udarbejdes der desuden en SBi-anvisning om indeklimaforbedringer ved renovering. Resultaterne fra arbejdet med indeklima i REBUS skal danne baggrund for dialogen med relevante myndigheder og andre interessenter ifm. implementering, så det sikres at resultaterne bruges fremadrettet til fremme af det gode indeklima også efter REBUS-projektets ophør i fx Bygningsreglement 2020 eller andre relevante steder. Denne rapport er én ud af tre rapporter, udgivet i forbindelse med arbejdet gennemført under arbejdspakke WP2a.3A - Definition af indeklimaaspekter og –parametre, som er den første arbejdspakke af i alt 6 arbejdspakker, der alle omhandler indeklima. Arbejdet i denne delopgave har resulteret i identifikation og definition af de centrale parametre og indeklimaaspekter, der skal beskrive den indeklimamæssige kvalitet i det fremadrettede arbejde med indeklima og totalværdi i REBUS. Resultaterne fra arbejdet er: - En nettoliste med centrale indeklimaparametre, beskrevet i denne rapport. - Et kort spørgeskema til evaluering af det oplevede indeklima blandt lejere i almene boliger før og efter en renovering af deres boliger, beskrevet i rapporten ”Oplevet indeklima”. (Knudsen et al., 2017) - En række testscenarier for kommunikation til brugerne målrettet en forbedret indeklimamæssig brugeradfærd, beskrevet i rapporten ”Brugerkommunikation – vejen til et bedre indeklima?” (Larsen and Knudsen, 2017) Arbejdet er målrettet vurdering af indeklimaet i boliger før og efter renovering med henblik på forbedringer, men værktøj og metode kan også benyttes til vurdering af indeklima i nybyggeri. Spørgeskemaet og testscenarierne vil senere blive anvendt og evalueret via feltstudier i en række almene boliger, som en del af REBUS. 2. udgave af denne rapport er udgivet i december 2020. I 2. udgave er kun afsnit vedrørende akustik revideret. De øvrige afsnit er de samme som 1. udgave fra 2017.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Larsen, Tine Steen","Clausen, Geo","Bekö, Gabriel","Heebøll, Anna","Witterseh, Thomas","Hellgren, Eva","Knudsen, Henrik Nellemose","Mortensen, Lone Hedegaard","Rasmussen, Birgit"],"cuid":["S02-086.34-002627"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Gyproc, Saint Gobain"],"keyword":["Indeklima","Indeklimaklassificering","Parametere"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"centrale parametre til karakterisering af bygningers indeklima","src":["aau","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/267390190/Centrale_parametre_til_karakterisering_af_bygningers_indeklima.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-086.34-002627","ids":["aau-348c226d-20e3-4022-97a2-57a602fb87e0","dtu-7766edd0-b290-49f6-b352-b513aeb6eadc"],"keyword":["Indeklima","Indeklimaklassificering","Parametere"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-46CFD2957F15FCA02AA1FF41D4096736"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/267390190/Centrale_parametre_til_karakterisering_af_bygningers_indeklima.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/408813059/Centrale_parametre_til_karakterisering_af_bygningers_indeklima.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Energy in Buildings Research Group (Civil)","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of Civil Engineering, Indoor Environment and Sustainable Buildings Research Group","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Division of Architectural Engineering","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science, Department of the Built Environment, Indoor Environmental Quality and Building Systems Research Group"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Civil Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Civil Engineering, Indoor Environment"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"se","key":"gyproc saint gobain","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Gyproc, Saint Gobain","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Saint-Gobain Denmark A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tine Steen","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"6f4c1acc-34db-423a-9567-359fc381a0c4","name":"Larsen, Tine Steen","orcid":"0000-0002-4704-6503","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Geo","key":"clausenpau","last":"Clausen","locid":"a58e65d4-0b1f-4884-b61e-07644d646a8d","name":"Clausen, Geo","orcid":"0000-0003-3544-8967","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Gabriel","key":"beköpau","last":"Bekö","locid":"c4ad7184-0df3-48b9-8ef0-fc51d4cadfaf","name":"Bekö, Gabriel","orcid":"0000-0001-6107-8336","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Anna","key":"heebøllpau","last":"Heebøll","name":"Heebøll, Anna","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"wittersehpau","last":"Witterseh","name":"Witterseh, Thomas","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4 5","corresponding":null,"first":"Eva","key":"hellgrenpau","last":"Hellgren","name":"Hellgren, Eva","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik N.","key":"knudsenpau","last":"Knudsen","locid":"7f5e707b-235a-4e71-ae71-e9278e7aa2ba","name":"Knudsen, Henrik Nellemose","name_org":"Knudsen, Henrik N.","orcid":"0000-0002-3196-7279","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lone Hedegaard","key":"mortensenpau","last":"Mortensen","locid":"0ff7f3d2-9a6d-4bb7-8058-ef01f5c50450","name":"Mortensen, Lone Hedegaard","orcid":"0000-0003-3792-4891","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Birgit","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"b9de7fa2-9ee2-4dc7-9fe6-696d2a6a7e3a","name":"Rasmussen, Birgit","orcid":"0000-0002-9567-2680","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"72","place":"København","publisher":"Realdania Byg","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All GTS Institutes","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-GTS-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","GTS Institutes","Other Companies","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","saint-gobain denmark a/s"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-348c226d-20e3-4022-97a2-57a602fb87e0","dtu-7766edd0-b290-49f6-b352-b513aeb6eadc"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Centrale parametre til karakterisering af bygningers indeklima","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-086.34-002627","year":"2020","yearsub":2021}
{"abstract":"PURPOSE: Calibration of hyperpolarized 13 C-MRI is limited by the low signal from endogenous carbon-containing molecules and consequently requires 13 C-enriched external phantoms. This study investigated the feasibility of using either 23 Na-MRI or 1 H-MRI to calibrate the 13 C excitation. METHODS: Commercial 13 C-coils were used to estimate the transmit gain and center frequency for 13 C and 23 Na resonances. Simulations of the transmit B1 profile of a Helmholtz loop were performed. Noise correlation was measured for both nuclei. A retrospective analysis of human data assessing the use of the 1 H resonance to predict [1-13 C]pyruvate center frequency was also performed. In vivo experiments were undertaken in the lower limbs of 6 pigs following injection of hyperpolarized 13 C-pyruvate. RESULTS: The difference in center frequencies and transmit gain between tissue 23 Na and [1-13 C]pyruvate was reproducible, with a mean scale factor of 1.05179 ± 0.00001 and 10.4 ± 0.2 dB, respectively. Utilizing the 1 H water peak, it was possible to retrospectively predict the 13 C-pyruvate center frequency with a standard deviation of only 11 Hz sufficient for spectral-spatial excitation-based studies. CONCLUSION: We demonstrate the feasibility of using the 23 Na and 1 H resonances to calibrate the 13 C transmit B1 using commercially available 13 C-coils. The method provides a simple approach for in vivo calibration and could improve clinical workflow.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Grist, James T","Søvsø Szocska Hansen, Esben","Sánchez-Heredia, Juan D","McLean, Mary A","Tougaard, Rasmus Stilling","Riemer, Frank","Schulte, Rolf F","Kaggie, Joshua D","Ardenkjaer-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Laustsen, Christoffer","Gallagher, Ferdia A"],"cuid":["S02-095.94-027932"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Grist, James T."],"country":["Germany","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","GE Healthcare","GE Healthcare Germany","University of Birmingham","University of Cambridge"],"keyword":["Calibration","Carbon 13","Hyperpolarized","MRI"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"creating a clinical platform for carbon 000000000013 studies using the sodium 000000000023 and proton resonances","src":["au","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/mrm.28238","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-095.94-027932","identifier":[{"id":"85081740826","type":"scopus"},{"id":"32167199","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC8638662","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-d26ad5bf-e247-4ee0-a61f-90dfe96db497","dtu-4cdf53f3-d904-4f93-a1e5-8b6c3617d34a"],"keyword":["MRI","calibration","carbon-13","hyperpolarized","sodium-23"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-0E7662607E5CECD2B7D7DDB81562A283"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/220332293/mrm.28238.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/mrm.28238","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/235535066/mrm.28238.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"gb","key":"university of cambridge","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Cambridge","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"university of birmingham","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University 