{"abstract":"MUS er gået fra at være en snævert fokuseret uddannelsessamtale til et helhedspræget serviceeftersyn af samspillet mellem medarbejder, dennes job, lederen og de organisatoriske rammebetingelser. Men hvad er det så, der får nogle kritikere til at varsle MUS-samtalernes snarlige død?","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-299767"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mus en truet dyreart eller et livskraftigt ledelsesværktøj","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/mus-en-truet-dyreart-eller-et-livskraftigt-ledelsesvaerktoej/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-299767","ids":["cbs-fef0d7aa-4c22-4d42-9844-5f1f82e8ccc9"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F8907341F6A8D043FE6E77B5BD7E90D3"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/mus-en-truet-dyreart-eller-et-livskraftigt-ledelsesvaerktoej/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["cbs-fef0d7aa-4c22-4d42-9844-5f1f82e8ccc9"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"MUS: En truet dyreart – eller et livskraftigt ledelsesværktøj?","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-299767","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Biological membranes have distinct geometries that confer specific functions. However, the molecular mechanisms underlying the phenomenological geometry/function correlations remain elusive. We studied the effect of membrane geometry on the localization of membrane-bound proteins. Quantitative comparative experiments between the two most abundant cellular membrane geometries, spherical and cylindrical, revealed that geometry regulates the spatial segregation of proteins. The measured geometry-driven segregation reached 50-fold for membranes of the same mean curvature, demonstrating a crucial and hitherto unaccounted contribution by Gaussian curvature. Molecular-field theory calculations elucidated the underlying physical and molecular mechanisms. Our results reveal that distinct membrane geometries have specific physicochemical properties and thus establish a ubiquitous mechanistic foundation for unravelling the conserved correlations between biological function and membrane polymorphism.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Larsen, Jannik","Rosholm, Kadla R.","Kennard, Celeste","Pedersen, Søren Ljungberg","Munch, Henrik Kofoed","Tkach, Vadym","Sakon, John J.","Bjornholm, Thomas","Weninger, Keith R.","Bendix, Pól Martin","Jensen, Knud Jørgen","Hatzakis, Nikos S.","Uline, Mark J.","Stamou, Dimitrios"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-418513"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Columbia University","North Carolina State University"],"keyword":["AMPHIPATHIC HELICES","CELL","DOMAIN","INDUCE","Localization","Mechanisms","Synaptotagmin"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how membrane geometry regulates protein sorting independently of mean curvature","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"http://europepmc.org/Copyright","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7379390/pdf/oc0c00419.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-418513","identifier":[{"id":"32724850","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC7379390","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85087858122","type":"scopus"},{"id":"000555422900020","type":"wos"}],"ids":["ku-2a0682c9-5f91-4b73-9758-01fdaa5c9645"],"keyword":["AMPHIPATHIC HELICES","AMPHIPHYSIN","CELL","DOMAIN","INDUCE","LOCALIZATION","MECHANISMS","SYNAPTOTAGMIN"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DBD90C498AAD936A1C2D629ACEDB45F4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"http://europepmc.org/Copyright","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7379390/pdf/oc0c00419.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Chemistry, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"columbia university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Columbia University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"north carolina state university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"North Carolina State University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jannik B.","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"f7e25c4d-2ba7-4adc-a4a0-70963b98dccf","name":"Larsen, Jannik","name_org":"Larsen, Jannik B.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Kadla R.","key":"rosho