{"abstract":"Mange COVID-19 patienter har eller får brug for genoptræning og rehabilitering. Der er meget svagt evidensgrundlag for konkrete anbefalinger til rehabiliteringen, men Dansk Selskab for Fysioterapi (DSF) har med hjælp fra Dagmar Sieg fra Dansk Selskab for Hjerte- og Lungefysioterapi (DSHL) afdækket evidensen og sammenholder den med evidens fra indsatserne med nært beslægtede sygdomme som SARS, MERS, ARDS og KOL.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Larsen, Lars Henrik","Sieg, Dagmar"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-650355"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Corona","Covid 19","Rehabilitering","Sygdom sundhedsvidenskab og sygepleje"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Heartfit"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"covid 000000000019 rehabilitering evidens og anbefalinger","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.danskselskabforfysioterapi.dk/siteassets/dokumenter/de-faglige-selskaber/dsf/covi19/sieg-og-larsen-covid-19-rehabilitering-evidens-og-anbefalinger-2020.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-650355","ids":["ucn-1efb14fe-9914-446c-8775-e0af278cfaac"],"keyword":["COVID-19","Rehabilitering","Sygdom, sundhedsvidenskab og sygepleje","corona"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-FB794F82858B42F356620D739FEE6035"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.danskselskabforfysioterapi.dk/siteassets/dokumenter/de-faglige-selskaber/dsf/covi19/sieg-og-larsen-covid-19-rehabilitering-evidens-og-anbefalinger-2020.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN Velfærd, Fysioterapeutuddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Heartfit"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Henrik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"a997ad4d-e8d1-47b2-8b96-d5b9b748e4c5","name":"Larsen, Lars Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-7830-1186","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Dagmar","key":"siegpau","last":"Sieg","name":"Sieg, Dagmar","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"50","publisher":"Dansk Selskab for Fysioterapi","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","University College of Northern Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucn-1efb14fe-9914-446c-8775-e0af278cfaac"],"src":["UCN University College of Northern Denmark"],"title":"COVID-19 Rehabilitering : Evidens og anbefalinger","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-650355","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Introduction: The aim of this study was to assess the inter-rater reliability of selected static, semi-dynamic, and dynamic test assessment methods for evaluation of scapular positioning and function. Methods: A standardized three-phase (i.e. training, overall agreement, and actual study) protocol for reliability studies was applied on 41 overhead sports participants, aged 18–56 (22 with obvious scapular winging, classified as visibility of the medial or inferior angle border of scapula). Ten scapular test assessment methods (two static, three semi-dynamic, and five dynamic) were evaluated. Results: Bland–Altman plots showed no funnel effects, although systematic bias and significant differences between raters were present in three of the methods. ICC values ranged from 0.71 to 0.80 for the static test assessment methods and from 0.25–0.92 for the semi-dynamic test assessment methods. Three of the five dynamic test assessment methods had ICCs of 0.47–0.68. For the two remaining dynamic test assessment methods, kappa varied between −0.034 and 0.71. Using PABAK, kappa increased to 0.54–0.86. Conclusion: Four scapular test assessment methods (Upper horizontal distance, Lower horizontal distance at max shoulder flexion, Acromial distance, and Winging scapula) showed satisfactory inter-rater reliability. Simple visual observational methods and quantitative distance measurements have better reliability between clinicians than more complex measurements and may be better suited for use in clinical practice.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Larsen, Camilla Marie","Søgaard, Karen","Eshoj, Henrik","Ingwersen, Kim Gordon","Juul-Kristensen, Birgit"],"cuid":["S02-085.71-048664"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Reliability","Scapular dyskinesis","Scapular function","Scapular position"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-SDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCL"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-UCL"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"clinical assessment methods for scapular position and function an inter rater reliability study","src":["sdu","ucl"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-UCL"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/09593985.2019.1579284","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-085.71-048664","identifier":[{"id":"85063625248","type":"scopus"},{"id":"30924383","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-223fff84-1902-4775-94e7-98160321e0df","ucl-867f3c0f-5e75-4bbc-ad2a-0c0753068282"],"keyword":["Reliability","clinical test assessment method","scapular dyskinesis","scapular function","scapular position"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-E9505099A7BA2CE7448AB3DC694DF1D0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Andet","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/09593985.2019.1579284","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics, Research Unit of Musculoskeletal Function and Physiotherapy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ucl university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCL","l3nl":"UCL University College","l3nn":"UCL University Col