"name":"Weber, Britta","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["31368215"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/jmri.26888","issn":["10531807","15222586"],"issn_org":["10531807"],"issue":"3","journal":"Journal of Magnetic Resonance Imaging","pages":"961-963","publisher":"John Wiley and Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Journal of Magnetic Resonance Imaging","volume":"51"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85070091896"],"sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","North Denmark Region","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-11afb093-75cf-4363-b0ee-99f88c8bfba9","au-25821c19-468b-44ed-bd96-fc3d065ffb9d","dtu-1b7dc38c-bc65-423d-a8b8-a8889feec023"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","AU Aarhus University","DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Pilot Study Experiences With Hyperpolarized [1-<sup>13</sup>C]pyruvate MRI in Pancreatic Cancer Patients","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-089.98-000923","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"The predominant indications for revision surgery after total hip (THA) or knee arthroplasty (TKA) are an aseptic failure (AF) and prosthetic joint infection (PJI). Accurate diagnosis is crucial. Therefore, we evaluated prospectively a multidisciplinary diagnostic algorithm including multi-modal radionucleid imaging (RNI) and extended microbiological diagnostics. If the surgeon suspected PJI or AF, revision surgery was performed with multiple samples obtained in parallel for special culture procedures and later molecular analyses. Alternatively, if the underlying cause was not evident, RNI was scheduled comprising 99Tc – HDP SPECT/CT, 111In-labeled white blood cells combined with 99Tc-nanocoll bone marrow SPECT/CT, and 18F-FDG PET/CT. A multidisciplinary clinical team made a recommendation on the indication for a diagnostic procedure guided by RNI images or revision surgery. A total of 156 patients with 163 arthroplasties were included. Fifty-five patients underwent RNI. In all, 118 revision surgeries were performed in 112 patients: 71 on the indication of AF and 41 revision of PJI. Thirty-four patients were concluded with chronic pain, and revision surgery refrained. The effective median follow-up period was 13 months. A structured approach offered by the algorithm was useful for the clinician in the evaluation of patients with a failing TKA or THA. Surgical revision was possibly obviated in approximately 20% of patients where an explanation or cause of failure was not found. The algorithm served as an effective tool.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Khalid, Vesal","Schønheyder, Henrik Carl","Larsen, Lone Heimann","Nielsen, Poul Torben","Kappel, Andreas","Thomsen, Trine Rolighed","Aleksyniene, Ramune","Lorenzen, Jan","Ørsted, Iben","Simonsen, Ole","Jordal, Peter Lüttge","Rasmussen, Sten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-104971"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Algorithm","Diagnosis","Infection","Prosthesis"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"multidisciplinary diagnostic algorithm for evaluation of patients presenting with a prosthetic problem in the hip or knee a prospective study","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/diagnostics10020098","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-104971","identifier":[{"id":"85081240461","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-bd6cd914-bcc3-45a6-b1a6-34c634c74c6f"],"keyword":["Algorithm","Diagnosis","Infection","Prosthesis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D38172C25944F39C1A98523D50B531C4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/diagnostics10020098","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY 4.0","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/322454947/Khalid_et_al_2020_Multidisciplinary_Diagnostic_Algorithm_for_Evaluation_of_Patients_Presenting_with_a_Prosthetic_Problem_in_the_Hip_or_Knee.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Department of Orthopaedic Surgery","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Hoved-Orto","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Vesal","key":"khalidpau","last":"Khalid","locid":"c5d6d87f-9cbb-42b4-b20d-26b2a2b89b14","name":"Khalid, Vesal","orcid":"0000-0001-5507-0645","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Carl","key":"schønheyderpau","last":"Schønheyder","locid":"d35b264a-6efc-467d-ac9d-e558542ef8a8","name":"Schønheyder, Henrik Carl","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lone Heimann","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"9f22747b-7a91-42b6-94ea-866d8c78c7e0","name":"Larsen, Lone Heimann","orcid":"0000-0001-5639-4449","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Poul Torben","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"86b36233-dca4-4a54-b791-febbe6161c2f","name":"Nielsen, Poul Torben","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andreas","key":"kappelpau","last":"Kappel","locid":"8c042227-bd3b-4e95-a0b2-fa2dfdd79328","name":"Kappel, Andreas","orcid":"0000-0001-8385-3567","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Trine Rolighed","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"2a598ca5-d398-4f6f-a07a-e27982669ee8","name":"Thomsen, Trine Rolighed","orcid":"0000-0002-7393-9372","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ramune","key":"aleksynienepau","last":"Aleksyniene","locid":"98e5cb42-1b47-49a5-b4b1-5bc624e83778","name":"Alek