st Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Tonje","key":"voldpedh","last":"Vold","name":"Vold, Tonje","rank":15,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9783110636628"],"isbn":["9783110629545"],"publisher":"De Gruyter","status":"p","title":"Libraries, Archives and Museums as Democratic Spaces in a Digital Age"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-9819ecc3-a2b3-4715-b399-955a7f3243f8"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Physical Places and Virtual Spaces. Libraries, Archives and Museums in a Digital Age","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-484350","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Anvendelse af matematisk software i gymnasieundervisningen har længe befundet sig i et skisma mellem matematikfaglig degeneration og progressive anvendelser. I artiklen skildres en efteruddannelsesmodel som eksplicit adresserer dilemmaet. Ud fra et aktionsforskningsgrundlag bygges på deltagende matematiklæreres engagement i at inddrage computere uden at ofre den matematiske kernefaglighed som gymnasieuddannelserne sigter mod. Vi redegør for det didaktiske fundament og en virksomhedsteoretisk forståelsesramme for modellens implementering af computere i matematikundervisningen. Vi illustrerer modellen gennem eksemplariske deltagerforløb som afdækker fundamentale vilkår, og som peger på at efteruddannelse og erfaringsdeling vedrørende brug af matematisk software vil være et påtrængende behov, også i fremtiden.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Bang, Henrik Peter","Grønbæk, Niels","Larsen, Claus Richard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-504557"],"filters":{"added":"2022-03","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Christianshavns Gymnasium"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"efteruddannelse i cas erfaringer fra fire år med cmu","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-504557","ids":["ku-ba27ad79-40d4-4afe-9fea-3d8872a08654"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-05EFE07CFDC5F146B598AD5DC3047C57"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Christianshavns Gymnasium"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Mathematical Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik Peter","key":"bangpau","last":"Bang","name":"Bang, Henrik Peter","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Niels","key":"grønbækpau","last":"Grønbæk","locid":"92b1622e-630d-49e3-a623-55c283a2db0f","name":"Grønbæk, Niels","orcid":"0000-0003-3022-856X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Claus Richard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Claus Richard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["16048628","22458948"],"issn_org":["16048628"],"issue":"4","journal":"MONA - Matematik- og Naturfagsdidaktik","pages":"26-45","status":"p","title":"MONA - Matematik- og Naturfagsdidaktik","volume":"2020"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-ba27ad79-40d4-4afe-9fea-3d8872a08654"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Efteruddannelse i CAS – erfaringer fra fire år med CMU","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-504557","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Mesophilic starter cultures, such as Lactococcus lactis, are exposed to NaCl stress during brining of cheeses influencing their viability. We investigated the effect of NaCl water solutions, used at concentrations of 3.4%, 8.0% and 15% (w/v), on viability of Lc. lactis subsp. cremoris, Lc. lactis subsp. lactis biovar. diacetylactis and Lc. lactis subsp. lactis isolated from commercial DL-starter cultures. Viability was assessed by plate counts and flow cytometry. Bacterial viability decreased with increased concentration of NaCl in a strain-dependent manner (between 0.02% and 62% cfu at 15% (w/v) NaCl, compared with controls at 0.85% (w/v) NaCl), whereas no significant differences were detected between the subspecies. Viability levels determined by plate counts were generally lower than by flow cytometry, indicating the presence of viable but not culturable cells. Knowledge of salt tolerance of Lc. lactis strains would enable rational selection of starter cultures targeting production of cheeses with different NaCl content.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Søndergaard, Lise","Siegumfeldt, Henrik","Larsen, Nadja","Jespersen, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-528422"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"diversity in nacl tolerance of i lactococcus lactis i strains from dl starter cultures for production of semi hard cheeses","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-528422","identifier":[{"id":"85080056113","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-e1f22a47-ac99-4302-8e7a-768abefd7bfd"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-242916804AFA5A367FC61089402B553F"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Food Science, Food Microbiology, Gut Health, and Fermentation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Lise Søndergaard","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"a6f96b85-6e55-43d6-826b-640f456446ad","name":"Søndergaard, Lise","name_org":"Kristensen, Lise Søndergaard","orcid":"0000-0002-0345-6017","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"siegumfeldtpau","last":"Siegumfeldt","locid":"226d4f17-16db-479e-9691-0c142f8f7b3a","name":"Siegumfeldt, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0003-2718-9280","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Nadja","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"be39c304-b5b1-4ff3-bef0-a00768b752d3","name":"Larsen, Nadja","orcid":"0000-0002-5899-4883","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lene","key":"jespersenpau","last":"Jespersen","locid":"a156c6e3-9562-4d35-9305-53a39c62e076","name":"Jespersen, Lene","orcid":"0000-0002-2555-5948","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.idairyj.2020.104673","issn":["09586946","18790143"],"issn_org":["09586946"],"journal":"International Dairy Journal","paperid":"104673","status":"p","title":"International Dairy Journal","volume":"105"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85080056113"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-e1f22a47-ac99-4302-8e7a-768abefd7bfd"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Diversity in NaCl tolerance of <i>Lactococcus lactis</i> strains from DL-starter cultures for production of semi-hard cheeses","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-528422","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"author_count":4,"contributors":["Siersbæk, Julie","Larsen, Annette Rønholt","Nybo, Mads","Christesen, Henrik Thybo"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-578947"],"event":{"end":"2020-03-31","start":"2020-03-28","title":"ENDO Online 2020","year":"2020"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"plasma insulin measured with a sensitive immunoassay may establish the diagnosis of congenital hyperinsulinism without further testing","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1210/jendso/bvaa046.1738","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-578947","ids":["sdu-14187009-aa3f-44e1-ad1a-4d09470291c6"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-578C69E7A99166476BE76500ADF744CB"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1210/jendso/bvaa046.1738","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Paediatrics (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Julie","key":"siersbækpau","last":"Siersbæk","locid":"45d9f523-f1d2-4651-b49c-bebccb801571","name":"Siersbæk, Julie","orcid":"0000-0003-0576-9751","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Annette","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"13f24d4f-41ec-48ad-862e-95fcf5b03f67","name":"Larsen, Annette Rønholt","name_org":"Larsen, Annette","orcid":"0000-0002-7105-4028","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads","key":"nybopau","last":"Nybo","locid":"07102aee-a067-4485-98cc-76c2c060effe","name":"Nybo, Mads","orcid":"0000-0002-3029-2855","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"thybochristesenpau","last":"Thybo Christesen","locid":"c8317e72-7a09-4c80-81e9-b69855b68e8f","name":"Christesen, Henrik Thybo","name_org":"Thybo Christesen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-5330-6853","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1210/jendso/bvaa046.1738","issn":["24721972"],"issue":"Suppl. 1","journal":"Journal of the Endocrine Society","paperid":"MON-111","publisher":"The Endocrine Society","publisher_org":"The/Endocrine Society","status":"p","title":"Journal of the Endocrine Society","volume":"4"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-14187009-aa3f-44e1-ad1a-4d09470291c6"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Plasma Insulin Measured with a Sensitive Immunoassay May Establish the Diagnosis of Congenital Hyperinsulinism Without Further Testing","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-578947","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Purpose: The purpose of this study is to explore the lived experiences of patients in terms of eating and consequences in everyday life in the first year after oesophageal cancer surgery. Methods: Thirteen patients participated in qualitative interviews one year after surgery for oesophageal cancer. Descriptions capturing the meaning of the lived experiences of patients were then derived from subsequent analysis and interpretation of the interviews. A phenomenological hermeneutical approach comprised the epistemological stance, and theoretical perspectives were drawn from Schutz’ theory of everyday life. Results: Patient descriptions of their experiences with food, eating and everyday life in the first year after oesophageal cancer surgery fell into four themes: Adjusting to a different anatomy – food and eating as a dominant and difficult activity; changed body – food and eating as an underlying shadow; feeling different – social consequences of changed eating; a nutritional jungle – guidance and support in an uncertain time. Conclusion: The physical and social consequences of oesophageal cancer resection upend everyday structures, requiring patients to adopt a new, conscious and reflexive approach to food and eating as a social activity. Continuous support from healthcare professionals and patient-to-patient interaction can help redefine everyday life.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Sjeltoft, Jaqueline Rosenstand","Donsel, Pernille Orloff","Vad, Henrik","Larsen, Malene Kaas","Missel, Malene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-593622"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Missel, Malene"],"keyword":["Daily life","Nutrition","Oesophageal cancer","Patient experiences","Qualitative study","Surgery"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a radical change a qualitative study of patients experiences of eating and daily living through the first year after oesophageal resection","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85088999202","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["We would like to thank all the patients for their valuable contribution to this study. The work was supported by the Centre for Cardiac, Vascular, Pulmonary and Infectious Diseases, Rigshospitalet, Copenhagen University Hospital ."],"id":"S01-000.00-593622","identifier":[{"id":"85088999202","type":"scopus"},{"id":"32746000","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-47163490-5216-4b29-8445-cd5d9103a7cb"],"keyword":["Daily life","Nutrition","Oesophageal cancer","Patient experiences","Qualitative study","Surgery"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B203BC3A8658079DE937B45B71ABB65A"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Surgery (Odense)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, IRS, Lillebaelt Hospital, Health Service Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jaqueline Rosenstand","key":"sjeltoftpau","last":"Sjeltoft","name":"Sjeltoft, Jaqueline Rosenstand","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Pernille Orloff","key":"donselpau","last":"Donsel","name":"Donsel, Pernille Orloff","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"vadpau","last":"Vad","name":"Vad, Henrik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Malene Kaas","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"bf84e2bf-cdfb-4fcd-a1c6-1a9ec055ca94","name":"Larsen, Malene Kaas","orcid":"0000-0002-9075-2809","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Malene","key":"misselpau","last":"Missel","name":"Missel, Malene","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["32746000"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.ejon.2020.101800","issn":["14623889","15322122"],"issn_org":["14623889"],"journal":"European Journal of Oncology Nursing","paperid":"101800","publisher":"Churchill Livingstone","status":"p","title":"European Journal of Oncology Nursing","volume":"48"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85088999202"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-47163490-5216-4b29-8445-cd5d9103a7cb"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"A radical change : A qualitative study of patients' experiences of eating and daily living through the first year after oesophageal resection","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-593622","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Objective To define the proportions of agreement between fluorine‐18‐fluorodeoxyglucose (18F‐FDG) positron emission tomography/computed tomography (PET/CT), clinical diagnosis, and temporal artery biopsy (TAB) in patients with polymyalgia rheumatica (PMR) and giant cell arteritis (GCA). Furthermore, the association of 18F‐FDG PET/CT uptake patterns and clinical presentation of newly diagnosed PMR and GCA was investigated. Methods Eighty patients newly suspected of having PMR, GCA, or concomitant PMR and GCA were included and followed for 40 weeks. Every patient underwent an 18F‐FDG PET/CT scan before or within 3 days of initiation of steroids in case of GCA. FDG uptakes in 8 paired articular/periarticular sites and 14 arterial segments were evaluated based on a 4‐point visual grading scale. Results Of the 80 patients (female: 50 [62.5%]; mean age ± SD: 72.0 ± 7.9), 64 (80.0%) patients were diagnosed with pure PMR, 3 (3.7%) with pure GCA, and 10 (12.5%) with concomitant PMR and GCA. Additionally, three (3.7%) patients were diagnosed with seronegative rheumatoid arthritis during the follow‐up period. For the diagnosis of PMR, 18F‐FDG PET/CT had a proportion of agreement of 75.3 (64.2‐84.4), compared with clinical diagnosis. When comparing findings of 18F‐FDG PET/CT with TAB, 18F‐FDG PET/CT had a proportion of agreement of 93.0 (84.3‐97.7) in all included patients and 69.2 (38.6‐90.9) in the subgroup of patients with vasculitis. C‐reactive protein was significantly higher in patients with PMR activity on 18F‐FDG PET/CT compared with those without 18F‐FDG PET/CT activity (P value = 0.006). Conclusions 18F‐FDG PET/CT is a powerful imaging technique in PMR and GCA that was in good agreement with clinical diagnosis and TAB.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Emamifar, Amir","Ellingsen, Torkell","Hess, Søren","Gerke, Oke","Hviid Larsen, Rasmus","Farahani, Ziba","Hansen, Per Syrak","Jensen Hansen, Inger Marie","Petersen, Henrik","Marcussen, Niels","Dahlstrøm, Michael","Toftegaard, Pia","Thye-Rønn, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-623306"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Emamifar, Amir"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the utility of 000000000018f fdg pet ct in patients with clinical suspicion of polymyalgia rheumatica and giant cell arteritis a prospective observational and cross sectional study","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/acr2.11163","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-623306","identifier":[{"id":"33439554","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85102756677","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC7437127","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["sdu-aee553f9-0414-4b22-800d-14bc5aeb6526"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-046BAD2553AD56AB41EE6016C678E469"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/acr2.11163","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/172989285/acr2.11163.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2020","yearSub":"2020"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research Unit OPEN (Odense)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Medicine (Svendborg)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Amir","key":"emamifarpau","last":"Emamifar","locid":"ff24e337-1f4c-416b-9b28-efb2225ce953","name":"Emamifar, Amir","orcid":"0000-0001-5329-1364","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Torkell Juulsgaard","key":"ellingsenpau","last":"Ellingsen","locid":"12189359-9c0f-4bf1-8b75-be844c75b85b","name":"Ellingsen, Torkell","name_org":"Ellingsen, Torkell Juulsgaard","orcid":"0000-0003-0426-4962","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"hesspau","last":"Hess","locid":"efe993bf-08db-4eed-8c0e-3795317b60d9","name":"Hess, Søren","orcid":"0000-0003-1249-133X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Oke","key":"gerkepau","last":"Gerke","locid":"596baeb1-6754-4d53-948f-30470dd1d976","name":"Gerke, Oke","orcid":"0000-0001-6335-3303","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus","key":"hviidlarsenpau","last":"Hviid Larsen","locid":"463f4434-62ce-45d5-90f6-84def44656b8","name":"Hviid Larsen, Rasmus","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ziba","key":"farahanipau","last":"Farahani","locid":"d9c6decf-75db-4665-9d8f-e38c9cceab3e","name":"Farahani, Ziba","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Per Syrak","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"b506e3e3-5462-4966-bb62-3442817431e3","name":"Hansen, Per Syrak","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Inger Marie","key":"jensenhansenpau","last":"Jensen Hansen","locid":"e6350066-c71d-48a0-945e-259b7989d1c6","name":"Jensen Hansen, Inger Marie","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","locid":"ea635371-4294-4379-9655-3da538fecf13","name":"Petersen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-1118-1500","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},