,"publisher":"American College of Physicians","status":"p","title":"Annals of Internal Medicine","volume":"170"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85063916988"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Non-Profit Organisations","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","Central Denmark Region","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Non-Profit Organisations","Region Zealand","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-709c1523-6e62-49fc-bde9-41149ef90330","ku-555fe786-f103-4e98-b978-4f038e7118db","sdu-48d7fefa-ee56-41a5-8cf6-e6b163a184f0"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Use of Low-Dose Aspirin and Mortality After Prostate Cancer Diagnosis : A Nationwide Cohort Study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-099.91-020915","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Symptoms of Eustachian tube dysfunction are frequent and multiple. Therefore, clear definitions and diagnostic criteria are important in order to achieve appropriate patient flow. So far, there has been a lack of consensus on this subject, but the proposed definitions and diagnostic criteria in this review may aid to achieve this. Tubomanometry is a diagnostic tool to evaluate Eustachian tube function, and balloon dilation of the Eustachian tube can be a helpful treatment in patients with Eustachian tube dysfunction.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Holm, Niels Højvang","Møller, Martin Nue","Larsen, Per Leganger","Wanscher, Jens Højberg","Glad, Henrik","Gaihede, Michael","Ovesen, Therese"],"cuid":["S04-091.08-006701"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":4,"keyword":["Adult","Catheterization","Dilatation","Ear Diseases diagnosis","Endoscopy","Eustachian Tube pathology","Humans"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"udredning og behandling af dysfungerende eustakisk rør hos voksne","src":["aau","au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://ugeskriftet.dk/videnskab/udredning-og-behandling-af-dysfungerende-eustakisk-ror-hos-voksne","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S04-091.08-006701","identifier":[{"id":"30686280","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85060601565","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-8a65e5f1-d155-4e72-9974-a04247d7817f","au-1e6ba735-055a-494b-8b08-4f60a7bdfdbe","ku-c0a7e28