48","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Er religion en privatsag? Op gennem det 20. århundrede har det været en klar opfattelse, at religion skal dyrkes inden for hjemmets fire vægge eller i kirkens hellige rum. Men faktum er, at vi konstant udstiller vores religiøse overbevisning ude i offentligheden. Religion i det offentlige rum belyser gennem 13 bidrag, hvordan religion i allerhøjeste grad sætter en offentlig og politisk dagsorden i nutidens ellers så sekulariserede samfund","author_count":4,"contributors":["Vinding, Niels Valdemar"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-426703"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"civilsamfundet og udgrænsningen af de danske trossamfund","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://unipress.dk/udgivelser/r/religion-i-det-offentlige-rum/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-426703","ids":["ku-37f21463-968e-4385-80de-011974b493b3"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A36B1848673AD61BB058F4C1DC34AA47"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Cross-Cultural and Regional Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Niels Valdemar","key":"vindingpau","last":"Vinding","locid":"0dbe47e2-9883-46a9-baec-85a650840010","name":"Vinding, Niels Valdemar","orcid":"0000-0003-1830-7206","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Brian","key":"arlyjacobsenpedh",