{"abstract":"Hæftet handler om tid, kronologi og perioder og er målrettet lærerstuderende i undervisningsfaget historie, historielærere i folkeskolen og andre med interesse for historiedidaktik. Formålet med hæftet er, at læseren reflekterer dybere over de tre nævnte begreber både i en historiefaglig og en historiedidaktisk sammenhæng. Hæftet indeholder både teoretiske overvejelser og eksempler på øvelser om tid, kronologi og perioder, som kan prøves af på læreruddannelsen og i praksis i skolen.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik Smedegaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-658409"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Historie","Kronologi","Skoler fag og institutioner","Tid","perioder"],"level":"edu","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tid og kronologi hvordan arbejder man med tid kronologi og perioder i folkeskolens historieundervisning","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-658409","ids":["via-7c5f7ca2-b115-45a7-9e46-b1b06379b870"],"keyword":["Kronologi","Skoler, fag og institutioner","historie","perioder","tid"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Educational","noi":["Local-1-1-972E1E14BC7D249A8CA9EF11CCE1B6CA"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Uddannelser, Læreruddannelsen, HF og FIF-kurser, Læreruddannelsen Skive alle fag"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Smedegaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"979be23f-372e-42c4-b96a-a4517db8f2e8","name":"Larsen, Henrik Smedegaard","orcid":"0000-0002-0881-9745","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"edition":"1","isbn":["9788779705005"],"pages":"56","publisher":"Forlaget Columbus","status":"p","volume":"1"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["via-7c5f7ca2-b115-45a7-9e46-b1b06379b870"],"src":["VIA University College"],"title":"Tid og kronologi : Hvordan arbejder man med tid, kronologi og perioder i folkeskolens historieundervisning?","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-658409","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Research研究,Think思考,Act行动, How to do Designthinking 怎么设计思维","author_count":2,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik Wøhlk","Thygesen, Jane"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-658795"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Research designs theory and method","User driven innovation","aesthetics design and media","management organizational development and innovation"],"level":"pop","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"research think act how to do designthinking","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-658795","ids":["via-89577816-03e4-4515-a45b-c5e116765c2d"],"keyword":["aesthetics, design and media","management, organizational development and innovation","research designs, theory and method","user driven innovation"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-80A7AFD1A222165F7E7A9D678F76C849"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Uddannelser, Læreruddannelsen, HF og FIF-kurser, Læreruddannelsen Silkeborg"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Wøhlk","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"ee25a99f-efad-420b-baff-7dadb13706de","name":"Larsen, Henrik Wøhlk","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jane","key":"thygesenpau","last":"Thygesen","locid":"225edd34-e63d-4ea1-9642-10c792f138b3","name":"Thygesen, Jane","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"edition":"1","isbn":["9788799868476"],"pages":"32","place":"Denmark","publisher":"Thoughts Through the Ages","status":"p","volume":"1"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["via-89577816-03e4-4515-a45b-c5e116765c2d"],"src":["VIA University College"],"title":"Research Think Act : How to do Designthinking","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-658795","year":"2019","yearsub":"2019"}
{"abstract":"Religion i folkeskolen er en vidunderligt varieret og paradoksal størrelse: Fra et historisk udelukkende religiøst udgangspunkt har folkeskolen udviklet sig til at blive en sekulær kundskabsformidlende institution. Der undervises i ’fremmede religioner’ men primært i evangelisk luthersk kristendom på en ’ikke-forkyndende’ måde. Elever har ret til at blive fritaget fra denne undervisning, men opfordres til at lade være og bliver det sjældent. Til jul afholdes gudstjeneste i kirken, men indholdet opleves ikke af skolen som religiøst. Folkekirken tilbyder undervisning til folkeskolen via Folkekirkens Skoletjeneste, der eksplicit undlader at tage udgangspunkt i folkekirkelig teologi. Der tages hensyn til religiøse minoriteters behov, men først når man får øje på dem, og kun hvis de holder deres religion for sig selv.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jensen, Sidsel Vive"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-664799"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-VIVE"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-VIVE"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"religion og folkeskolen","src":["vive"],"src-code":["DI-GV-VIVE"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-664799","ids":["vive-bf14c36b-3978-4b62-ad5b-3105ab07334a"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A93A4610CCE32B899E096E4D8125C9B9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"vive the danish center for social science research","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-VIVE","l3nn":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","namevar":["VIVE - The Danish Center for Social Science Research, VIVE Children and Education"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-VIVE","used":1}],"