{"abstract":"We introduce a dedicated form of natural logic intended for representation of sentences in a knowledge base. Natural logic is a version of formal logic whose sentences cover a stylized fragment of natural language. Thus, the sentences in the knowledge base can be read and understood directly by a domain expert, unlike, say, predicate logic and description logic. The paper describes the inference rules enabling deductive querying of the knowledge base. The natural logic sentences and the inference rules are represented in Datalog providing a convenient graph form. As such, the natural logic knowledge base may be viewed as an enriched formal ontology structure. We describe various query facilities including pathway finding accommodated by this setup.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Andreasen, Troels","Bulskov, Henrik","Jensen, Per Anker","Nilsson, Jørgen Fischer"],"cuid":["S02-084.42-031769"],"event":{"end":"2019-07-05","place":"Amantea, it","start":"2019-07-02","title":"The 13th International Conference in Flexible Query Answering Systems. FQAS 2019","year":"2019"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Deductive querying","Formal ontology","Knowledge bases","Natural Logic"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci","soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"deductive querying of natural logic bases","src":["cbs","dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/60836109/per_anker_jensen_et_al_deductive_querying_acceptedversion.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S02-084.42-031769","identifier":[{"id":"85072865959","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["cbs-8aa9bf1d-e4ea-4e74-aa59-8ef110111041","dtu-dced11a1-3d18-4813-9d17-40442814eb9a"],"keyword":["Deductive querying","Formal ontology","Knowledge bases","Natural logic"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology","Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-6-0E4CB182600FA80B367C53037848E4FC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/200134215/FQAS2019.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/60836109/per_anker_jensen_et_al_deductive_querying_acceptedversion.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2019","yearSub":"2019"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Management, Society and Communication"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Algorithms and Logic"],"nora_code