{"abstract":"En medarbejder lugter, en er ekstremt overvægtig og en tredje står midt i en strid skilsmisse. Personlige problemer er blevet et ledelsesanliggende. Hvordan tackler du dem, og bør du overhovedet tackle dem?","author_count":2,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik","Mogensen, Lilian"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-286996"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"er hannes personlige hygiejne en ledelsesopgave","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/er-hannes-personlige-hygiejne-en-ledelsesopgave/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-286996","ids":["cbs-79a02ad2-eb06-46c5-9cb9-0cc3478f4ec9"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-BC67FDE401EB4CD0E8FD0B6E30A267F0"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederweb.dk/artikler/er-hannes-personlige-hygiejne-en-ledelsesopgave/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Lilian","key":"mogen