{"abstract":"For hyperpolarized 13C MRI acquisitions aimed at metabolic rate constant estimation, the Bloch-Siegert shift enables encoding of the transmit field (B1+-field) amplitude within a single hyperpolarized substrate injection. This ability is needed since most clinical hyperpolarized MRI studies use inhomogeneous transmit coils, and because kinetic modeling based on incorrect flip angles can lead to incorrect rate constant estimations. This study demonstrates the feasibility of integrated B1+ mapping for large volume thermal and hyperpolarized phantoms in a clinical setup using a clamshell transmit coil and a 16-channel receive array, and a 3D stack-of-spirals sequence. Phase-sensitive coil-combination was achieved using ESPIRiT.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Hansen, Rie Beck","Shin, Peter J.","Gordon, Jeremy W.","van Criekinge, Mark","Carvajal, Lucas","Hanson, Lars G.","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Vigneron, Daniel B."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-368630"],"event":{"end":"2018-06-21","place":"Paris, fr","start":"2018-06-16","title":"Joint Annual Meeting ISMRM-ESMRMB 2018","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of California at San Francisco"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"integrated b000000000001 mapping for hyperpolarized 000000000013c mri in a clinical setup using multi channel receive arrays","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/149165259/ISMRM18_3698_RieB1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-368630","ids":["dtu-d66ed94b-a87c-49ec-8673-ea3476fe726f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7F09499A747E7BEFF5BBECBAA42F054B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/149165259/ISMRM18_3698_RieB1.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Centers, Center for Hyperpolarization in Magnetic Resonance","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Center for Magnetic Resonance"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"university of california at san francisco","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of California at San Francisco","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rie Beck","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"8214cd7c-cdb4-4678-b17b-bbd3f5d87ece","name":"Hansen, Rie Beck","orcid":"0000-0003-1718-8196","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter J.","key":"shinpau","last":"Shin","name":"Shin, Peter J.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jeremy W.","key":"gordonpau","last":"Gordon","name":"Gordon, Jeremy W.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mark","key":"vancriekingepau","last":"van Criekinge","name":"van Criekinge, Mark","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lucas","key":"carvajalpau","last":"Carvajal","name":"Carvajal, Lucas","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars G.","key":"hansonpau","last":"Hanson","locid":"6c7cc6f9-5b6a-47dc-bb02-efe208e52f16","name":"Hanson, Lars G.","orcid":"0000-0002-8204-6912","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Daniel B.","key":"vigneronpau","last":"Vigneron","name":"Vigneron, Daniel B.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-d66ed94b-a87c-49ec-8673-ea3476fe726f"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Integrated B1+ Mapping for Hyperpolarized 13C MRI in a Clinical Setup using Multi-Channel Receive Arrays","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-368630","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
