{"abstract":"Mange af os er tilbøjelige til at blive bekymrede over om rygsmerter kan være et tegn på alvorligere problemer. Men rygsmerter kan som regel betragtes på linje med smerter fra muskler og led andre steder i kroppen – irriterende, men de går over i langt de fleste tilfælde.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Nørup, Marianne","Larsen, Lars Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-651639"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Fysioterapi"],"level":"pop","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Mediegruppen"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"har du rygsmerter skru ned for bekymringerne og evt for muskelspændingen","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.krop-fysik.dk/har-du-rygsmerter-skru-bekymringerne-evt-muskelspaendingen/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-651639","ids":["ucn-95829864-7020-4e87-bc91-66c7e3c2412d"],"keyword":["fysioterapi"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-45F4E9A6E07E2171365BED156B6E9FD2"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Mediegruppen"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN Velfærd, Fysioterapeutuddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1}],"person":[{"