{"abstract":"The experimentation with a movable outdoor electroluminescence (EL) testbed is performed in this work. For EL inspections of PV power plants, the fastest scenario will include the use of unmanned aerial vehicle (UAV) performing image acquisition in continuous motion. With this motivation, we investigate the EL image quality of an acquisition in motion and the extent of image processing required to correct scene displacement. The results show processed EL images with a high level of information even when acquired at 1 m/s camera speed and at frame rate of 120 fps.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Alves dos Reis Benatto, Gisele","Mantel, Claire","Riedel, Nicholas","A. Santamaria Lancia, Adrian","Thorsteinsson, Sune","Behrensdorff Poulsen, Peter","Forchhammer, Søren","Thorseth, Anders","Dam-Hansen, Carsten","H. B. Frederiksen, Kenn","Vedde, Jan","Larsen, Michael","Voss, Henrik","Parikh, Harsh","Spataru, Sergiu","Sera, Dezso"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-059942"],"event":{"end":"2018-06-15","place":"Waikoloa, us","start":"2018-06-10","title":"7th World Conference on Photovoltaic Energy Conversion","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Electroluminescence","PV inspections","PV reliability"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["SiCon • Silicon and PV consulting"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"outdoor electroluminescence acquisition using a movable testbed","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/306790326/Paper_Moving_EL.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-059942","identifier":[{"id":"85059918133","type":"scopus