{"abstract":"På grundlag af registrering af skriftbrug i Årets Bedste bøger især i det 20. århundrede beskrives reflektioner over brugen af skriften i dansk bogproduktion.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Larsen, Poul Steen","Birkvig, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-303552"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Grafisk design","Skrift","Typografi","fonte","æstetik"],"level":"pop","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Forening for Boghåndværk"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-DMJX"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-DMJX"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"da baskerville kom til bogdanmark","src":["dmjx"],"src-code":["DI-UC-DMJX"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.dmjx.dk/ws/files/109472034/DaBaskervilleKomTilDK_DL.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-303552","ids":["dmjx-04fa342e-7d4d-4783-af82-fc4d2fb308e6"],"keyword":["fonte","grafisk design","skrift","typografi","æstetik"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-36C86C278BE9DC9463EC71A878B0B17B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.dmjx.dk/ws/files/109472034/DaBaskervilleKomTilDK_DL.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Forening for Boghåndværk"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dmjx danish school of media and journalism","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-DMJX","l3nl":"DMJX","l3nn":"DMJX Danish School of Media and Journalism","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DMJX Danish School of Media and Journalism","namevar":["Danmarks Medie- og Journalisthøjskole"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-DMJX","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Poul Steen","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Poul Steen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"birkvigpau","last":"Birkvig","locid":"4d5e50e6-55e8-4a8b-82ea-dce0e431ffbc","name":"Birkvig, Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"20","place":"København","publisher":"Foreningen for Boghaandværk","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","DMJX","Miscellaneous","Other Research","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dmjx-04fa342e-7d4d-4783-af82-fc4d2fb308e6"],"src":["DMJX Danish School of Media and Journalism"],"title":"Da Baskerville kom til Bogdanmark","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-303552","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Using dissolution dynamic nuclear polarization, the sensitivity of single scan solution state 13C NMR can be improved up to 4 orders of magnitude. In this study, the enzyme lacZ β-galactosidase from Escherichia coli was subjected to hyperpolarized substrate, and previously unknown reaction intermediates were observed, including a 1,1-linked disaccharide. The enzyme is known for making 1,6-transglycosylation, producing products like allolactose, that are also substrates. To analyze the kinetics, a simple kinetic model was developed and used to determine relative transglycosylation and hydrolysis rates of each of the intermediates, and the novel transglycosylation intermediates were determined as better substrates than the 1,6-linked one, explaining their transient nature. These findings suggest that hydrolysis and transglycosylation might be more complex than previously described.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Kjeldsen, Christian","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Duus, Jens Øllgaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-306933"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Duus, Jens Øllgaard"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"discovery of intermediates of lacz β galactosidase catalyzed hydrolysis using ddnp nmr","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/146459953/dDNP_VJACS_short_full_paper_clean.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-306933","identifier":[{"id":"29425041","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85042699431","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-07ded81b-0a3f-4c2d-914b-4fe05758d107"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-344D4093C811DAA1D98E01FB915BBC8D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/146459953/dDNP_VJACS_short_full_paper_clean.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Chemistry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christian","key":"kjeldsenpau","last":"Kjeldsen","locid":"00f20e6e-d673-49c4-8036-36889d60410d","name":"Kjeldsen, Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-0976-6622","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jens Ø.","key":"duuspau","last":"Duus","locid":"4317dfee-5351-4137-a6e2-c82bd6a3d0bf","name":"Duus, Jens Øllgaard","name_org":"Duus, Jens Ø.","orcid":"0000-0003-3625-1250","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29425041"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1021/jacs.7b13358","issn":["00027863","15205126"],"issn_org":["00027863"],"issue":"8","journal":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","pages":"3030-3034","publisher":"ACS Publications","status":"p","title":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","volume":"140"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85042699431"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-07ded81b-0a3f-4c2d-914b-4fe05758d107"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Discovery of Intermediates of lacZ β-Galactosidase Catalyzed Hydrolysis Using dDNP NMR","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-306933","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"I denne artikel diskuteres resultaterne fra et nyligt afsluttet ErhvervsPhD-projekt om dynamisk aktivallokering. Én af konklusionerne er, at dynamisk aktivallokering baseret på identifikation af regimeskift i finansielle tidsserier i høj grad er i stand til at forbedre det risikojusterede afkast og reducere tabsrisikoen sammenlignet med traditionelle, statiske benchmarks, hvor allokeringen ikke ændres over tid. Regimeskiftmodeller kan genskabe finansielle markeders tendens til pludseligt at skifte opførsel og det fænomen, at den nye opførsel ofte varer ved længe efter et skift. Projektet har med en praktisk tilgang demonstreret vigtigheden af at identificere og agere på regimeskift for at begrænse tab og bygge robuste porteføljer.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nystrup, Peter","Hansen, Bo William","Larsen, Henrik Olejasz"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-321906"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dynamisk aktivallokering bør allokeringen ændres når markederne dykker","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/152182381/Dynamisk_aktivallokering_B_r_allokeringen_ndres_n_r_markederne_dykker.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-321906","ids":["dtu-3a4b8a41-8bd6-41ba-a4a2-5b24b69648c9"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-4B33A8CBD75467F7472C708DEAAF9E99"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/152182381/Dynamisk_aktivallokering_B_r_allokeringen_ndres_n_r_markederne_dykker.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Dynamical Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Sampension"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"nystruppau","last":"Nystrup","locid":"12601499-13e8-403f-a60d-987ab1452966","name":"Nystrup, Peter","orcid":"0000-0003-4705-9942","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bo William","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Bo William","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Olejasz","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Henrik Olejasz","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01061798"],"issue":"4 - August","journal":"Finans/Invest","pages":"28-35","status":"p","title":"Finans/Invest"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","sampension"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-3a4b8a41-8bd6-41ba-a4a2-5b24b69648c9"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Dynamisk aktivallokering: Bør allokeringen ændres, når markederne dykker?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-321906","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Hyperpolarized 13C-pyruvate for monitoring metabolism of liver metastases in vivo is being investigated for clinical trials of new therapeutics. This study applied advances in multichannel receive arrays and sequence design for human 13C liver imaging and investigated a new denoising method. The method is based on an alternating projection method to enforce structuredness and low-rankness, and is applied with automatic threshold estimation. In vivo data demonstrate improved quality of kinetic modeling after denoising. However, simulations revealed certain unresolved pitfalls.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Hansen, Rie Beck","Gordon, Jeremy W.","Shin, Peter J.","Zhu, Zihan","Mammoli, Daniele","Munster, Pamela N.","Aggarwal, Rahul","Ohliger, Michael A.","Larson, Peder EZ","Hanson, Lars G.","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Vigneron, Daniel B."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-343230"],"event":{"end":"2018-06-21","place":"Paris, fr","start":"2018-06-16","title":"Joint Annual Meeting ISMRM-ESMRMB 2018","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of California at Berkeley","University of California at San Francisco"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"multichannel hyperpolarized 000000000013c mri in a patient with liver metastases using multi slice epi and an alternating projection method for denoising","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/149165444/ISMRM18_3560_RieDenoising.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-343230","ids":["dtu-816ef6e9-e20b-4127-bad0-e87aba28cf