{"abstract":"Radiomusik fungerede i radioens tidlige år på tekniske præmisser, der gjorde det relevant at arbejde med 'radioegnethed' som kriterie, og at arbejde med musik, der var radioegnet, som en særlig genre. Som eksempel fremhæves radiokapelmesterens rolle og Emil Reesens musik til Salome, opført som radiohørespil med live symfonisk musik.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Fjeldsøe, Michael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-457592"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["1920 1930","1930 1940","Danmarks Radio","Det Humanistiske Fakultet","Musik","Musikhistorie"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"radiomusik som genre","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-457592","ids":["ku-6b701b58-f7d7-48a0-8806-69762dde0a93"],"keyword":["1920-1930","1930-1940","Danmarks Radio","Det Humanistiske Fakultet","Emil Reesen","musik","musikhistorie","radiomusik"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A95DC6922B95248E4485191BF8A64B44"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Humanities, Department of Arts and Cultural Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Michael","key":"fjeldsøepau","last":"Fjeldsøe","locid":"a9c2c727-d125-4fdf-8bb6-834212b68974","name":"Fjeldsøe, Michael","orcid":"0000-0003-0105-6623","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten","key":"michelsenpedh","last":"Michelsen","name":"Michelsen, Morten","rank":2,"role":"Edit