"All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-1a376c2d-ec1c-4fff-89bf-57cea13db9bb"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Disease progression after ablation for atrial flutter compared with atrial fibrillation : A nationwide cohort study","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-057708","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
