{"abstract":"Et meget vigtigt aspekt af moderne ledelse er håndtering af ledelsesdilemmaer, det vil sige beslutningssituationer, hvor der til de forskellige handlemuligheder knytter sig en vifte af fordele og ulemper. Dilemmaer kan ikke som sådan ”løses” og lægges til side, men man kan blive bedre til at navigere i den skærgård, som dilemmaerne udgør.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-277515"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Kompleksitet","Paradokser"],"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"dilemmaledelse baner vej 000000000010 ledelsesdilemmaer","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederne.dk/ledelse-i-dag/ny-viden/2018/ledelse-i-dag-april-2018/dilemmaledelse-baner-vej/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-277515","ids":["cbs-168e145c-56eb-40b8-a671-58841bf3f40d"],"keyword":["Dilemmaledelse","Kompleksitet","Paradokser"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7DD58E3645AA3AE660AC5DD796647F66"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederne.dk/ledelse-i-dag/ny-viden/2018/ledelse-i-dag-april-2018/dilemmaledelse-baner-vej/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","cor