{"abstract":"A method reducing the uncertainty of noise figure measurements of highly mismatched preamplifiers is presented. In many cases when measuring the noise figure of preamplifiers for MRI receive arrays the uncertainty is approximately ±0.4 dB. Since the noise figure of the preamplifier is also in this range, a more accurate method is needed. Here we show an increase of 59 % in noise figure accuracy by adding an attenuator between the noise source and preamplifier.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Johansen, Daniel Højrup","Sanchez, Juan Diego","Zhurbenko, Vitaliy","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-369144"],"event":{"end":"2018-06-21","place":"Paris, fr","start":"2018-06-16","title":"Joint Annual Meeting ISMRM-ESMRMB 2018","year":"2018"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"accurate noise figure measurements for highly mismatched preamplifiers","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/151959954/ISMRM18_1692_Noise.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-369144","ids":["dtu-d818894e-6752-483d-bbab-85780a439cd7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1026C22069282008E56761395FDD2347"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/151959954/ISMRM18_1692_Noise.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Te