{"abstract":"Preoperative glucocorticoid administration reduces the systemic inflammatory response. Pentraxin 3 (PTX3) is a novel inflammatory marker belonging to the humoral arm of innate immunity exerting a potentially protective host response. This study evaluated PTX3 and other complement marker changes after preoperative methylprednisolone (MP) early after total knee arthroplasty (TKA). Seventy patients were randomized (1 : 1) to preoperative intravenous (i.v.) MP 125 mg (group MP) or isotonic saline i.v. (group C). The outcomes included change in plasma PTX3, mannose‐binding lectin (MBL), ficolins (ficolin‐1, −2 and −3), complement components (C4 and C3), terminal complement complex (TCC) and C‐reactive protein (CRP) concentrations. Blood samples were analysed at baseline and 2, 6, 24 and 48 h after surgery with complete sampling from 63 patients for analyses. MP resulted in an increase in circulating PTX3 compared to saline from baseline to 24 h postoperatively (P < 0·001), while MP reduced the systemic inflammatory response (CRP) 24 and 48 h postoperatively (P < 0·001). However, the small postoperative changes in MBL, ficolin‐1, −2 and −3, C4, C3 and TCC concentrations did not differ between groups (P > 0·05). In conclusion, preoperative MP 125 mg increased circulating PTX3 and reduced the general inflammatory response (CRP) early after TKA, but did not affect other complement markers.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Lindberg-Larsen, V.","Kehlet, Henrik","Pilely, K.","Bagger, J.","Rovsing, M. L.","Garred, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-454856"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Acute Phase Proteins","Arthroplasty","Complement","Glucocorticoids","Inflammation"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"preoperative methylprednisolone increases plasma pentraxin 000000000003 early after total knee arthroplasty a randomized double blind placebo controlled trial","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"http://europepmc.org/Copyright","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5801497/pdf/CEI-191-356.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-454856","identifier":[{"id":"29119559","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC5801497","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"000424335000012","type":"wos"},{"id":"85033463063","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-66d7c7b0-0702-4d89-8c77-9ec21d781cc3"],"keyword":["acute-phase proteins","arthroplasty","complement","glucocorticoids","inflammation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BA7A20DF4AC1E1ADFCB7503779C3BE89"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"http://europepmc.org/Copyright","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5801497/pdf/CEI-191-356.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Surgery"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"V.","key":"lindberglarsenpau","last":"Lindberg-Larsen","name":"Lindberg-Larsen, V.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"H.","key":"kehletpau","last":"Kehlet","locid":"0a3c43a0-a0c5-4a91-85d6-6e80e16af8b5","name":"Kehlet, Henrik","name_org":"Kehlet, H.","orcid":"0000-0002-2209-1711","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"K.","key":"pilelypau","last":"Pilely","name":"Pilely, K.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"J.","key":"baggerpau","last":"Bagger","name":"Bagger, J.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"M. L.","key":"rovsingpau","last":"Rovsing","name":"Rovsing, M. L.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"P.","key":"garredpau","last":"Garred","locid":"854d72a7-c955-43b5-b455-b7ea1f9bcb1e","name":"Garred, Peter","name_org":"Garred, P.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29119559"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/cei.13071","issn":["00099104","09642536"],"issn_org":["00099104"],"issue":"3","journal":"Clinical and Experimental Immunology","pages":"356-362","status":"p","title":"Clinical and Experimental Immunology","volume":"191"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85033463063"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-66d7c7b0-0702-4d89-8c77-9ec21d781cc3"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Preoperative methylprednisolone increases plasma Pentraxin 3 early after total knee arthroplasty : a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-454856","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"AIM: To determine whether intestinal expression of guanylate cyclase activator 2A (GUCA2A) and guanylate cyclase activator 2B (GUCA2B) genes is regulated in obese humans following Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB), and to evaluate the corresponding guanylin (GN) and uroguanylin (UGN) peptides for potentially contributing to the beneficial metabolic effects of RYGB. METHODS: Enteroendocrine cells were harvested peri- and post-RYGB, and GUCA2A/GUCA2B mRNA expression was compared. GN, UGN and their prohormones (proGN, proUGN) were administered subcutaneously in normal-weight mice to evaluate effects on food intake and glucose regulation. The effect of pro-UGN or UGN overexpression, using adeno-associated virus (AAV) vectors, was assessed in diet-induced obese (DIO) mice. Intracerebroventricular administration of GN and UGN was performed in rats for assessment of putative centrally mediated effects on food intake. GN and UGN, as well as their prohormones, were evaluated for effects on glucose-stimulated insulin secretion (GSIS) in rat pancreatic islets and perfused rat pancreas. RESULTS: GUCA2A and GUCA2B mRNA expression was significantly upregulated in enteroendocrine cells after RYGB. Peripheral administration of guanylins or prohormones did not influence food intake, oral glucose tolerance, and GSIS. Central administration of GN and UGN did not affect food intake in rats. Chronic AVV-mediated overexpression of UGN and proUGN had no effect on body weight or glucose homeostasis in DIO mice. CONCLUSION: GN and UGN, as well as their prohormones, do not seem to play a significant role in body weight regulation and glycemic control, suggesting that guanylin-family peptides do not show promise as targets for the treatment of obesity or diabetes.","author_count":26,"contributors":["Fernandez-Cachon, María L","Pedersen, Søren L","Rigbolt, Kristoffer T","Zhang, Chen","Fabricius, Katrine","Hansen, Henrik H","Elster, Lisbeth","Fink, Lisbeth N","Schäfer, Matthias","Rhee, Nicolai A","Langholz, Ebbe","Wandall, Erik","Friis, Steffen U","Vilmann, Peter","Kristiansen, Viggo B","Schmidt, Christina","Schreiter, Kay","Breitschopf, Kristin","Hübschle, Thomas","Jorsal, Tina","Vilsbøll, Tina","Schmidt, Thorsten","Theis, Stefan","Knop, Filip K.","Larsen, Philip Just","Jelsing, Jacob"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-454966"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-GUB"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-PR-GUB","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"guanylin and uroguanylin mrna expression is increased following roux en y gastric bypass but guanylins do not play a significant role in body weight regulation and glycemic control","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-454966","identifier":[{"id":"000426446000005","type":"wos"},{"id":"29289697","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85039951509","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-6707bc10-5803-444c-9ef2-afa9e5f8e900"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-850AF3B4549AA82D600D85B7190E9A18"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"gubra","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-GUB","l3nl":"Gubra","l3nn":"Gubra","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Gubra","namevar":["Gubra"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-GUB","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Internal Medicine: Gastroenterology and Hepatology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"María L","key":"fernandezcachonmaríalpau","last":"Fernandez-Cachon","name":"Fernandez-Cachon, María L","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Søren L","key":"pedersensørenlpau","last":"Pedersen","name":"Pedersen, Søren L","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kristoffer T","key":"rigboltkristoffertpau","last":"Rigbolt","name":"Rigbolt, Kristoffer T","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Chen","key":"zhangchenpau","last":"Zhang","name":"Zhang, Chen","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Katrine","key":"fabriciuskatrinepau","last":"Fabricius","name":"Fabricius, Katrine","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik H","key":"hansenhenrikhpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Henrik H","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lisbeth","key":"elsterlisbethpau","last":"Elster","name":"Elster, Lisbeth","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Lisbeth N","key":"finklisbethnpau","last":"Fink","name":"Fink, Lisbeth N","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Matthias","key":"schäfermatthiaspau","last":"Schäfer","name":"Schäfer, Matthias","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Nicolai A","key":"rheenicolaiapau","last":"Rhee","name":"Rhee, Nicolai A","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 3","first":"Ebbe","key":"langholzebbepau","last":"Langholz","locid":"c3ab9fb7-1eed-4843-bc2b-9a97abe090c4","name":"Langholz, Ebbe","orcid":"0000-0002-8558-8442","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":