}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"kehletpau","last":"Kehlet","locid":"0a3c43a0-a0c5-4a91-85d6-6e80e16af8b5","name":"Kehlet, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-2209-1711","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Viktoria","key":"lindberglarsenpau","last":"Lindberg-Larsen","name":"Lindberg-Larsen, Viktoria","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29781366"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/17453674.2018.1475177","issn":["17453674","17453682"],"issn_org":["17453674"],"issue":"5","journal":"Acta Orthopaedica","pages":"477-479","status":"p","title":"Acta Orthopaedica","volume":"89"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85047223880"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-9ae87116-1fca-45b7-8145-7b56b9e9e186"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"High-dose glucocorticoid before hip and knee arthroplasty : To use or not to use-that's the question","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-486054","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Recent developments in perioperative pathophysiology and care have documented evidence-based, multimodal rehabilitation (fast-track) to hasten recovery and decrease morbidity and hospital stay in several major surgical procedures. The aim of this study was to investigate the effect over time of a modified previously published fast-track programme in unselected patients undergoing open or laparoscopic liver resection. METHODS: A prospective study includes the first 121 consecutive patients following an updated fast-track programme for liver resection. High-dose methylprednisolone was given to all patients before surgery, catheters and drains were systematically removed early, and patients were mobilized and started eating and drinking from the day of surgery. An opioid-sparing multimodal pain treatment was given for the first week. The discharge criteria were (1) pain sufficiently controlled by oral analgesics only; (2) patient comfortable with discharge; (3) no untreated complications. RESULTS: The median length of stay (LOS) for all patients was 4 days, with 2 days after laparoscopic vs. 4 days for open resections. The median LOS after major hepatectomies (≥3 segments) was 5 days. The readmission rate was 6% and the 30-day mortality zero. The LOS decreased compared to our first-generation fast-track programme with LOS 5 days. CONCLUSIONS: Fast-track principles for perioperative care and early discharge are safe even after major liver resection. The introduction of high-dose steroids preoperatively might have facilitated a shorter LOS. Routine discharge on POD 1 or 2 after laparoscopic resection and on POD 4 after open liver resection has proven to be feasible.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Schultz, Nicolai A","Larsen, Peter N","Klarskov, B","Plum, L M","Frederiksen, Hans-Jørgen","Kehlet, Henrik","Hillingsø, Jens"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-503511"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Aged 80 and over","Female","Humans","Laparoscopy","Length of Stay","Male","Middle Aged","Perioperative Care","Prospective Studies"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"second generation of a fast track liver resection programme","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-503511","identifier":[{"id":"85040072964","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29302723","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-b86249a7-383d-4c0b-ad95-256a9bdc6a40"],"keyword":["Adult","Aged","Aged, 80 and over","Female","Hepatectomy/methods","Humans","Laparoscopy","Length of Stay","Male","Middle Aged","Perioperative Care","Prospective Studies"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-A0ED4958844F25151EBE09DAC2CAE83A"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Surgery"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Nicolai A","key":"schultzpau","last":"Schultz","name":"Schultz, Nicolai A","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Peter N","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Peter N","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"B","key":"klarskovpau","last":"Klarskov","name":"Klarskov, B","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"L M","key":"plumpau","last":"Plum","name":"Plum, L M","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Hans-Jørgen","key":"frederiksenpau","last":"Frederiksen","name":"Frederiksen, Hans-Jørgen","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"kehletpau","last":"Kehlet","locid":"0a3c43a0-a0c5-4a91-85d6-6e80e16af8b5","name":"Kehlet, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-2209-1711","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jens G","key":"hillingsøpau","last":"Hillingsø","locid":"6e3f56a3-3e04-4728-872b-b833e9b702df","name":"Hillingsø, Jens","name_org":"Hillingsø, Jens G","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29302723"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s00268-017-4399-3","issn":["03642313","14322323"],"issn_org":["03642313"],"issue":"6","journal":"World Journal of Surgery","pages":"1860-1866","status":"p","title":"World Journal of Surgery","volume":"42"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85040072964"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-b86249a7-383d-4c0b-ad95-256a9bdc6a40"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Second Generation of a Fast-track Liver Resection Programme","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-503511","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"Previously, it has been reported that melanopsin-mediated pupillary light response (PLR), measured with pupillometry, is reduced in patients with idiopathic intracranial hypertension (IIH), indicating the clinical utility of the tool in the diagnosis of IIH. In the current study, the authors aimed to measure the PLR in 13 treatment-naive patients with new-onset IIH and 13 healthy controls. In contrast to the previous report, which was based on patients with longstanding IIH (n = 13), the authors found no significant difference in the melanopsin-mediated PLR (p = 0.48).","author_count":5,"contributors":["Ba-Ali, Shakoor","Jensen, Rigmor Højland","Larsen, Line Sofie","Lund-Andersen, Henrik","Hamann, Steffen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-513269"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["IIH","Melanopsin","Pupillary light reflex","Pupillometry"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the melanopsin mediated pupillary light response is not changed in patients with newly diagnosed idiopathic intracranial hypertension","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"http://europepmc.org/Copyright","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5858859/pdf/ioph-42-02-1344251.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-513269","identifier":[{"id":"29563950","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85027855404","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC5858859","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["ku-c8b292c8-d4a6-479f-ad00-7656f1bc1f64"],"keyword":["IIH","PIPR","ipRGCs","melanopsin","pupillary light reflex","pupillometry"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-91E57EE4C4DDA377A63BC0D8AC05B6FA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"http://europepmc.org/Copyright","type":"rem","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC5858859/pdf/ioph-42-02-1344251.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Neurology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Shakoor","key":"baalipau","last":"Ba-Ali","name":"Ba-Ali, Shakoor","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Rigmor Højland","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"ba001bf1-101a-4d39-b06f-d5c44f83da58","name":"Jensen, Rigmor Højland","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Line Sofie","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Line Sofie","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"lundandersenpau","last":"Lund-Andersen","locid":"5277856f-b771-4658-bb2f-b292ec78ee6f","name":"Lund-Andersen, Henrik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Steffen","key":"hamannpau","last":"Hamann","locid":"4e7d48fd-1aa8-4703-94ec-8ae85794b7d7","name":"Hamann, Steffen","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["29563950"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1080/01658107.2017.1344251","issn":["01658107","1744506X"],"issn_org":["01658107"],"issue":"2","journal":"Neuro-Ophthalmology","pages":"65-72","status":"p","title":"Neuro-Ophthalmology","volume":"42"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85027855404"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["P