{"author_count":6,"contributors":["Wulf-Andersen, Trine Østergaard","Larsen, Lene"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-568312"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"kønnede tilhørsmuligheder og uddannelsesdeltagelse i udkantsområder","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-568312","ids":["ruc-b7cf21a9-da2c-4985-9bf9-8a0f3a7da14a"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-58765D0F4F2FD248E8FF2F9AC8B0CB4A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Trine Østergaard","key":"wulfandersenpau","last":"Wulf-Andersen","locid":"f8e8c106-b567-4abc-bc1d-3d17fe881a61","name":"Wulf-Andersen, Trine Østergaard","orcid":"0000-0002-9726-9158","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Lene","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"f730328f-3837-4502-a9eb-6eeeb7188d77","name":"Larsen, Lene","orcid":"0000-0003-2725-5110","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Steen Baagøe","key":"nielsenpedh","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Steen Baagøe","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Signe Hvid","key":"thingstruppedh","last":"Thingstrup","name":"Thingstrup, Signe Hvid","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Marianne","key":"brodersenpedh","last":"Brodersen","name":"Brodersen, Marianne","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"hersompedh","last":"Hersom","name":"Hersom, Henrik","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788771187274"],"issn":["22463615"],"issue":"1/2018","pages":"85-103","place":"Frederiksberg","publisher":"Frydenlund Academic","series":"Uddannelse og læring","status":"p","subtitle":"Erfaringer fra deltagerorienteret uddannelsesudvikling og -forskning i praksis","title":"Drenge og mænds inklusion på kønnede uddannelser"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Roskilde University","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-b7cf21a9-da2c-4985-9bf9-8a0f3a7da14a"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Kønnede tilhørsmuligheder og uddannelsesdeltagelse i udkantsområder","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-568312","year":"2018","yearsub":"2018"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Cerebral mitochondrial dysfunction is prominent in the pathophysiology of severe bacterial meningitis. In the present study, we hypothesize that the metabolic changes seen after intracisternal lipopolysaccharide (LPS) injection in a piglet model of meningitis is compatible with mitochondrial dysfunction and resembles the metabolic patterns seen in patients with bacterial meningitis. METHODS: Eight pigs received LPS injection in cisterna magna, and four pigs received NaCl in cisterna magna as a control. Biochemical variables related to energy metabolism were monitored by intracerebral microdialysis technique and included interstitial glucose, lactate, pyruvate, glutamate, and glycerol. The intracranial pressure (ICP) and brain tissue oxygen tension (PbtO2) were also monitored along with physiological variables including mean arterial pressure, blood glucose, lactate, and partial pressure of O2 and CO2. Pigs were monitored for 60 min at baseline and 240 min after LPS/NaCl injection. RESULTS: After LPS injection, a significant increase in cerebral lactate/pyruvate ratio (LPR) compared to control group was registered (p = 0.01). This increase was due to a significant increased lactate with stable and normal values of pyruvate. No significant change in PbtO2 or ICP was registered. No changes in physiological variables were observed. CONCLUSIONS: The metabolic changes after intracisternal LPS injection is compatible with disturbance in the oxidative metabolism and partly due to mitochondrial dysfunction with increasing cerebral LPR due to increased lactate and normal pyruvate, PbtO2, and ICP. The metabolic pattern resembles the one observed in patients with bacterial meningitis. Metabolic monitoring in these patients is feasible to monitor for cerebral metabolic derangements otherwise missed by conventional intensive care monitoring.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Munk, Michael","Poulsen, Frantz Rom","Larsen, Lykke","Nordström, Carl-Henrik","Nielsen, Troels Halfeld"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-577170"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Stanford University"],"keyword":["Lipopolysaccharide","Meningitis","Microdialysis","Mitochondrial dysfunction"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cerebral metabolic changes related to oxidative metabolism in a model of bacterial meningitis induced by lipopolysaccharide","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85045131453","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-577170","identifier":[{"id":"85045131453","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29508265","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["sdu-0de2aeaa-5a62-4a9a-b42f-55a11258878c"],"keyword":["Lipopolysaccharide","Meningitis","Microdialysis","Mitochondrial dysfunction"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-BB0F7A514C0B58277AE9DA11D33228FF"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Neurosurgery (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"stanford university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Stanford University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corres