{"abstract":"The short-lived nature of hyperpolarization places high demands on signal acquisition. To acquire large FOVs with high spatial resolution, and to fully capture substrate uptake and metabolic conversion, fast data acquisition is crucial. Parallel imaging uses multi-channel coils to achieve reduced scan times based on spatial information inherent to each coil element. In this work, we explored the combination of non-cartesian parallel imaging reconstruction and spatially undersampled IDEAL spiral CSI1 acquisition for efficient encoding of multiple chemical shifts within a large FOV with high spatial resolution.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Hansen, Rie Beck","Hanson, Lars G.","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-317557"],"event":{"end":"2017-03-31","place":"Pacific Grove. , us","start":"2017-03-26","title":"58th Experimental Nuclear Magnetic Resonance Conference","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"non cartesian parallel imaging reconstruction of undersampled ideal spiral 000000000013c csi data","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130823257/ENC20177454.2399VER.1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-317557","ids":["dtu-2b9de827-4672-44e2-a59e-a8bbb0a96504"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-509F13CB2615A46A81F95AC8AAD834FC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130823257/ENC20177454.2399VER.1.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Centers, Center for Hyperpolarization in Magnetic Resonance","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Center for Magnetic Resonance"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rie Beck","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"8214cd7c-cdb4-4678-b17b-bbd3f5d87ece","name":"Hansen, Rie Beck","orcid":"0000-0003-1718-8196","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars G.","key":"hansonpau","last":"Hanson","locid":"6c7cc6f9-5b6a-47dc-bb02-efe208e52f16","name":"Hanson, Lars G.","orcid":"0000-0002-8204-6912","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-2b9de827-4672-44e2-a59e-a8bbb0a96504"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Non-Cartesian Parallel Imaging Reconstruction of Undersampled IDEAL Spiral 13C CSI Data","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-317557","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
