{"abstract":"Denne rapport omhandler arbejdet med identifikation af de parametre, der i vores indeklima påvirker vores komfort og/eller sundhed. Rapporten skal ses som en afrapportering af de overvejelser og valg, der er truffet forud for identifikationen af de centrale parametre, som kommer til at danne grundlaget for vurdering af indeklimaet i boliger i det videre arbejde i REBUS.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Larsen, Tine Steen","Clausen, Geo","Bekö, Gabriel","Heebøll, Anna","Witterseh, Thomas","Hellgren, Eva","Knudsen, Henrik Nellemose","Mortensen, Lone Hedegaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-073762"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Gyproc, Saint Gobain"],"keyword":["Indeklima","Indeklimaklassificering","Parametere"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"centrale parametre til karakterisering af bygningers indeklima","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/261940321/Centrale_parametre_til_karakterisering_af_bygningers_indeklima.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-073762","ids":["aau-51a5f54a-0a81-4595-a1bd-8769371f662e"],"keyword":["Indeklima","Indeklimaklassificering","Parametere"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E95FCF91084ED97E3CFE16C7A28AF26D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/261940321/Centrale_parametre_til_karakterisering_af_bygningers_indeklima.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalbor