{"abstract":"In this paper, we present a multi-modal dataset for obstacle detection in agriculture. The dataset comprises approximately 2 h of raw sensor data from a tractor-mounted sensor system in a grass mowing scenario in Denmark, October 2016. Sensing modalities include stereo camera, thermal camera, web camera, 360° camera, LiDAR and radar, while precise localization is available from fused IMU and GNSS. Both static and moving obstacles are present, including humans, mannequin dolls, rocks, barrels, buildings, vehicles and vegetation. All obstacles have ground truth object labels and geographic coordinates.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Kragh, Mikkel Fly","Christiansen, Peter","Laursen, Morten Stigaard","Larsen, Morten","Steen, Kim Arild","Green, Ole","Karstoft, Henrik","Nyholm Jørgensen, Rasmus"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-212182"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Kragh, Mikkel Fly"],"keyword":["Agriculture","Cameras","Computer vision","Dataset","LiDAR","Object tracking","Obstacle detection","Radar","Stereo imaging","Thermal imaging","cs RO"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fieldsafe dataset for obstacle detection in agriculture","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3390/s17112579","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-212182","identifier":[{"id":"85034022365","type":"scopus"},{"id":"29120383","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC5713196","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["au-9151f7dc-50b0-466e-aa3f-7ff699b921cc"],"keyword":["Agriculture","Cameras","Computer vision","Dataset","LiDAR","Object tracking","Obstacle detection","Radar","Stereo imaging","Thermal imaging","cs.RO"],"lang":"En