596c24-0be9-4d03-8867-af2ae63941a8"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"The SH2B3 and KCNK5 loci may be implicated in regulation of platelet count, volume, and maturity","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-228152","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
