{"abstract":"Traditionally, U-bar loop connections with keyed joints have been used in vertical shear connections between precast concrete wall elements. However, in the recent years, connections with looped high strength wire ropes instead of U-bar loops have proven to be a much more construction-friendly solution. The wire ropes have no bending stiffness and therefore allow for an easier vertical installation of the wall elements. During the last 10 – 15 years, a number of shear tests on plane wire rope connections have been carried out. However, to the best knowledge of the authors, tests on wire rope connections for assembly of precast elements in different planes, such as T- and L-connections, have not yet been published. This paper presents the results of a large test series recently conducted at the University of Southern Denmark to study the shear behaviour of high strength wire rope T-connections grouted with mortar. The test results are evaluated based on the experiences gained from test and modelling of similar plane connections. It is found that T-connections, in contrast to the plane connections, are more prone to fail by rupture of the brittle wire ropes rather than crushing of the joint mortar. Even so, it is found that a ductile post peak response can be obtained for T-connections, especially when so-called double wire boxes are used.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Henrik Brøner","Bryndum, Thor","Larsen, Michael","Hoang, Linh Cao"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-636317"],"event":{"end":"2016-11-23","place":"Cape Town, za","start":"2016-11-21","title":"fib Symposium 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU","DI-U-UND"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-SDU","DI-U-UND"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"load carrying capacity of shear wall t connections reinforced with high strength wire ropes","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-636317","ids":["sdu-dc54a3f5-319e-4944-8274-0174293bd37a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-1FC09FB48A6F1BF7055D397E5954D704"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Technology and Innovation","SDU, The Faculty of Engineering, Department of Technology and Innovation, SDU Civil and Architectural Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"unclear universities","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-UND","l3nl":"Undetermined","l3nn":"Unclear Universities","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Unclear Universities","namevar":["Institut for Teknolgi og Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-UND","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik Brøner","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"2b9311e2-5793-4ed6-8088-4df1bb6774ba","name":"Jørgensen, Henrik Brøner","orcid":"0000-0002-1241-8653","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thor","key":"bryndumpau","last":"Bryndum","name":"Bryndum, Thor","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","corresponding":null,"first":"Michael","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Michael","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Linh Cao","key":"hoangpau","last":"Hoang","name":"Hoang, Linh Cao","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9782883941205"],"place":"Lausanne","publisher":"fib","status":"p","subtitle":"Performance-Based Approaches for Concrete Structures","title":"fib Symposium 2016"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Undetermined","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-dc54a3f5-319e-4944-8274-0174293bd37a"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Load Carrying Capacity of Shear Wall T-Connections Reinforced with High Strength Wire Ropes","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-636317","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
