{"abstract":"We describe a multidrug-resistant Neisseria gonorrhoeae infection with ceftriaxone resistance and azithromycin intermediate resistance in a heterosexual man in Denmark, 2017. Whole genome sequencing of the strain GK124 identified MSLT ST1903, NG-MAST ST1614 and all relevant resistance determinants including similar penA resistance mutations previously described in ceftriaxone-resistant gonococcal strains. Although treatment with ceftriaxone 0.5 g plus azithromycin 2 g was successful, increased awareness of spread of gonococcal strains threatening the recommended dual therapy is crucial.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Terkelsen, David","Tolstrup, Jacob","Johnsen, Camilla Hundahl","Lund, Ole","Larsen, Helle Kiellberg","Worning, Peder","Unemo, Magnus","Westh, Henrik"],"cuid":["S02-081.11-037013"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Örebro University"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"multidrug resistant neisseria gonorrhoeae infection with ceftriaxone resistance and intermediate resistance to azithromycin denmark 000000002017","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2807/1560-7917.ES.2017.22.42.17-00659","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-081.11-037013","identifier":[{"id":"29067905","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC5710115","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"85032000612","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-c30f79c7-bdb7-4ba0-bc53-b54d646c01df","ku-cfd59fce-34e1-467c-8bff-d222eecdcb94"],"lang":"English","