{"abstract":"This report is Denmark’s National Inventory Report 2017. The report contains information on Denmark’s emission inventories for all years’ from 1990 to 2015 for CO2, CH4, N2O, HFCs, PFCs and SF6, NOx, CO, NMVOC, SO2","author_count":22,"contributors":["Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Winther, Morten","Nielsen, Malene","Gyldenkærne, Steen","Mikkelsen, Mette Hjorth","Albrektsen, Rikke","Thomsen, Marianne","Hjelgaard, Katja Hossy","Fauser, Patrik","Bruun, Henrik Gundorph","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Nord-Larsen, Thomas","Vesterdal, Lars","Callesen, Ingeborg","Caspersen, Ole Hjorth","Rasmussen, Erik","Petersen, Susanne Bødtker","Baunbæk, Lene","Hansen, Maria Gunnleivsdóttir"],"cuid":["S02-091.67-018900"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Nordic"],"country":["Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Statistics Greenland","Umhvørvisstovan (The Environmental Agency. The Faroe Islands)"],"keyword":["CO2","Emission inventory","Greenhouse gases","IPCC","Kyoto Protocol","UNFCCC"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"denmark s national inventory report 000000002017 emission inventories 000000001990 000000002015 submitted under the united nations framework convention on climate change and the kyoto protocol","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/201421690/Denmark_s_National_Inventory_Report_2017.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-091.67-018900","ids":["au-55a45681-9dbe-491c-9da8-d7e88886767e","ku-8895783a-4437-44fa-8048-50c27de32ee5"],"keyword