{"abstract":"Formålet med denne rapport har været at identificere de typiske indeklima-relaterede problemer i etageboliger for herefter at udarbejde forslag til hvordan beboernes adfærd kan påvirkes i positiv retning for at reducere eller måske helt at undgå problemerne. Problemer med indeklimaet i boliger er oftest problemer med for høje temperaturer, høj luftfugtighed og skimmelsvampe, træk, miljøfremmede stoffer samt støj fra nabolejligheder.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Tine Steen","Knudsen, Henrik Nellemose","Heebøll, Anna"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-108448"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Brugeradfærd","Etagebyggeri","Indeklima","Indeklimaklassificering"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"brugerkommunikation vejen til et bedre indeklima","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://rebus.nu/viden-og-vaerktoejer/indeklima-definition-af-indeklimaaspekter-og-parametre/","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-108448","ids":["aau-c936852e-47a7-4864-a125-07714385e681"],"keyword":["Brugeradfærd","Brugerkommunikation","Etagebyggeri","Indeklima","Indeklimaklassificering"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-DFF637C8A6C649EA404DFE4EC539C351"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science,