{"abstract":"The aim of the present work is to address the challenge of optimal The aim of the present work is to address the challenge of optimal flflip angle calibration of ip angle calibration of C surface coils in C surface coils in hyperpolarization studies. To this end, we characterize the spatial pro hyperpolarization studies. To this end, we characterize the spatial profifile of the le of the flflip angle and demonstrate that it ip angle and demonstrate that it allows for a simple calibration improving the signal-to-noise ratio for hyperpolarized allows for a simple calibration improving the signal-to-noise ratio for hyperpolarized C magnetic resonance C magnetic resonance spectroscopic imaging.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Hansen, Rie Beck","Gutte, Henrik","Larsen, Majbrit M E","Kristensen, Annemarie T.","Kjær, Andreas","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Hansen, Adam E."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-330553"],"event":{"end":"2017-04-27","place":"Honolulu, us","start":"2017-04-22","title":"ISMRM 25th Annual Meeting &amp; Exhibition","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"characterization and flip angle calibration of 000000000013c surface coils for hyperpolarization studies","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/130823100/Abstract1.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-330553","ids":["dtu-576e8a34-60ad-4a8d-bed6-ddd8703fbab5"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D61F2E78C2545B2B8B3FF13D5E600767"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.d