{"abstract":"571","author_count":5,"contributors":["Larsen, Lars Henrik","Brogner, H.","Østergaard, G. V.","Sørensen, B. Ø.","Graven-Nielsen, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-111404"],"event":{"end":"2017-09-09","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2017-09-06","title":"Pain in Europe X, 10th Congress of the European Pain Federation, EFIC","year":"2017"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"increased trunk muscle activity during gait after bilateral experimental pain induction in recurrent low back pain patients during a pain free period","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-111404","ids":["aau-d34f0502-3e88-4a79-a896-27b4971df3cb"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A326E930284B60B1043ABB526C2609C6"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Center for Sensory-Motor Interaction"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Henrik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"7cb7d78e-7196-4a42-a161-7b1eebf9e0ac","name":"Larsen, Lars Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"H.","key":"brognerpau","last":"Brogner","name":"Brogner, H.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"G. V.","key":"østergaardpau","last":"Østergaard","name":"Østergaard, G. V.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"B. Ø.","key":"sørensenpau","last":"Sørensen","name":"Sørensen, B. Ø.","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas","key":"gravennielsenpau","last":"Graven-Nielsen","locid":"474a635b-4e83-4b02-a90b-80d417d37e52","name":"Graven-Nielsen, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-7787-4860","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-d34f0502-3e88-4a79-a896-27b4971df3cb"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Increased trunk muscle activity during gait after bilateral experimental pain induction in recurrent low back pain patients during a pain-free period","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-111404","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Background and aims Common genetic risk variants may contribute to the heritability of early-onset coronary artery disease (CAD). We aimed to investigate the association of a genetic risk score (GRS) with age upon CAD-onset and to test the association between the GRS, familial clustering, and CAD severity in early-onset CAD. Methods 134 early-onset CAD patients (<40 years), 446 late-onset CAD patients (male >55 years/female >65 years), and 89 healthy controls were genotyped for 45 CAD-associated SNPs and a GRS was created. In early-onset CAD patients, family pedigrees with information on 1585 1st and 2nd degree relatives were used to calculate a stratified log-rank family score (SLFS) as a measure of familial clustering. Results Early-onset patients had a higher mean GRS than late-onset CAD patients (p = 0.02) and healthy controls (p < 0.0001). In the adjusted model, a GRS increase of one SD was associated with 1.2 years (95% CI 0.1–2.2) earlier onset. The GRS was not associated with the SLFS in the regression model (p = 0.41) and did not differ between SLFS tertiles (p = 0.98). The SLFS predicted the number of affected coronary vessels (OR [95% CI] per SD increase in SLFS: 2.0 [1.4–3.0]), whereas the association between the GRS and CAD severity was not statistically significant (OR [95% CI] per SD increase in GRS: 1.3 [0.9–1.9]). Conclusions The GRS was increased in early-onset CAD patients, but not associated with the SLFS, suggesting that these common genetic variants are of minor importance in familial clustering of early-onset CAD. Furthermore, family pedigree analysis may predict CAD severity more precisely than common variants.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Christiansen, Morten Krogh","Nyegaard, Mette","Pedersen, Lisbeth Nørum","Larsen, Sanne Bøjet","Würtz, Morten","Hjort, Jakob","Kristensen, Steen Dalby","Jensen, Henrik Kjærulf"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-266825"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Age of Onset","Coronary artery disease","Genetics","Multifactorial Inheritance"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a 000000000045 snp genetic risk score is increased in early onset coronary artery disease but independent of familial disease clustering","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85010635823","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-266825","identifier":[{"id":"85010635823","type":"scopus"},{"id":"28142076","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-f0f38b6d-0786-4080-94c9-0bc1fecb3e81"],"keyword":["Age of onset","Coronary artery disease","Genetics","Multifactorial inheritance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E8E39CBE3C1F090FA2845E7DDFDC11DB"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2017","yearSub":"2017"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of Cardiological Medicine B"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten K","key":"christiansenpau","last":"Christiansen","locid":"bf2444c5-3e70-45d3-b035-850325ff2f6e","name":"Christiansen, Morten Krogh","name_org":"Christiansen, Morten K","orcid":"0000-0002-3894-888X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette","key":"nyegaardpau","last":"Nyegaard","locid":"a34df7ff-0fb5-44b0-8255-6dc2c9b962f3","name":"Nyegaard, Mette","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lisbeth N","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"e77e4067-66ad-4b79-bb8b-4be203e2d148","name":"Pedersen, Lisbeth Nørum","name_org":"Pedersen, Lisbeth N","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sanne B","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"15c7c979-5236-47ec-b92e-a4a5992b2d1e","name":"Larsen, Sanne Bøjet","name_org":"Larsen, Sanne B","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Morten","key":"würtzpau","last":"Würtz","locid":"b5e070b9-ecf1-43ae-83c2-164d5eeccfc5","name":"Würtz, Morten","orcid":"0000-0001-7150-7704","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob","key":"hjortpau","last":"Hjort","locid":"851ad809-d384-493e-a6fe-cf9f3d5a9b53","name":"Hjort, Jakob","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Steen D","key":"kristensenpau","last":"Kristensen","locid":"6d64271d-8a2c-41ea-891d-e85555bbd47a","name":"Kristensen, Steen Dalby","name_org":"Kristensen, Steen D","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik K","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"5fb8d709-1b6d-4959-8f16-a4b5d78b436d","name":"Jensen, Henrik Kjærulf","name_org":"Jensen, Henrik K","orcid":"0000-0003-1802-4302","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["28142076"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.atherosclerosis.2017.01.010","issn":["00219150","15675688"],"issn_org":["00219150"],"journal":"Atherosclerosis","pages":"172-178","publisher":"Elsevier Ireland Ltd","status":"p","title":"Atherosclerosis","volume":"257"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85010635823"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-f0f38b6d-0786-4080-94c9-0bc1fecb3e81"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"A 45-SNP genetic risk score is increased in early-onset coronary artery disease but independent of familial disease clustering","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-266825","year":"2017","yearsub":"2017"}
{"abstract":"Mangfoldighed, retfærdighed og inklusion var de tre temaer, som blev foldet ud ved et AOM-besøg i Coca- Colas hovedsæde i Atlanta. I alt ca. 12 ledere, der er centralt placeret i f.t. virksomhedens enorme satsning på mangfoldighed og inklusion, præsenterede og diskuterede indbyrdes, hvori denne indsats består, hvorfor og hvordan den harmonerer med virksomhedens vision og ledelsesgrundlag, og hvordan den knytter virksomheden til det omliggende samfund, ikke blot i USA i de mange lande, hvor Coca-Colas drikke produceres og sælges.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-288961"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the real thing stemningsbillede fra et besøg hos coca cola","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.noca.dk/nyhed/aom-2017-artikel-af-henrik-holt-larsen-real-thing-stemningsbillede-fra-et-besog-hos-coca-cola/","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-288961","ids":["cbs-8ef398bc-92b2-4892-8a4a-62ab60db21dc"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9F53566C4AE89B3F1BD6087A3D87724D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.noca.dk/nyhed/aom-2017-artikel-af-henrik-holt-larsen-real-thing-stemningsbillede-fra-et-besog-hos-coca-cola/","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business Sc