{"abstract":"Hvad ved vi fra den nyeste forskning og praksis om at arbejde og lede virtuelt? Artiklen er baseret på resultaterne af et forskningsprojekt vedrørende virtuel ledelse og arbejdsmiljø, der er gennemført af COWI, CBS og SDU, og som er støttet af Arbejdsmiljøforskningsfonden.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-288719"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"virtuel ledelse nærværende ledelse på distancen","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederne.dk/ledelse-i-dag/ny-viden/2016/ledelse-i-dag-november-december-2016/virtuel-ledelsen-naervaerende-ledelse-paa-distancen","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-288719","ids":["cbs-8c5f85e3-e484-421a-a81d-8d7a44a97b07"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-44049BA4DFDB5CB60219B3BFFE11143B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://www.lederne.dk/ledelse-i-dag/ny-viden/2016/ledelse-i-dag-november-december-2016/virtuel-ledelsen-naervaerende-ledelse-paa-distancen","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["09058966"],"issue":"11-12","journal":"Ledelse i Dag","status":"p","title":"Ledelse i Dag"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-8c5f85e3-e484-421a-a81d-8d7a44a97b07"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Virtuel ledelse: Nærværende ledelse på distancen","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-288719","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Vi er alt for beskedne of uambitiøse, når vi siger, hvad HRM kan bidrage med i fremtidens virksomheder. Mange af de generelle udfordringer, som virksomhederne står overfor, har nemlig en karakter, der gør det naturligt eller nødvendigt at sætte ind med HRM-professionalisme. Bolden ligger for vores fødder, så nu gælder det bare om at sparke. Artiklen beskriver nogle af de vigtigste udfordringer - og hvorfor HRM er et svar herpå.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-291891"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"når hrm sparker døren ind til fremtiden","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-291891","ids":["cbs-adbf46e7-04f2-46b9-91c6-06b57979912d"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-54195C8D46A7D408983CACF98C3D6AE9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["22459405"],"issue":"5","journal":"HR-chefen","pages":"6-10","publisher":"Dansk HR","publisher_org":"DANSK HR","status":"p","title":"HR-chefen","title_org":"HR chefen"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-adbf46e7-04f2-46b9-91c6-06b57979912d"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Når HRM sparker døren ind til fremtiden","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-291891","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Flere og flere arbejdspladser har såkaldt flextid, og mange medarbejdere er begyndt at have hjemmearbejdsplads. Netop det virtuelle arbejde kan være interessant for mennesker med sclerose.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-292208"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"fleksibilitet virtuelt arbejde og sclerose","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://scleroseforeningen.dk/nyhed/fleksibilitet-virtuelt-arbejde-og-sclerose","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-292208","ids":["cbs-b117980c-c967-4291-803c-608f22f6f4f9"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D22802368F0F405E0B639DB95159448C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"https://scleroseforeningen.dk/nyhed/fleksibilitet-virtuelt-arbejde-og-sclerose","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Cope