{"abstract":"We investigated the evolution and epidemiology of a novel live-stock-associated methicillin-resistant Staphylococcus aureus strain, which colonizes and infects urban-dwelling Danes even without a Danish animal reservoir. Genetic evidence suggests both poultry and human adaptation, with poultry meat implicated as a probable source.","author_count":41,"contributors":["Larsen, Jesper","Stegger, Marc","Andersen, Paal S.","Petersen, Andreas","Larsen, Anders R.","Westh, Henrik","Agersø, Yvonne","Fetsch, Alexandra","Kraushaar, Britta","Kaesbohrer, Annemarie","Fessler, Andrea T.","Schwarz, Stefan","Cuny, Christiane","Witte, Wolfgang","Butaye, Patrick","Denis, Olivier","Haenni, Marisa","Madec, Jean-Yves","Jouy, Eric","Laurent, Frederic","Battisti, Antonio","Franco, Alessia","Alba, Patricia","Mammina, Caterina","Pantosti, Annalisa","Monaco, Monica","Wagenaar, Jaap A.","de Boer, Enne","van Duijkeren, Engeline","Heck, Max","Dominguez, Lucas","Torres, Carmen","Zarazaga, Myriam","Price, Lance B.","Skov, Robert L."],"cuid":["S02-096.96-037788"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Belgium","France","Germany","Italy","Netherlands","Spain","United States"],"glorg":["Agence nationale de sécurité sanitaire de l'alimentation, de l'environnement et du travail","All Global Affiliations","Complutense University of Madrid","Federal Institute for Risk Assessment","Friedrich-Loeffler-Institute","George Washington University","Ghent University","Istituto Superiore di Sanita","Istituto Zooprofilattico Sperimentale delle Regioni Lazio e Toscana","National Institute of Public Health and the Environment","Netherlands Food and Consumer Product Safety Authority","Robert Koch Institute","Universidad de La Rioja","Universite Claude Bernard Lyon 1","University of Palermo","Université libre de Bruxelles","Utrecht University"],"keyword":["Host