043929","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Background Epidemiological studies suggest an important role for environmental factors in developing multiple sclerosis (MS). Furthermore several studies have indicated that the effect of environmental factors may be especially pronounced in adolescents. Recently only one study investigated and found that shift work at young age is associated with an increased risk of developing MS. In this study we focused on the effect of shift work in the vulnerable period between 15–19 years. Objective The aim of this study was to investigate the association between shift work at young age and the risk of developing MS. Methods We performed a large case-control study including 1785 patients diagnosed with MS and 4194 controls. MS patients were recruited from the Danish Multiple Sclerosis Biobank and controls from The Danish Blood Donor Study. Information on working patterns and lifestyle factors was obtained using a comprehensive lifestyle-environmental factor questionnaire with participants enrolled between 2009 and 2014. Logistic regression models were used to investigate the association between shift work at age 15–19 years and the subsequent risk of MS and were controlled for effects due to established MS risk factors. Results We found a statistically significant association when total numbers of night shifts were compared with non-shift workers. For every additional 100 night shifts the odds ratio (OR) for MS was 1.20 (95% confidence interval (CI), 1.08–1.34, p=0.001). Increasing intensity of shift work also increased MS risk. For every additional night per month the OR was 1.04 (95% CI, 1.01–1.06, p=0.002). Duration of shift work in years was not associated with risk of MS. Conclusion This study supports a statistically significant association between shift work between age 15–19 years and MS risk.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Gustavsen, S","Søndergaard, H B","Oturai, D B","Laursen, B","Laursen, J H","Magyari, M","Ullum, Henrik","Larsen, M H","Sellebjerg, Finn","Oturai, Annette Bang"],"cuid":["S02-098.91-044336"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Adult","Age Factors","Case Control Studies","Denmark","Employment","Female","Humans","Journal Article","Logistic Models","MS","Male","Multiple sclerosis","Night work","Odds Ratio","Risk Factors","Shift work"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"shift work at young age is associated with increased risk of multiple sclerosis in a danish population","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84979306878","version":"Other Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["We thank the Danish Multiple Sclerosis Society (grant number R308-A19376), the Danish Council for Strategic Research , NOVARTIS , BIOGEN IDEC , and Foundation for Research in Neurology for funding this study."],"id":"S02-098.91-044336","identifier":[{"id":"27645354","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84979306878","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-8f256c53-c62e-49c2-9f55-24e02c731250","sdu-35da332c-b948-4a32-8f1c-4195cff70437"],"keyword":["Adult","Age Factors","Case-Control Studies","Denmark","Employment","Female","Humans","Journal Article","Logistic Models","MS","Male","Multiple Sclerosis","Night work","Odds Ratio","Risk Factors","Shift work"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-B367006E15B20F1B6687C099189E15C2"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, National Institute of Public Health, Children health","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, National Institute of Public Health, Research Programme on Health and Morbidity in Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"S","key":"gustavsenspau","last":"Gustavsen","name":"Gustavsen, S","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"H B","key":"søndergaardhbpau","last":"Søndergaard","name":"Søndergaard, H B","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Helle Bach","key":"søndergaardhellebachpau","last":"Søndergaard","name":"Søndergaard, Helle Bach","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"D B","key":"oturaidbpau","last":"Oturai","name":"Oturai, D B","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"B","key":"laursenbjarnepau","last":"Laursen","locid":"d484780f-c917-4d3e-927e-5ff086dd00eb","name":"Laursen, Bjarne","name_org":"Laursen, B","orcid":"0000-0003-0121-9891","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"B","key":"laursenbpau","last":"Laursen","name":"Laursen, B","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"J H","key":"laursenjhpau","last":"Laursen","name":"Laursen, J H","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"M","key":"magyarimpau","last":"Magyari","name":"Magyari, M","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"H","key":"ullumhenrikpau","last":"Ullum","locid":"ef594d49-5aeb-4d32-80b4-4bfc281b5cbb","name":"Ullum, Henrik","name_org":"Ullum, H","orcid":"0000-0001-7306-9058","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"H.","key":"ullumhpau","last":"Ullum","name":"Ullum, H.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"M H","key":"larsenmhpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, M H","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"F","key":"sellebjergfinnpau","last":"Sellebjerg","locid":"4cbcdba1-9f69-4103-b595-68788ee7aacc","name":"Sellebjerg, Finn","name_org":"Sellebjerg, F","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"F","key":"sellebjergfpau","last":"Sellebjerg","name":"Sellebjerg, F","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"A B","key":"oturaiannettebangpau","last":"Oturai","locid":"96bde552-62da-4428-9766-edbab1298a99","name":"Oturai, Annette Bang","name_org":"Oturai, A B","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"A B","key":"oturaiabpau","last":"Oturai","name":"Oturai, A B","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["27645354"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.msard.2016.06.010","issn":["22110348","22110356"],"issn_org":["22110348"],"journal":"Multiple Sclerosis and Related Disorders","pages":"104-109","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Multiple Sclerosis and Related Disorders","volume":"9"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84979306878"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-8f256c53-c62e-49c2-9f55-24e02c731250","sdu-35da332c-b948-4a32-8f1c-4195cff70437"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Shift work at young age is associated with increased risk of multiple sclerosis in a Danish population","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-098.91-044336","year":"2016","yearsub":2017}
{"abstract":"FirstAED is a supplement to the existing emergency response systems. The aim is to shorten the community first responder response times at emergency calls to below five minutes in a bridge connected island area. FirstAED defines a way to dispatch the nearby three first responders and organise their roles in a team structure to reduce response times, ensure citizens' safety and offer equal possibility of early defibrillation. First aid is provided by community first responders who use their smartphone. FirstAED global positioning system (GPS)-tracks the nine nearby first responders and enables the emergency dispatcher to send an organised team of three first responders with distinct roles to the scene automatically. During the first 24 months the FirstAED system was used 718 times. Three first responders arrived in ∼89% of the cases, and they arrived before the ambulance in ∼94% of the cases. FirstAED entailed a significant reduction in median first responder response time to four minutes nine seconds and in median time to AED on site to five minutes and 47 seconds.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Henriksen, Finn Lund","Schorling, Per","Hansen, Bruno","Schakow, Henrik","Larsen, Mogens Lytken"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-000375"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Henriksen, Finn Lund"],"keyword":["AED","BLS","Basic life support","CFR","CPR","Cardiopulmonary resuscitation","Community first responder","Debriefing","Denmark","Dispatching","EMD","EMS","Emergency Medical Services","Emergency medical dispatch centre","GPS","Global Positioning System","PAD","Public Access Defibrillation","Response time"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-SDR"],"OT":["Langeland AED Association"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-SDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"firstaed emergency dispatch global positioning of community first responders with distinct roles a solution to reduce the response times and ensuring an aed to early defibrillation in the rural area langeland","src":["aau","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84961167286","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-000375","identifier":[{"id":"84961167286","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-072ed052-0b33-49ff-990a-937cf76dcaee","sdu-958654a3-54f1-4d9c-9fde-2da849fb0881"],"keyword":["AED","Automatic external defibrillator","BLS","Basic life support","CFR","CPR","Cardiopulmonary resuscitation","Community first responder","Debriefing","Denmark","Dispatching","EMD","EMS","Emergency medical dispatch centre","Emergency medical services","GPS","Global positioning system","PAD","Public access defibrillation","Response time","Team structure"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-23D3259D882C90BEF06A96BAAE720F50"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Cardiology (Odense)","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Regional Health Research, Department of Cardiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Langeland AED Association"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Hjertemedicin (Kardiologi) [Klinik Hjerte-Lunge]","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Aalborg University Hospital, Klinik Hjerte-Lunge"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Finn Lund","key":"henriksenpau","last":"Henriksen","locid":"df341fee-5044-4b19-b725-cfbd0e7914bf","name":"Henriksen, Finn Lund","orcid":"0000-0002-1192-532X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Per","key":"schorlingpau","last":"Schorling","name":"Schorling, Per","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Bruno","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Bruno","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 3","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"schakowpau","last":"Schakow","locid":"b0b1aca1-661f-4913-a648-123069a88766","name":"Schakow, Henrik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Mogens Lytken","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"4dd22edc-ce70-44c0-beff-7afe7a9c8c47","name":"Larsen, Mogens Lytken","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1504/ijnvo.2016.075131","issn":["14709503","17415225"],"issn_org":["14709503"],"issue":"1","journal":"International Journal of Networking and Virtual Organisations","pages":"86-102","publisher":"Inderscience Publishers","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Networking and Virtual Organisations","volume":"16"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84961167286"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Region of Southern Denmark","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["aau-072ed052-0b33-49ff-990a-937cf76dcaee","sdu-958654a3-54f1-4d9c-9fde-2da849fb0881"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"FirstAED emergency dispatch, global positioning of community first responders with distinct roles : A solution to reduce the response times and ensuring an AED to early defibrillation in the rural area Langeland","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-000375","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"Indvinding af skifergas har i de senere år påkaldt sig stigende interesse internationalt og i Danmark.På den baggrund har Miljø- og Fødevareministeriet bedt DTU, GEUS og DCE om at indgå en konsortieaftale om at udarbejde en videnskabelig udredning.Formålet med den videnskabelige udredning er at sætte international viden om indvinding af skifergas i relation til en dansk kontekst.I udredningen redegøres der for de regionale geologiske forhold i skifergasproduktion i Danmark, boring og effekt af boring og frakturering, og der foretages en analyse af de mulige påvirkninger af miljø og vandressourcer samt landskab og trafik.På den baggrund gives der indledningsvist en overordnet beskrivelse af skifergas, forventet anvendt teknologi i forbindelse med skifergasproduktion samt en beskrivelse af mulige miljøpåvirkninger og tilgængelige afværgeforanstaltninger.Den videnskabelige udredning indeholder også en screening af de risici og farer, der kunne være forbundet med skifergasindvinding i Danmark.","author_count":39,"contributors":["Nielsen, Niels Axel","Christensen, Thomas Højlund","Aagaard, Niels-Jørgen","Bach, Hanne","Larsen, Flemming","Britze, Peter","Molzen, Jan Eiersted","Hansen, Steffen Foss","Johnsen, Anders R.","Jensen, Poul Nordemann","Odgaard, Mads H","Bjerg, Poul Løgstrup","Fabricius, Ida Lykke","Jensen, Lotte Bjerregaard","Scheutz, Charlotte","Andersen, Henrik Rasmus","Kjeldsen, Peter","Hjorth, Rune","Baun, Anders","Kozin, Igor","Nikolajew, Maja Møller","Sørensen, Morten Kanne","Nielsen, Thomas Alexander Sick","Schovsbo, Niels","Kidmose, Jakob B.","Gravesen, Peter","Voss, Peter","Jakobsen, Rasmus","Pedersen, Stig Asbjørn Schack","Larsen, Tine B.","Dahl Jensen, Trine","Laier, Troels","Sanderson, Hans","Baattrup-Pedersen, Annette","Winding, Anne","Levin, Gregor","Jessen Rasmussen, Jes","Gustavson, Kim","Frederiksen, Pia"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-012182"],"filters":{"added":"2023-05","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class