{"abstract":"OBJECTIVES: Self-rated health is an important aspect of life after stroke. The aim of this study was to compare self-rated health in a population of stroke patients to the general Danish population and to analyze to what extent clinical and patient-related factors influence self-rated health 3 months after stroke. METHODS: We sent questionnaires on self-rated health (Short Form-12 Health Survey) to all patients younger than 80 years with first-time stroke admitted to any hospital in the Central Denmark Region between October 1, 2008, and December 31, 2011 (N = 2414). Information on clinical and patient-related determinants of self-rated health was obtained from population-based national health registers. RESULTS: Compared to the general population, stroke patients rated their health lower than the general Danish population. The largest differences were found in domains of physical health, and only minor differences were identified in mental health between the study and the general Danish population. Stroke severity, comorbidity, smoking, educational level, and age were strongly associated with self-reported health. For patients with a \"very severe\" stroke, the adjusted odds ratios (ORs) of reduced mental health were 1.6 (95% confidence interval [CI]: 1.3-2.6) and 5.1 (95% CI: 2.7-9.6) for low physical health, compared to patients with \"mild stroke.\" Patients with a Charlson Comorbidity Index score of 3 or higher had a higher risk of low mental health (OR 1.9 [95% CI: 1.3-2.6]) and low physical health (OR 2.8 [95% CI: 1.9-4.0]) than patients with no additive diseases. CONCLUSIONS: Stroke had a marked impact of self-rated health, particularly physical health. Higher stroke severity and level of comorbidity were important risk factors of reduced self-rated health.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Larsen, Louise Pape","Johnsen, Søren Paaske","Andersen, Grethe","Hjøllund, Niels Henrik Ingvar"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-193408"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"determinants of self rated health three months after stroke","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84964556109","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-193408","identifier":[{"id":"84964556109","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26920345","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-703b2fb9-d627-4ca0-a193-bc5f00e72f2f"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-727DBB9CE7328ACC9788D746919110B4"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2016","yearSub":"2016"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Clinical Epidemiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Louise Pape","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"8439769e-e2f5-4a26-b4f2-abb4ecb05818","name":"Larsen, Louise Pape","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Paaske","key":"johnsenpau","last":"Johnsen","locid":"4664f7a0-39e7-4f46-9121-1c3999eb3d09","name":"Johnsen, Søren Paaske","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Grethe","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"97e157c9-4cb4-4690-a971-06e4699b50fe","name":"Andersen, Grethe","orcid":"0000-0001-6807-2500","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Niels Henrik Ingvar","key":"hjøllundpau","last":"Hjøllund","locid":"f85b1091-e209-4393-86c7-69c32d4dd518","name":"Hjøllund, Niels Henrik Ingvar","orcid":"0000-0002-6697-6597","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26920345"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jstrokecerebrovasdis.2015.12.014","issn":["10523057","15328511"],"issn_org":["10523057"],"issue":"5","journal":"Journal of Stroke & Cerebrovascular Diseases","pages":"1027-1034","publisher":"WB  Saunders","publisher_org":"W.B. Saunders","status":"p","title":"Journal of Stroke & Cerebrovascular Diseases","title_org":"Journal of stroke and cerebrovascular diseases : the official journal of National Stroke Association","volume":"25"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84964556109"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-703b2fb9-d627-4ca0-a193-bc5f00e72f2f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Determinants of Self-Rated Health Three Months after Stroke","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-193408","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
{"abstract":"This paper examines the changes in consumer behaviour and opinions due to the transition from a public to a commercial broadcaster in the context of broadcasting international media events. By analyzing TV viewer ratings, Facebook activity and its sentiment, we aim to provide answers to how the transition from airing Winter Olympic Games on NRK to TV2 in Norway affected consumer behaviour and opinion.We used text classification and visual analytics methods on the business and social datasets. Our main finding is a clear link between negative sentiment and commercials. Despite positive change in customer behaviour, there was a negative change in customer opinion. Based on media events and broadcaster theories, we identify generalisable findings for all such transitions.","author_count":22,"contributors":["Hennig, Anna","Åmodt, Anne-Sofie","Hernes, Henrik","Nygårdsmoen, Helene Mejer","Arenfeldt Larsen, Peter","Mukkamala, Raghava Rao","Flesch, Benjamin","Hussain, Abid","Vatrapu, Ravi"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-294918"],"event":{"end":"2016-12-08","place":"Washington, DC, us","start":"2016-12-05","title":"Fourth IEEE International Conference on Big Data. IEEE BigData 2016","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Big data analytics","Big social data","Facebook","Social set analysis","Social set visualiser","Television viewer behaviour","Text classification"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"big social data analytics of changes in consumer behaviour and opinion of a tv broadcaster","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/58551745/2016_IEEE_BigData_TextAnalytics_WinterOlympics_NRK_TV2.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-294918","identifier":[{"id":"85015254479","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["cbs-cd26e52d-9b41-4a9b-86ef-200f504f616b"],"keyword":["Big data analytics","Big social data","Facebook","Social set analysis","Social set visualiser","Television viewer behaviour","Text classification"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7966CB26FC3E4316909B8F598E10F067"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"loc","url":"https://research-api.cbs.dk/ws/files/58551745/2016_IEEE_BigData_TextAnalytics_WinterOlympics_NRK_TV2.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of IT Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Anna","key":"hennigpau","last":"Hennig","name":"Hennig, Anna","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne-Sofie","key":"åmodtpau","last":"Åmodt","name":"Åmodt, Anne-Sofie","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"hernespau","last":"Hernes","name":"Hernes, Henrik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Helene Mejer","key":"nygårdsmoenpau","last":"Nygårdsmoen","name":"Nygårdsmoen, Helene Mejer","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"arenfeldtlarsenpau","last":"Arenfeldt Larsen","name":"Arenfeldt Larsen, Peter","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Raghava Rao","key":"mukkamalapau","last":"Mukkamala","locid":"be02cc2c-6ea7-4448-bd17-71ddd8fa6069","name":"Mukkamala, Raghava Rao","orcid":"00