{"abstract":"Inden for det seneste år har vi set en voldsom opblomstring i interessen og bekymringen for begrebet seksuel chikane. Vi hører om det i storbyernes natteliv. Donald Trump berettede i den amerikanske præsidentvalgkamp åbenhjertigt om, hvor på kroppen han må befalme eller kysse en kvinde, fordi han har magt.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-292267"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sexchikane kan og skal bekæmpes","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-292267","ids":["cbs-b1c02534-c5f6-48ac-ae98-b4594846a417"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CC95701C2E18537F66DBA2DC53829566"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01091182"],"newspaper":"Jyllands-Posten","pages":"4","publisher":"JP/Politikens Hus AS","publisher_org":"JP/Politikens Hus A/S","status":"p","title":"Jyllands-Posten"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["c