{"abstract":"Glacier surface mass-balance measurements on Greenland started more than a century ago, but no compilation exists of the observations from the ablation area of the ice sheet and local glaciers. Such data could be used in the evaluation of modelled surface mass balance, or to document changes in glacier melt independently from model output. Here, we present a comprehensive database of Greenland glacier surface mass-balance observations from the ablation area of the ice sheet and local glaciers. The database spans the 123 a from 1892 to 2015, contains a total of similar to 3000 measurements from 46 sites, and is openly accessible through the PROMICE web portal (http://www.promice.dk). For each measurement we provide X, Y and Z coordinates, starting and ending dates as well as quality flags. We give sources for each entry and for all metadata. Two thirds of the data were collected from grey literature and unpublished archive documents. Roughly 60% of the measurements were performed by the Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland (GEUS, previously GGU). The data cover all regions of Greenland except for the southernmost part of the east coast, but also emphasize the importance of long-term time series of which there are only two exceeding 20 a. We use the data to analyse uncertainties in point measurements of surface mass balance, as well as to estimate surface mass-balance profiles for most regions of Greenland.","author_count":43,"contributors":["Machguth, Horst","Thomsen, Henrik H.","Weidick, Anker","Ahlstrøm, Andreas P.","Abermann, Jakob","Andersen, Morten L.","Andersen, Signe B.","Bjørk, Anders A.","Box, Jason E.","Braithwaite, Roger J.","Bøggild, Carl E.","Citterio, Michele","Clement, Poul","Colgan, William","Fausto, Robert S.","Gleie, Karin","Gubler, Stefanie","Hasholt, Bent","Hynek, Bernhard","Knudsen, N. Tvis","Larsen, Signe H.","Mernild, Sebastian H.","Oerlemans, Johannes","Oerter, Hans","Olesen, Ole B.","Smeets, C. J. P. Paul","Steffen, Konrad","Stober, Manfred","Sugiyama, Shin","Van As, Dirk","Van Den Broeke, Michiel R.","Van De Wal, Roderik S W"],"cuid":["S03-099.43-023812"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"continent":["America, North","America, South","Asia, East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Machguth, Horst"],"country":["Austria","Canada","Chile","Germany","Greenland","Japan","Netherlands","Norway","Switzerland","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["Alfred Wegener Institute - Helmholtz Centre for Polar and Marine Research","All Global Affiliations","Asiaq Greenland Survey","Central Institution for Meteorology and Geodynamics","Cooperative Institute for Research in Environmental Sciences (CIRES), University of Colorado","ETH Zürich","Geological Survey of Denmark and Greenland","Greenland Survey","Helmholtz Association of German Research Centres","Helmholtz Centre for Polar and Marine Research, Bremerhaven","Hokkaido University","MeteoSwiss","Sogn og Fjordane University College","Stuttgart Technology University of Applied Sciences","Swiss Federal Institute for Forest, Snow and Landscape Research","Universidad de Magallanes","University of Manchester","University of Stuttgart","University of Zurich","Utrecht University","Western Norway University of Applied Sciences","York University Toronto","Zentralanstalt für Meteorologie und Geodynamik, Wien"],"keyword":["Glacier and ice caps","Ice sheet","Surface mass balance"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-GEUS"],"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-GEUS","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"greenland surface mass balance observations from the ice sheet ablation area and local glaciers","src":["