{"abstract":"Familiær hyperkolesterolæmi er en alvorlig tilstand med 13 gange øget risiko for iskæmisk hjertesygdom. Forfatterne præsenterer her en meget enkel algoritme: Henvis voksne til lipidklinik, hvis LDL- kolesterol ≥ 5 mmol/l (børn hvis LDL ≥ 4 mmol/l).","author_count":7,"contributors":["Bundgaard, Henning","Charles, Morten","Corell, Pernille","Bang, Lia","Henriksen, Finn Lund","Mogens L, Larsen","Jensen, Henrik Kjærulf"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-264568"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Arvelige sygdomme","Risikofaktorer","hjerte karsygdomme","kolesterol"],"level":"pop","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"lettere opsporing af familiær hyperkolesterolæmi i almen praksis","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-264568","ids":["au-ecedd037-67e7-433f-8f4b-08bfb92601c2"],"keyword":["arvelige sygdomme","forhøjet kolesterol","hjerte-karsygdomme","kolesterol","risikofaktorer"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-560ED5E231A00984B23FF0B3DB966F3C"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Public Health, Department of Public Health - Institute of General Medical Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Henning","key":"bundgaardpau","last":"Bundgaard","name":"Bundgaard, Henning","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"charlespau","last":"Charles","locid":"f5113347-eb47-447a-85b6-5ed82248882e","name":"Charles, Morten","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Pernille","key":"corellpau","last":"Corell","name":"Corell, Pernille","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Lia","key":"bangpau","last":"Bang","name":"Bang, Lia","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Finn Lund","key":"henriksenpau","last":"Henriksen","name":"Henriksen, Finn Lund","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Larsen","key":"mogenslpau","last":"Mogens L","name":"Mogens L, Larsen","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik Kjærulf","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"5fb8d709-1b6d-4959-8f16-a4b5d78b436d","name":"Jensen, Henrik Kjærulf","orcid":"0000-0003-1802-4302","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["13955217","19047002"],"issn_org":["19047002"],"issue":"11","journal":"Månedsskrift for Almen Praksis","pages":"882-892","publisher":"Maanedsskrift for Almen Praksis","status":"p","title":"Månedsskrift for Almen Praksis","volume":"93"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-ecedd037-67e7-433f-8f4b-08bfb92601c2"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Lettere opsporing af familiær hyperkolesterolæmi i almen praksis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-264568","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Danske ledere skal lede nedad og opad på samme tid. Det er svært, men ikke umuligt. Mellemledere skal opleve, at de bakkes op og påskønnes for at lede opad. Den måske største udfordring for danske ledere i disse år er at mestre det umulige, nemlig at lede nedad og opad på samme tid. At man derved \"stjæler\" ansvar, stolthed, ejerskab og udviklingsmuligheder fra medarbejderne, opdager man slet ikke. Talentudvikling bliver f. eks. nødlidende, for udvikler man talenter i egen enhed, bliver de nok hugget af andre afdelinger. Hvor dum kan man være?","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-276009"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"udfordringen for ledere er at de skal mestre det umulige","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-276009","ids":["cbs-066a456c-2255-49e9-8501-9cbe7cce99b2"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-40047EBC4E29AB2EAD3B77FF3177BDD8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01091182"],"newspaper":"Jyllands-Posten","publisher":"JP/Politikens Hus AS","publisher_org":"JP/Politikens Hus A/S","status":"p","title":"Jyllands-Posten"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-066a456c-2255-49e9-8501-9cbe7cce99b2"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Udfordringen for ledere er, at de skal mestre det umulige","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-276009","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Scanning transmission X-ray microscopy (STXM) compositional mapping has been used to probe the mesomorphology of nanoparticles (NPs) synthesized from two very different polymer:fullerene blends: poly(3-hexylthiophene) (P3HT): phenyl-C61-butyric acid methyl ester (PCBM) and poly[4,8-bis(2-ethylhexyloxy)benzo(1,2-b:4,5-b')dithiophene-alt-5, 6-bis(octyloxy)-4,7-di(thiophen-2-yl)(2,1,3-benzothiadiazole)-5,5'-diyl] (PSBTBT): PCBM. The STXM data shows that both blends form core-shell NP structures with similar shell compositions, but with different polymer:fullerene ratios in the core regions. P3HT:PCBM and PSBTBT:PCBM NP organic photovoltaic (OPV) devices have been fabricated and exhibit similar device efficiencies, despite the PSBTBT being a much higher performing low band gap material. By comparing the measured NP shell and core compositions with the optimized bulk hetero-junction (BHJ) compositions, we show that the relatively higher performance of the P3HT:PCBM NP device arises from the fact that its shell composition is much closer to the optimal BHJ value than that of the PSBTBT:PCBM NP device. [All rights reserved Elsevier].","author_count":10,"contributors":["Dam, Henrik Friis","Holmes, Natalie P.","Andersen, Thomas Rieks","Larsen-Olsen, Thue Trofod","Barr, Matthew","Kilcoyne, A. L. David","Zhou, Xiaojing","Dastoor, Paul C.","Krebs, Frederik C","Belcher, Warwick J."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-321214"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory","University of Newcastle"],"keyword":["Morphology","Nanoparticle","Organic photovoltaic"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the effect of mesomorphology upon the performance of nanoparticulate organic photovoltaic devices","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.solmat.2015.02.028","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-321214","identifier":[{"id":"84925381935","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-37f47fa7-a2f4-4a02-bb69-69516853494e"],"keyword":["Morphology","Nanoparticle","Organic photovoltaic"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-76C90A15FE7BCE56C3D3C6BA2F32BFEF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.solmat.2015.02.028","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage, Functional organic materials"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"au","key":"university of newcastle","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"University of Newcastle","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"lawrence berkeley national laboratory","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik Friis","key":"dampau","last":"Dam","locid":"1765cec1-6a56-4ea5-9e7f-5dc2db4436d6","name":"Dam, Henrik Friis","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Natalie P.","key":"holmespau","last":"Holmes","name":"Holmes, Natalie P.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Rieks","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"5b565ee7-484f-4110-b464-da7f775fd3d3","name":"Andersen, Thomas Rieks","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thue Trofod","key":"larsenolsenpau","last":"Larsen-Olsen","locid":"e03ae801-6940-4a24-b4a7-b23383928558","name":"Larsen-Olsen, Thue Trofod","orcid":"0000-0001-5373-898X","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Matthew","key":"barrpau","last":"Barr","name":"Barr, Matthew","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"A. L. David","key":"kilcoynepau","last":"Kilcoyne","name":"Kilcoyne, A. L. David","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Xiaojing","key":"zhoupau","last":"Zhou","name":"Zhou, Xiaojing","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Paul C.","key":"dastoorpau","last":"Dastoor","name":"Dastoor, Paul C.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Frederik C","key":"krebspau","last":"Krebs","locid":"abb371a8-55a5-4346-af79-437546c2e627","name":"Krebs, Frederik C","orcid":"0000-0003-1148-4314","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Warwick J.","key":"belcherpau","last":"Belcher","name":"Belcher, Warwick J.","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.solmat.2015.02.028","issn":["09270248"],"journal":"Solar Energy Materials & Solar Cells","pages":"102-108","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Solar Energy Materials & Solar Cells","title_org":"Solar Energy Materials and Solar Cells","volume":"138"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84925381935"],"sdg":["7. Affordable and Clean Energy","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-37f47fa7-a2f4-4a02-bb69-69516853494e"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"The effect of mesomorphology upon the performance of nanoparticulate organic photovoltaic devices","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-321214","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"In recent years there has been an immense development of new targeted anti-cancer drugs. For practicing precision medicine, a sensitive method imaging for non-invasive, assessment of early treatment response and for assisting in developing new drugs is warranted. Magnetic Resonance Spectroscopy (MRS) is a potent technique for non-invasive in vivo investigation of tissue chemistry and cellular metabolism. Hyperpolarization by Dynamic Nuclear Polarization (DNP) is capable of creating solutions of molecules with polarized nuclear spins in a range of biological molecules and has enabled the real-time investigation of in vivo metabolism. The development of this new method has been demonstrated to enhance the nuclear polarization more than 10,000-fold, thereby significantly increasing the sensitivity of the MRS with a spatial resolution to the millimeters and a temporal resolution at the subsecond range. Furthermore, the method enables measuring kinetics of conversion of substrates into cell metabolites and can be integrated with anatomical proton magnetic resonance imaging (MRI). Many nuclei and substrates have been hyperpolarized using the DNP method. Currently, the most widely used compound is (13)C-pyruvate due to favoring technicalities. Intravenous injection of the hyperpolarized (13)C-pyruvate results in appearance of (13)C-lactate, (13)C-alanine and (13)C-bicarbonate resonance peaks depending on the tissue, disease and the metabolic state probed. In cancer, the lactate level is increased due to increased glycolysis. The use of DNP enhanced (13)C-pyruvate has in preclinical studies shown to be a sensitive method for detecting cancer and for assessment of early treatment response in a variety of cancers. Recently, a first-in-man 31-patient study was conducted with the primary objective to assess the safety of hyperpolarized (13)C-pyruvate in healthy subjects and prostate cancer patients. The study showed an elevated (13)C-lactate/(13)C-pyruvate ratio in regions of biopsy-proven prostate cancer compared to noncancerous tissue. However, more studies are needed in order to establish use of hyperpolarized (13)C MRS imaging of cancer.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Gutte, Henrik","Hansen, Adam Espe","Johannesen, Helle Hjorth","Clemmensen, Andreas Ettrup","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Nielsen, Carsten Haagen","Kjær, Andreas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-330731"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["13C pyruvate","Cancer","Dynamic nuclear polarization","MR","MRS","Response monitoring"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the use of dynamic nuclear polarization 000000000013 c pyruvate mrs in cancer","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/118229186/ajnmmi0005_0548.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-330731","ids":["dtu-57fe0a0e-fb32-4b08-bfd0-92a30c51e607"],"keyword":["13C-pyruvate","Dynamic nuclear polarization","MR","MRS","cancer","response monitoring"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-3-4-C01691BCA79362151BDA8257C00B7D8A"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/118229186/ajnmmi0005_0548.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Biomedical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"guttepau","last":"Gutte","name":"Gutte, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Adam Espe","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Adam Espe","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Helle Hjorth","key":"johannesenpau","last":"Johannesen","name":"Johannesen, Helle Hjorth","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Andreas Ettrup","key":"clemmensenpau","last":"Clemmensen","name":"Clemmensen, Andreas Ettrup","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten Haagen","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Carsten Haagen","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andreas","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","locid":"0ea206b0-1a13-4703-b6a9-1b1f01285400","name":"Kjær, Andreas","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["21608407"],"issue":"5","journal":"American Journal of Nuclear Medicine and Molecular Imaging","pages":"548-60","publisher":"e-Century Publishing Corporation","publisher_org":"E-Century Publishing Corporation","status":"p","title"