{"abstract":"Vi har længe vidst, at det kan være svært for mennesker med handicap at få et job. Men vi har ikke vidst, at en medvirkende årsag til dette er, at arbejdsgivere er meget dårlige til at spørge ansøgerne om deres handicap! Fordi dette er tilfældet, er det endnu sværere at få job, og samtidig går virksomheden glip af mange talentfulde medarbejdere. Det er surt for begge parter. Et spil med to tabere.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-292832"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"som man råber i skoven får man svar","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","text":"Undefined","type":"url","url":"https://scleroseforeningen.dk/nyhed/som-man-r%C3%A5ber-i-skoven-f%C3%A5r-man-svar%E2%80%A6","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-292832","ids":["cbs-b7a17d3c-fb9f-43af-a45b-54b82260de71"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-77C8D3C006396DF3998DF35A266076C9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Univ