ence and Clinical Biomechanics, Research Unit of Musculoskeletal Function and Physiotherapy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"no","key":"bergen university college","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Bergen University College","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Kim Gordon","key":"ingwersenpau","last":"Ingwersen","locid":"9c91afe4-9245-4d23-94e5-6bc69524ba37","name":"Ingwersen, Kim Gordon","orcid":"0000-0001-6800-4532","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"John","key":"hjarbækpau","last":"Hjarbæk","locid":"980308bb-c86b-484f-bafe-2d117034b9d6","name":"Hjarbæk, John","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"eshøjpau","last":"Eshøj","locid":"fae95446-d3b2-4cf5-a9cc-23a7ab55ed16","name":"Eshoj, Henrik","name_org":"Eshøj, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-9148-7197","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Camilla Marie","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"0fdd3035-e7da-4ae3-9e99-f247aecd54e3","name":"Larsen, Camilla Marie","orcid":"0000-0003-4691-3609","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jette Wessel","key":"vobbepau","last":"Vobbe","locid":"3daa1a3f-54b1-4c8f-94b4-29ba3594c0bc","name":"Vobbe, Jette Wessel","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Birgit","key":"juulkristensenpau","last":"Juul-Kristensen","locid":"887ddfe7-cfa6-4b72-a17d-ecf86987c5c0","name":"Juul-Kristensen, Birgit","orcid":"0000-0002-4973-8415","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-7d2640d5-8f8f-466a-a645-af921c232aac"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Sonographic Assessment Of Supraspinatus Tendinopathy As A Future Diagnostic And Effect Measure : A Reliability Study Of The Assessment Method","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-609031","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"As animals vocalize, their vocal organ transforms motor commands into vocalizations for social communication. In birds, the physical mechanisms by which vocalizations are produced and controlled remain unresolved because of the extreme difficulty in obtaining in vivo measurements. Here, we introduce an ex vivo preparation of the avian vocal organ that allows simultaneous high-speed imaging, muscle stimulation and kinematic and acoustic analyses to reveal the mechanisms of vocal production in birds across a wide range of taxa. Remarkably, we show that all species tested employ the myoelastic-aerodynamic (MEAD) mechanism, the same mechanism used to produce human speech. Furthermore, we show substantial redundancy in the control of key vocal parameters ex vivo, suggesting that in vivo vocalizations may also not be specified by unique motor commands. We propose that such motor redundancy can aid vocal learning and is common to MEAD sound production across birds and mammals, including humans.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Elemans, Coen P.H.","Rasmussen, Jeppe Have","Herbst, Christian T.","Düring, Daniel Normen","Zollinger, Sue Anne","Brumm, Henrik","Srivastava, K.","Svane, Niels","Ding, Ming","Larsen, Ole Næsbye","Sober, Sam J.","Svec, Jan G."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-612715"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Elemans, Coen P.H."],"country":["Czechia","France","Germany","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Emory University","Georgia Institute of Technology","Max Planck Institute for Ornithology","Palacký University Olomouc","Universite de Saint-Etienne/Lyon, ENES/CNPS CNRS UMR8195, Saint-Etienne 42023, France"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"universal mechanisms of sound production and control in birds and mammals","src":["sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/ncomms9978","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-612715","identifier":[{"id":"26612008","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84944911378","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC4674827","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["sdu-89cc6673-c3a1-4cf7-8fdd-b1335ab42b8c"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-CD9A4369ACFADB56531D19229248689F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/ncomms9978","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"loc","url":"https://findresearcher.sdu.dk/ws/files/137389098/Universal_mechanisms_of_sound_production_and_control_in_birds_and_mammals.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, Faculty of Science, Department of Biology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"us","key":"emory university","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Emory University","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"fr","key":"universite de saint etienne lyon enes cnps cnrs umr8195 saint etienne 42023 france","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Universite de Saint-Etienne/Lyon, ENES/CNPS CNRS UMR8195, Saint-Etienne 42023, France","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"cz","key":"palacký university olomouc","loc":["Czechia","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Palacký University Olomouc","used":1},{