{"abstract":"The aim was to evaluate a labor-reduced and semi-automated field trial design assessed through a case study estimating the effect of row spacing, seeding density and seeding pattern on maize yield and feed quality. The trial consisted of 70 different treatment combinations and 560 parcels in total. The drone-based orthophoto proved to be a valuable tool pinpointing the parcels with experimental errors exemplified by rows not seeded or patches with bare soil. The results of the field trial showed no interaction between row spacing and plant density. The yield increased due to decreasing row spacing and increasing plant density.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Nyholm Jørgensen, Rasmus","Brandt, M.B.","Schmidt, Thomas","Laursen, Morten Stigaard","Larsen, Rene","Nørremark, Michael","Midtiby, H.S.","Christiansen, Peter"],"cuid":["S02-087.76-026064"],"event":{"end":"2015-07-16","place":"Volcani Center, il","start":"2015-07-12","title":"10th European Conference on Precision Agriculture","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Nyholm Jørgensen, Rasmus"],"keyword":["Computer vision","Seeding pattern","Unmanned aerial vehicle"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"field trial design using semi automated conventional machinery and aerial drone imaging for outlier identification","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84947219715","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-087.76-026064","identifier":[{"id":"84947219715","type