{"abstract":"PURPOSE: To study the relation between the interval from diagnosis to initiation of intravitreal injection therapy and visual outcome in neovascular age-related macular degeneration (nAMD) and to report changes over time in fellow-eye status. METHODS: Retrospective chart review. The study included 1185 eyes in 1099 patients who began vascular endothelial growth factor inhibitor treatment for nAMD during four separate periods in 2007, 2009, 2011 and 2012 using a fixed loading-dose regimen of three ranibizumab injections. RESULTS: Mean best-corrected visual acuity (BCVA) at presentation remained within the range 0.23-0.24 Snellen and the median patient age within 79-80 years, whereas BCVA at first visit after the third injection increased from 0.24 to 0.31 (p < 0.0001) in concert with a shift in preferred practice from separate-day injection to same-day injection. This led to a reduction in the median time to treatment from 16 days to 1 day. The proportion of patients with fellow-eye BCVA 0.05 or worse at presentation with newly diagnosed wet AMD in the incident eye decreased from 38% to 22% (p < 0.0018). The proportion of bilaterally treated patients increased during the study period. CONCLUSION: In this study, 2-week-earlier injection was associated with the equivalent of a 5-Early Treatment Diabetic Retinopathy Study letter-gain in mean visual acuity at 3 months after presentation. The difference is larger than expected from the 2-week-longer duration of disease at the study end-point. The study supports that early diagnosis and treatment of nAMD is of value for functional outcomes.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Rasmussen, Annette","Bloch, Sara Brandi","Fuchs, Josefine","Hansen, Louise Hillerup","Lund-Andersen, Henrik","Sander, Birgit","Larsen, Michael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-520241"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Aged","Aged 80 and over","Angiogenesis Inhibitors","Female","Humans","Intravitreal Injections","Male","Ranibizumab","Retrospective Studies","Time to Treatment","Vascular Endothelial Growth Factor A","Visual Acuity","Wet Macular Degeneration"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"visual outcomes in relation to time to treatment in neovascular age related macular degeneration","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-520241","identifier":[{"id":"84945299412","type":"scopus"},{"id":"26073051","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-d446fc00-ca8e-43e1-8fd7-5a58dbe84998"],"keyword":["Aged","Aged, 80 and over","Angiogenesis Inhibitors","Female","Humans","Intravitreal Injections","Male","Ranibizumab","Retrospective Studies","Time-to-Treatment","Vascular Endothelial Growth Factor A","Visual Acuity","Wet Macular Degeneration"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C9FC4D01BA7AC02B26FDEF372CF38025"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Annette","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","name":"Rasmussen, Annette","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Sara Brandi","key":"blochpau","last":"Bloch","locid":"3fb86bf5-f5d1-4dc7-9392-82a3b9b4609e","name":"Bloch, Sara Brandi","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Josefine","key":"fuchspau","last":"Fuchs","name":"Fuchs, Josefine","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Louise Hillerup","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Louise Hillerup","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"lundandersenpau","last":"Lund-Andersen","locid":"5277856f-b771-4658-bb2f-b292ec78ee6f","name":"Lund-Andersen, Henrik","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Birgit","key":"sanderpau","last":"Sander","locid":"62cb74c8-aa3c-4d9e-9cbb-03250f760560","name":"Sander, Birgit","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Michael","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"1d460214-c0db-4a15-a3a5-360c73746ed4","name":"Larsen, Michael","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["26073051"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/aos.12781","issn":["1755375X","17553768"],"issn_org":["1755375X"],"issue":"7","journal":"Acta Ophthalmologica","pages":"616-20","status":"p","title":"Acta Ophthalmologica","volume":"93"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84945299412"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-d446fc00-ca8e-43e1-8fd7-5a58dbe84998"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Visual outcomes in relation to time to treatment in neovascular age-related macular degeneration","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-520241","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Begrebet ”velfærdsteknologi” er forholdsvis nyt i Danmark. Det er dog ikke et nyt fænomen, at teknologi har indflydelse på det daglige sociale arbejde og socialrådgiverprofessionen. Socialrådgiveruddannelsens opgave er at uddanne socialrådgivere med praksisrelevante kompetencer, og derfor må vi forholde os til velfærdsteknologiens indtog i det sociale arbejde. Vores intention har været at stille skarpt på det velfærdsteknologiske kompetencefelt på UC Sjællands socialrådgiveruddannelse via dannelsesbegrebet. Vi har derfor stillet spørgsmålet: Hvordan kan vi forstå og arbejde med udviklingen af de socialrådgiverstuderendes velfærdsteknologiske dannelse?","author_count":6,"contributors":["Lysen, Nadja Holmgaard","Larsen, Ann-Britt Lærkedahl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-555346"],"filters":{"added":"2023-07","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Velfærdsteknologi"],"level":"pop","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-AB","DI-UC-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-AB"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hvordan kan man forstå velfærdsteknologisk dannelse i relation til socialrådgiverprofessionen hvad kan den velfærdsteknologisk dannede socialrådgiver","src":["pha"],"src-code":["DI-UC-AB"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ucsj.dk/fileadmin/user_upload/FU/projekter/Viol/Velfaerd__teknologi_og_laering_i_et_professionsperspektiv.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-555346","ids":["pha-c97a42e7-d318-4229-9dc5-e99cfaab8099"],"keyword":["velfærdsteknologi"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","noi":["Local-1-1-64BF87FD124F1C18E8D1C70DC4B2AEDC"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://ucsj.dk/fileadmin/user_upload/FU/projekter/Viol/Velfaerd__teknologi_og_laering_i_et_professionsperspektiv.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"university college absa