University of Denmark"],"title":"Wind resource assessment and wind power forecasting","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-331947","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"A solution-processed silver film is employed in the processing of top-illuminated indium-tin-oxide (ITO)-free polymer solar cells in single- and double-junction (tandem) structures. The nontransparent silver film fully covers the substrate and serves as the bottom electrode whereas a PEDOT:PSS/Ag grid forms the semitransparent top electrode. All layers are roll-coated/printed on a flexible substrate by using only two techniques: slot–die coating for up to 11 consecutive layers and flexo-printing for the last Ag grid layer. The slot–die coated Ag film is compared to an evaporated Ag film in terms of surface morphological and topographical properties and to ITO in terms of flexibility. The slot–die coated Ag film demonstrates extremely low roughness (a root-meansquare roughness of 3 nm was measured over 240_320 mm2 area), is highly conductive (<1 W/&), highly flexible, and cost-effective in comparison to other reported metal films applied in polymer solar cells. Such properties result in high fill factors exceeding 50% in both single and tandem structures on large-area devices (1 cm2) and the corresponding efficiencies exceed 2%.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Angmo, Dechan","Dam, Henrik Friis","Andersen, Thomas Rieks","Zawacka, Natalia Klaudia","Madsen, Morten Vesterager","Stubager, Jørgen","Livi, Francesco","Gupta, Ritu","Helgesen, Martin","Carlé, Jon Eggert","Larsen-Olsen, Thue Trofod","Kulkarni, Giridhar U.","Bundgaard, Eva","Krebs, Frederik C"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-353555"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, South"],"country":["India"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Jawaharlal Nehru Centre for Advanced Scientific Research"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"all solution processed ambient method for ito free roll coated tandem polymer solar cells using solution processed metal films","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ente.201402012","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-353555","identifier":[{"id":"84991309750","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-a42cd6be-9104-446a-934f-b57611dbe928"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DA8D5AE3D0A4E7F97AA230DC56ED463B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/ente.201402012","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Energy Conversion and Storage, Functional organic materials"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"in","key":"jawaharlal nehru centre for advanced scientific research","loc":["India","Asia, South"],"name":"Jawaharlal Nehru Centre for Advanced Scientific Research","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Dechan","key":"angmopau","last":"Angmo","locid":"dcdd5b36-4424-40d7-a490-e9c924703d9e","name":"Angmo, Dechan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik Friis","key":"dampau","last":"Dam","locid":"1765cec1-6a56-4ea5-9e7f-5dc2db4436d6","name":"Dam, Henrik Friis","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Thomas Rieks","key":"andersenpau","last":"Ander