","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Lila","key":"puripau","last":"Puri","name":"Puri, Lila","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Santosh","key":"rayamajhipau","last":"Rayamajhi","name":"Rayamajhi, Santosh","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.worlddev.2014.03.011","issn":["0305750X"],"issue":"Supplement 1","journal":"World Development","status":"p","title":"World Development","volume":"64"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84911380722"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen","the international woodland company a/s (biz)"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-25b90a5b-9ec7-4bb0-9fd2-e3dc0f3503c0"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Are forest incomes sustainable? Firewood and timber extraction and productivity in community managed forests in Nepal","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-415954","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-435572"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"skotland stemmer om selvstændighed","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-435572","ids":["ku-468fb4f0-48f6-4d63-9aaf-ffe58cf30621"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-3D5F4148260F185720600D0C201778E2"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Centre for European Politics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"36bbf99a-f2ff-4406-b1ca-f9cb7be18f17","name":"Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["13953818"],"issue":"1","journal":"Udenrigs","pages":"81-87","status":"p","title":"Udenrigs","volume":"2014"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-468fb4f0-48f6-4d63-9aaf-ffe58cf30621"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Skotland stemmer om selvstændighed","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-435572","year":"2014","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"This article attempts to demonstrate the importance of the discursive context for whether and, if so, how the European Union (EU) can exert normative power in different policy areas. Surprisingly, the concept of power has not been extensively discussed in the academic literature on Normative Power Europe, with the notable exceptions of Diez (2013); Keene (2012); Forsberg (2011) and Huelss (2011) (who also discuss the meaning of the ‘normative’). Focusing on power, the question asked in this article is how the discursive context of the politics of religion affects the EU’s ability to exert normative power in this area. The article examines the politics of religion by looking at the case of the debate about human rights versus religion in the United Nations Human Rights Council after the year 2000. The broader point addressed in the article is whether the EU can exert normative power regardless of the discursive context of the policy area concerned.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-441340"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Discourse analysis","European Union","Faculty of Social Sciences","Normative Power Europe","Politics of Religion","United Nations"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"normative power europe and the importance of the discursive context the european union and the politics of religion","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-441340","identifier":[{"id":"84911166536","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-50370ddd-b386-48db-85fb-d6d8be5dbe9a"],"keyword":["Discourse analysis","European Union","Faculty of Social Sciences","Human Rights Council","Normative Power Europe","Normative power Europe Religion EU","United Nations","politics of religion"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-8882FBC9CAB97C8A8A6A9A2B6B94EC69"],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Centre for European Politics","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Department of Political Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"36bbf99a-f2ff-4406-b1ca-f9cb7be18f17","name":"Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1177/0010836714532918","issn":["00108367","14603691"],"issn_org":["00108367"],"issue":"4","journal":"Cooperation and Conflict","pages":"419-437","paperid":"1","status":"p","title":"Cooperation and Conflict","volume":"49"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84911166536"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-50370ddd-b386-48db-85fb-d6d8be5dbe9a"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Normative Power Europe and the Importance of the Discursive Context : The European Union and the politics of religion","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-441340","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Skovpolitisk Udvalg anbefalede i 2011 at undersøge, om der er en sammenhæng mellem en for samfundet uhensigtsmæssig skovdrift og det private skovbrugs økonomiske rammevilkår, herunder beskatning. Et netop afsluttet forskningsprojekt ved Københavns Universitet har undersøgt beskatningens indflydelse på skovdriften. Resultaterne viser, at når skovejeren har som målsætning at opnå størst mulig indtjening fra skoven, så fører skattereglerne kun i særlige tilfælde til beslutninger, der adskiller sig fra den samfundsmæssigt ønskværdige håndtering af træproduktionen.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Meilby, Henrik","Thorsen, Bo Jellesmark","Nord-Larsen, Thomas","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Jacobsen, Jette Bredahl"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-448177"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"skattemæssige rammevilkår for skovbruget","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-448177","ids":["ku-5b7524fa-2ceb-4872-9134-e9da34b14e67"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-9F539225D790523B42F06AA0563D079D"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Food and Resource Economics, Section for Environment and Natural Resources"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"meilbypau","last":"Meilby","locid":"0ddac490-e5da-4c91-82ba-c64fbcd81e27","name":"Meilby, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-3770-3880","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Bo Jellesmark","key":"thorsenpau","last":"Thorsen","locid":"a11f0f2d-120f-475b-9d08-eadc2de0f6b6","name":"Thorsen, Bo Jellesmark","orcid":"0000-0002-3305-8343","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Thomas","key":"nordlarsenpau","last":"Nord-Larsen","locid":"d5b3bda9-5a06-45e4-8c9a-07e768bef87a","name":"Nord-Larsen, Thomas","orcid":"0000-0002-5341-6435","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Vivian Kvist","key":"johannsenpau","last":"Johannsen","locid":"50454320-c098-4230-8b34-90829dbe308c","name":"Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","orcid":"0000-0002-1268-9787","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jette Bredahl","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"c865ba8d-b14d-4b86-8337-ba9970d36302","name":"Jacobsen, Jette Bredahl","orcid":"0000-0002-1313-6228","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01068539"],"issue":"12","journal":"Skoven","pages":"514-517","status":"p","title":"Skoven","volume":"46"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-5b7524fa-2ceb-4872-9134-e9da34b14e67"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Skattemæssige rammevilkår for skovbruget","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-448177","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Despite tremendous successes of GPCR crystallography, the receptors with available structures represent only a small fraction of human GPCRs. An important role of the modeling community is to maximize structural insights for the remaining receptors and complexes. The community-wide GPCR Dock assessment was established to stimulate and monitor the progress in molecular modeling and ligand docking for GPCRs. The four targets in the present third assessment round presented new and diverse challenges for modelers, including prediction of allosteric ligand interaction and activation states in 5-hydroxytryptamine receptors 1B and 2B, and modeling by extremely distant homology for smoothened receptor. Forty-four modeling groups participated in the assessment. State-of-the-art modeling approaches achieved close-to-experimental accuracy for small rigid orthosteric ligands and models built by close homology, and they correctly predicted protein fold for distant homology targets. Predictions of long loops and GPCR activation states remain unsolved problems.","author_count":116,"contributors":["Kufareva, Irina","Katritch, Vsevolod","Biggin, Phil","Kim, Minsup","Park, Kichul","Jung, Sang Won","Cho, Art E.","Sands, Zara A.","Ostopovici-Halip, Liliana","Bologa, Cristian G.","Norn, Christoffer","Brylinski, Michal","Skolnick, Jeffrey","Keränen, Henrik","Lenselink, Bart E.","Van Westen, Gerard","Overington, John P.","De Teráán, Hugo Gutiérrez","Isberg, Vignir","Fidom, Kimberley M.","Lehto, Thomas M.","Gloriam, David E","Ghosh, Anirban","Sonavane, Uddhavesh","Joshi, Rajendra","Xia, Jie","Hsieh, Jui Hua","Zhang, Liangren","Wang, Xiang Simon","Vogel, Horst","Yuan, Shuguang","Feng, X.","Chen, M.","Ambia, J.","Barth, P.","Gageat, Cédric","Stepniewski, Michal","Xhaard, Henri","Kelm, Sebastian","Pitt, William R.","Shi, Jiye","Larsen, Adrien","Li, Hubert","Wagner, Jeffrey","Bhattacharya, Supriyo","Vaidehi, Nagarajan","Kanou, Kazuhiko","Cvicek, Vaclav","Kim, Soo Kyung","Trzaskows