{"author_count":8,"contributors":["Laustsen, Christoffer","Lipsoe, Kasper","Palm, Fredrik","Østergaard, Jakob Appel","Nørregaard, Rikke","Flyvbjerg, Allan","Pedersen, Michael","Ardenkjaer-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-132016"],"event":{"end":"2014-03-22","place":"Aarhus, dk","start":"2008-03-21","title":"Rising Stars Symposium","year":"2008"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hyperpolarized 000000000013c mrs reveals oxygen sensitive pseudo hypxia in the diabetic kidney","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-132016","ids":["au-04bcc337-51b1-4e49-a4af-f7126ea11054"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0647F44FE3A1E6D586D4F0FA8E26CB2A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The MR Research Centre"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Christoffer","key":"laustsenpau","last":"Laustsen","locid":"ba5f7084-cbbb-4c1a-9fb6-85cce410d52a","name":"Laustsen, Christoffer","orcid":"0000-0002-0317-2911","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kasper","key":"lipsoepau","last":"Lipsoe","name":"Lipsoe, Kasper","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Fredrik","key":"palmpau","last":"Palm","name":"Palm, Fredrik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jakob Appel","key":"østergaardpau","last":"Østergaard","locid":"e6e06b1e-ca0c-4f92-99c3-66e7d3704b09","name":"Østergaard, Jakob Appel","orcid":"0000-0002-9877-5327","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rikke","key":"nørregaardpau","last":"Nørregaard","locid":"1475b841-344f-4845-8ed0-f6569b97452c","name":"Nørregaard, Rikke","orcid":"0000-0002-0580-373X","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Allan","key":"flyvbjergpau","last":"Flyvbjerg","locid":"29cf36bd-c1a0-4026-8c90-a70cb1f46402","name":"Flyvbjerg, Allan","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Michael","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"871199c4-33bb-4fac-95ef-9a2266f30695","name":"Pedersen, Michael","orcid":"0000-0002-1146-0382","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjaerlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjaer-Larsen","name":"Ardenkjaer-Larsen, Jan Henrik","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-04bcc337-51b1-4e49-a4af-f7126ea11054"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Hyperpolarized 13C MRS reveals oxygen sensitive pseudo hypxia in the diabetic kidney","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-132016","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Oocyte competence has been related to mtDNA copy number, but a large variation in mtDNA copy number between oocytes has been observed, caused by, e.g. oocyte donor and oocyte size (Sato et al. 2014 PLOS ONE 9, e94488; Cotterill et al. 2013 Mol. Hum. Reprod. 19, 444–450; El Shourbagy et al. 2006 Reproduction 131, 233–245). However, the correlation between size and mtDNA copy number in single oocytes has not been determined. This study describes the relation between oocytes of defined diameters from individual pre- and postpubertal pigs and mtDNA copy number. Cumulus-oocyte complexes were aspirated from ovaries of 10 pre- and 10 post-pubertal pigs. Cumulus cells were removed and the oocytes were measured (inside-ZP-diameter). Oocytes were transferred to DNAase-free tubes, snap-frozen, and stored at –80°C. The genes ND1 and COX1 were used to determine the mtDNA copy number. Plasmid preparations containing ND1 and COX1 were used to prepare standard curves. Q-PCR reactions using ND1and COX1 specific primers and probes were run in triplicate on a ViiA7 real-time PCR system using TaqMan (Applied BioSystems, Foster City, CA, USA). Standard curves showed high correlation coefficients (r2 = 0.99–1.00) and amplification efficiencies (COX1, 91–104%; ND1, 84–92%). As inter-assay control, standard curves were compared using interaction with dates, showing no differences. mtDNA copy number between groups was compared by ANOVA after log-transformation of data. Relationship between oocyte size and mtDNA copy number was analysed using linear regression. Data were analysed by SAS procedures, SGPLOT and GLM (SAS 9.3, SAS Institute Inc., Cary, NC, USA) with P < 0.05 as significance level. In total, 145 pre- and 93 post-pubertal oocytes were analysed (6–15 from each donor). Mean mtDNA copy number in oocytes from any individual donor was either high (≥100 000) or low (<100 000) with no differences between pre- and post-pubertal oocytes. No differences were detected in mtDNA copy number using either of the two primers (Table 1). No linear correlation was detected between oocyte size and mtDNA copy number in pre- and postpubertal oocytes (r2 = 0.00). The donor has a strong influence on oocyte mtDNA copy number in pre- and postpubertal pigs, which could influence individual fertility. mtDNA copy number does not seem to explain the higher developmental competence of neither post- compared to prepubertal pigs nor large compared to small prepubertal oocytes.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Pedersen, Hanne Skovsgaard","Løvendahl, Peter","Larsen, Knud Erik","Madsen, Lone Bruhn","Callesen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-197806"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mtdna copy number in oocytes of different sizes from individual pre and post pubertal pigs","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1071/RDv27n1Ab181","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-197806","ids":["au-77b317fc-640b-4f74-8e19-1ba816885237"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-E6694A7A1397688BCAD354F2289B8350"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1071/RDv27n1Ab181","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Animal and Veterinary Sciences, Department of Animal and Veterinary Sciences - Reproductive Biology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne Skovsgaard","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"dbbbd39e-77dc-4209-b35f-089ac5d2159a","name":"Pedersen, Hanne Skovsgaard","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Peter","key":"løvendahlpau","last":"Løvendahl","locid":"d1d68047-88cc-43f8-93ed-04e289ca5b38","name":"Løvendahl, Peter","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Knud Erik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"46cd3e98-1529-45bf-9054-2978f328044c","name":"Larsen, Knud Erik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lone Bruhn","key":"madsenpau","last":"Madsen","locid":"1b15cd00-84c2-4290-bbc6-da52f8665222","name":"Madsen, Lone Bruhn","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"callesenpau","last":"Callesen","locid":"7fe33188-4ec4-4b54-bc7a-c922c5ebaa54","name":"Callesen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-0185-7300","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1071/rdv27n1ab181","issn":["10313613","14485990"],"issn_org":["10313613"],"issue":"1","journal":"Reproduction, Fertility and Development","pages":"181-182","paperid":"(abst 181)","publisher":"CSIRO Publishing","status":"p","title":"Reproduction, Fertility and Development","volume":"27"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-77b317fc-640b-4f74-8e19-1ba816885237"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"mtDNA copy number in oocytes of different sizes from individual pre- and post-pubertal pigs","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-197806","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"BACKGROUND: Patients on chronic dialysis are at increased risk of vitamin D deficiency. In observational studies plasma 25-hydroxyvitamin D (p-25(OH) D) levels are inversely correlated with plasma BNP and adverse cardiovascular outcomes. Whether a causal relation exists has yet to be established. The aim of this study was to test the hypothesis that cholecalciferol supplementation improves cardiac function and reduces blood pressure (BP) and pulse wave velocity (PWV) in patients on chronic dialysis. METHODS: In a randomized, placebo-controlled, double-blind study, we investigated the effect of 75 μg (3000 IU) cholecalciferol daily for 6 months, in patients on chronic dialysis. We performed two-dimensional echocardiography, with doppler and tissue-doppler imaging, 24-h ambulatory BP (24-h BP), PWV, augmentation index (AIx), central BP (cBP) and brain natriuretic peptide (BNP) measurements at baseline and after 6 months. RESULTS: Sixty-four patients were allocated to the study. Fifty dialysis patients with a mean age of 68 years (range: 46-88) and baseline p-25(OH) D of 28 (20;53) nmol/l completed the trial. Cholecalciferol increased left ventricular (LV) volume, but had no impact on other parameters regarding LV structure or left atrial structure. LV systolic function, LV diastolic function, PWV, cBP, AIx and BNP were not changed in placebo or cholecalciferol group at follow-up. 24-h BP decreased significantly in placebo group and tended to decrease in cholecalciferol group without any difference between treatments. CONCLUSION: Six months of cholecalciferol treatment in patients on chronic dialysis did not improve 24-h BP, arterial stiffness or cardiac function. TRIAL REGISTRATION: NCT01312714, Registration Date: March 9, 2011.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Mose, Frank Holden","Vase, Henrik","Larsen, Thomas","Kancir, Anne Sophie Pinholt","Kosierkiewic, Renata","Jonczy, Bartlomiej","Hansen, Annebirthe Bo","Oczachowska-Kulik, Anna E","Thomsen, Ingrid Møller","Bech, Jesper N.","Pedersen, Erling Bjerregaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-210838"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Aged","Blood Pressure","Cholecalciferol","Double Blind Method","Female","Heart","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Natriuretic Peptide Brain","Placebo Effect","Renal Dialysis","Renal Insufficiency Chronic","Treatment Outcome","Vitamins"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"cardiovascular effects of cholecalciferol treatment in dialysis patients a randomized controlled trial","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-2369-15-50","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-210838","identifier":[{"id":"24661355","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC3994388","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84899089999","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-8ee03cbc-6584-43cd-8475-1123a6b1afdb"],"keyword":["Aged","Blood Pressure","Cholecalciferol","Double-Blind Method","Female","Heart","Humans","Male","Middle Aged","Natriuretic Peptide, Brain","Placebo Effect","Renal Dialysis","Renal Insufficiency, Chronic","Treatment Outcome","Vitamin K Deficiency","Vitamins"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DD43A150163D770963886BEB164C4854"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-2369-15-50","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Medicinsk afdeling, Holstebro","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - University Clinic in Nephrology and Hypertension, Holstebro Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Frank H","key":"mosepau","last":"Mose","locid":"2743ec13-0199-4678-9480-a5c65172749f","name":"Mose, Frank Holden","name_org":"Mose, Frank H","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"vasepau","last":"Vase","locid":"1c1976b0-bcb2-47da-8f68-b2a753437368","name":"Vase, Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Thomas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne S P","key":"kancirpau","last":"Kancir","locid":"8bfb917f-1ac7-433d-94b1-e1ded97064c6","name":"Kancir, Anne Sophie Pinholt","name_org":"Kancir, Anne S P","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Renata","key":"kosierkiewicpau","last":"Kosierkiewic","name":"Kosierkiewic, Renata","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Bartlomiej","key":"jonczypau","last":"Jonczy","name":"Jonczy, Bartlomiej","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Annebirthe B","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"d6690f09-5831-4eaa-bfed-8adeb812f7f1","name":"Hansen, Annebirthe Bo","name_org":"Hansen, Annebirthe B","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Anna E","key":"oczachowskakulikpau","last":"Oczachowska-Kulik","name":"Oczachowska-Kulik, Anna E","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ingrid M","key":"thomsenpau","last":"Thomsen","locid":"f7b34482-699e-46b1-a467-4e96b0c28bba","name":"Thomsen, Ingrid Møller","name_org":"Thomsen, Ingrid M","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"af