{"abstract":"Den traditionelle ”lede nedad-rolle” er stadig vigtig. Men nye krav til ledelse udfordrer lederrollen, og det er ikke længere nok kun at lede nedad. Lederen skal også evne at lede opad, udad og på tværs. Lær, hvordan du mestrer de fire ledelsesroller i praksis.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-281731"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"sådan mestrer du de 000000000004 ledelsesroller","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.lederweb.dk/Dig-Selv/Lederrollen/Artikel/108301/Mellemlederen-har-faet-tre-nye-ledelsesroller","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-281731","ids":["cbs-42ebedef-a736-4126-bc4e-dfdaf599e1ce"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-FA3A9253ECBB4D2E95A1083E728A594E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.lederweb.dk/Dig-Selv/Lederrollen/Artikel/108301/Mellemlederen-har-faet-tre-nye-ledelsesroller","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"X"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Undefined"]},"sid":["cbs-42ebedef-a736-4126-bc4e-dfdaf599e1ce"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Sådan mestrer du de 4 ledelsesroller","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-281731","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Pt–Ru catalysts of various compositions, between 0 and 100at.% of Ru, were deposited onto N-doped multi-walled carbon nanotubes (N-CNTs) by atomic layer deposition (ALD) at 250°C. The Pt and Ru precursors were trimethyl(methylcyclopentadienyl)platinum (MeCpPtMe3) and bis(ethylcyclopentadienyl)ruthenium (Ru(EtCp)2), respectively. O2 was used as the reactant in both processes. The composition of the catalysts was easily tuned by varying the Pt-to-Ru ALD cycle ratio. The catalysts were tested toward the CO oxidation and methanol oxidation reaction (MOR) in a three-electrode electrochemical set-up. For the compositions investigated, the catalysts with a Ru content of 29at.% exhibited highest catalytic activity.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Johansson, Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","Larsen, Jackie Vincent","Verheijen, Marcel A.","Haugshøj, Kenneth B.","F. Clausen, Henrik","Kessels, Wilhelmus M.M.","Christensen, Leif Højslet","Thomsen, Erik Vilain"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-336411"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Netherlands"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Eindhoven University of Technology"],"keyword":["ALD","CO oxidation","DMFC","MOR"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GTS","DI-U"],"level3":{"GTS":["DI-GTS-ALL","DI-GTS-DTCI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GTS-DTCI","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"electrocatalytic activity of atomic layer deposited pt ru catalysts onto n doped carbon nanotubes","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2014.01.001","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-336411","identifier":[{"id":"84893274227","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-6aa1e604-65ee-4719-8fba-68e76a4c9997"],"keyword":["ALD","CO oxidation","DMFC","MOR","N-doped CNT","Pt–Ru"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8A8E99B1198F87D1105ADD176E065128"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2014.01.001","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Micro- and Nanotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nl","key":"eindhoven university of technology","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Eindhoven University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"danish technological institute","l2":"DI-GTS","l2n":"GTS Institutes","l3":"DI-GTS-DTCI","l3nn":"Danish Technological Institute","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Danish Technological Institute","namevar":["Danish Technological Institute"],"nora_code":"DI-GTS-DTCI","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","key":"johanssonpau","last":"Johansson","locid":"d3015f26-124b-4af0-ae58-aac640ebeec0","name":"Johansson, Anne-Charlotte Elisabeth Birgitta","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jackie Vincent","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"1a230176-2f1e-4133-a820-8e549ac15d87","name":"Larsen, Jackie Vincent","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Marcel A.","key":"verheijenpau","last":"Verheijen","name":"Verheijen, Marcel A.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Kenneth B.","key":"haugshøjpau","last":"Haugsh