{"abstract":"A systematic study of the performance of the dissolution process in dissolution-DNP is presented. A relatively simple set of modifications is made to the standard Hypersense dissolution system to enable polarization of large volume samples. These consist of a large volume sample cup along with supporting modifications to the dissolution head and related components. Additional modifications were made to support the mapping of the temperature/pressure space of the dissolution process as well as enabling the use of large volumes of solvent and improving the robustness of the system. No loss of polarization was observed as sample size was increased to the 1g capacity of the large volume cup and for a dilution factor as low as 1:10.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Bowen, Sean","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-371936"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Dynamic nuclear polarization","Hyperpolarization","NMR"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"enhanced performance large volume dissolution dnp","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmr.2014.01.009","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-371936","identifier":[{"id":"84894031849","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-e14af43d-968b-47c9-b982-05ff0193d191"],"keyword":["Dynamic nuclear polarization","Hyperpolarization","NMR"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-DA1951AEC7AABB88907784C745DB8B37"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmr.2014.01.009","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Biomedical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Sean","key":"bowenpau","last":"Bowen","locid":"77cc622d-d330-44a7-8947-f1463e9c8cef","name":"Bowen, Sean","orcid":"0000-0003-1047-4325","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jan Henrik","key":"ardenkjærlarsenpau","last":"Ardenkjær-Larsen","locid":"ae9519c9-1b64-4426-b89f-4c36d08c1836","name":"Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6167-6926","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jmr.2014.01.009","issn":["10907807","10960856"],"issn_org":["10907807"],"journal":"Journal of Magnetic Resonance","pages":"90-94","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"p","title":"Journal of Magnetic Resonance","volume":"240"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84894031849"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-e14af43d-968b-47c9-b982-05ff0193d191"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Enhanced performance large volume dissolution-DNP","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-371936","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Variable dissolution from sodium salts of drugs containing a carboxylic acid group after passing the acidic environment of the stomach may affect oral bioavailability. The aim of the present proof of concept study was to investigate pH effects in relation to the dissolution of sodium naproxenate in 0.01M hydrochloric acid. For this purpose a UV/vis imaging-based approach capable of measuring microenvironmental pH in the vicinity of the solid drug compact as well as monitoring drug dissolution was developed. Using a pH indicating dye real-time spatially resolved measurement of pH was achieved. Sodium naproxenate, can significantly alter the local pH of the dissolution medium, is eventually neutralized and precipitates as the acidic species naproxen. The developed approach is considered useful for detailed studies of pH dependent dissolution phenomena in dissolution testing.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Østergaard, Jesper","Jensen, Henrik","Larsen, Susan Weng","Larsen, Claus","Lenke, Jim"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-423120"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["DissoFX, 25 Cooper Street, Machias, ME 04654, USA. Electronic address: jhlenke@gmail.com."],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"microenvironmental ph measurement during sodium naproxenate dissolution in acidic medium by uv vis imaging","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpba.2014.08.014","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-423120","identifier":[{"id":"84906857350","type":"scopus"},{"id":"25194341","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-31e10648-1ba1-4023-af72-adc70959c881"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C36496DBD6C73601EE8CC98D12F31ADF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpba.2014.08.014","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Pharmacy, Pharmaceutical Design and Drug Delivery"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["DissoFX, 25 Cooper Street, Machias, ME 04654, USA. Electronic address: jhlenke@gmail.com."],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Jesper","key":"østergaardjesperpau","last":"Ostergaard","locid":"718ffee9-f57d-4060-9440-4ade85c29600","name":"Østergaard, Jesper","name_org":"Ostergaard, Jesper","orcid":"0000-0003-3448-4237","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"jensenhenrikpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"88cd8faf-69c6-46de-a355-03f93d52eeb1","name":"Jensen, Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Susan W","key":"larsensusanwengpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"f6980004-978f-4940-b71f-de426f2a084a","name":"Larsen, Susan Weng","name_org":"Larsen, Susan W","orcid":"0000-0002-3818-7275","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Claus","key":"larsenclauspau","last":"Larsen","locid":"a57ec7df-7c6d-49ec-9340-ac316c2ec868","name":"Larsen, Claus","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Jim","key":"lenkejimpau","last":"Lenke","name":"Lenke, Jim","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25194341"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.jpba.2014.08.014","issn":["07317085","1873264X"],"issn_org":["07317085"],"journal":"Journal of Pharmaceutical and Biomedical Analysis","pages":"290-293","status":"p","title":"Journal of Pharmaceutical and Biomedical Analysis","volume":"100"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84906857350"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-31e10648-1ba1-4023-af72-adc70959c881"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Microenvironmental pH measurement during sodium naproxenate dissolution in acidic medium by UV/vis imaging","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-423120","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Rural livelihood studies in developing countries usually depend on household members’ own recollection of their income-generating activities, including extraction of environmental products, yield of agricultural crops and livestock products, wage and casual labour income, and income from business activities. In this study we examine discrepancies between activities and associated incomes (cash and subsistence) reported by sample households through interviews conducted at the end of a one-year recall period and based on daily records of livelihood activities made by the same households throughout the entire year. The study is based on data from two villages in different parts of Tanzania. Differences between results obtained using the two data collection methods vary between activities and product categories but are in some cases considerable. This has important implications when such data are assumed to reflect the rural economic reality and thus used for policy formation and implementation.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Larsen, Helle Overgaard","Treue, Thorsten","Ngaga, Yonika","Kajembe, George","Chamshama, Shabani","Meilby, Henrik","Theilade, Ida"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-429430"],"event":{"end":"2014-05-24","place":"Uppsala, se","start":"2014-05-21","title":"Biennial Meeting of the Scandinavian Society of Forest Economics","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Africa"],"country":["Tanzania"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Sokoine University of Agriculture"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparing one year recall and daily household records of livelihood activities","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/132144809/Scandinavian_Forest_Economics_No_45.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-429430","ids":["ku-3c40e706-0026-4e94-8b91-38b809ad76c1"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A6A03E28B13C70DB870DEDC24382E4AF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/132144809/Scandinavian_Forest_Economics_No_45.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Food and Resource Economics, Section for Global Development"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"tz","key":"sokoine university of agriculture","loc":["Tanzania","Africa"],"name":"Sokoine University of Agriculture","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Helle Overgaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"f206b711-0cc2-433c-a95d-f46292c51215","name":"Larsen, Helle Overgaard","orcid":"0000-0002-9566-3848","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Thorsten","key":"treuepau","last":"Treue","locid":"43e8dab8-496d-45cc-ae87-b5002274a1a0","name":"Treue, Thorsten","orcid":"0000-0003-4321-5346","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Yonika","key":"ngagapau","last":"Ngaga","name":"Ngaga, Yonika","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"George","key":"kajembepau","last":"Kajembe","name":"Kajembe, George","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Shabani","key":"chamshamapau","last":"Chamshama","name":"Chamshama, Shabani","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"meilbypau","last":"Meilby","locid":"0ddac490-e5da-4c91-82ba-c64fbcd81e27","name":"Meilby, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0002-3770-3880","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Ida","key":"theiladepau","last":"Theilade","locid":"6fe4cbce-90c9-497d-8bdc-7073f13ee37e","name":"Theilade, Ida","orcid":"0000-0003-3502-1277","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["0355032X"],"journal":"Scandinavian Forest Economics","pages":"192","status":"p","title":"Scandinavian Forest Economics","volume":"45"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-3c40e706-0026-4e94-8b91-38b809ad76c1"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Comparing one-year recall and daily household records of livelihood activities","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-429430","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-440574"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"continuity or change in national foreign policy discourses post lisbon the case of denmark","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-440574","identifier":[{"id":"84898195439","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-4ef67344-6bfe-4b68-927e-db0842032c36"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-E8E13011DA91CDD0A0F2D3803241AE06"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Centre for European Politics","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Department of Political Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"36bbf99a-f2ff-4406-b1ca-f9cb7be18f17","name":"Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Caterina","key":"cartapedh","last":"Carta","name":"Carta, Caterina","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jean-Frédéric","key":"morinpedh","last":"Morin","name":"Morin, Jean-Frédéric","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9781409463757"],"pages":"43-58","place":"Farnham, Surrey","publisher":"Ashgate","series":"Globalisation, Europe, multilateralism series","status":"p","subtitle":"Making sense of diversity","title":"EU Foreign Policy through the Lens of Discourse Analysis"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84898195439"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-4ef67344-6bfe-4b68-927e-db0842032c36"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Continuity or Change in National Foreign Policy Discourses Post-Lisbon? : The Case of Denmark","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-440574","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"The political system of the EU and its member states is frequently seen as postWestphalian within constructivist-inspired research. This is based on the view that political authority and legitimacy are to be found both at the EU level and the national level with no clear borders between them. The question raised in this article is how the member states conceive of themselves as foreign policy actors in this situation where they are both politically embedded in EU foreign policy structures and, in most cases, formally able to act outside the EU structures in the field of foreign policy. The overall argument is that a pertinent answer to this question can be provided by looking at how (or whether) state identity is articulated in relation to the EU. The paper first presents theoretical considerations relating to discursive articulations of state identity in an EU context. The relevance of these discursive articulations is then illustrated through the empirical example of Danish articulations of actorness prior to and post Lisbon. It is shown that the articulation of national actorness in relation to the EU varied across the different areas of foreign policy before and after Lisbon. A research agenda that flows from these considerations is outlined.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-448780"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"discourses of state identity and post lisbon national foreign policy the case of denmark","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/0010836713495000","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-448780","identifier":[{"id":"84907207686","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-5c6fa49d-87e7-44f5-a765-6a08eb13e4f0"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-792C237C83A6424474559024EC5F60DA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/0010836713495000","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Centre for European Politics","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Department of Political Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"36bbf99a-f2ff-4406-b1ca-f9cb7be18f17","name":"Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1177/0010836713495000","issn":["00108367","14603691"],"issn_org":["00108367"],"issue":"3","journal":"Cooperation and Conflict","pages":"368-385","status":"p","title":"Cooperation and Conflict","volume":"49"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84907207686"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-5c6fa49d-87e7-44f5-a765-6a08eb13e4f0"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Discourses of State identity and Post-Lisbon National Foreign Policy : the Case of Denmark","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-448780","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
