"title":"KYSTFISK I. Udviklingen i kystnære fiskebestande. Slutrapport","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-321226","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"In research on European foreign policy two important axes of debate have been running relatively independently of each other for more than a decade: the study of the European Union as a normative power (NPE) and the study of external perceptions of the EU. However, the studies of external perception offer some findings that are central for the NPE debate. This article’s argument is that the external perceptions literature points to a limited (if still identifiable) perception of the EU as a normative power depending on the geographical area. By comparison, the image of a powerful economic actor is prevalent. The article raises the question of whether the thin and geographically varied character of the perceptions relating to the EU as a normative power justifies the general designation of NPE.Anew agenda focusing on geographical differences and interaction with other sources of power is outlined.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-440263"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Faculty of Social Sciences"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the eu as a normative power and the research on external perceptions the missing link","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/144935526/pub10.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-440263","identifier":[{"id":"84901836020","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-4e7f1162-7285-4a55-92d5-ed81b01de335"],"keyword":["EU Normative Power External Perceptions","Faculty of Social Sciences"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-91AE36DDCAEFCD44ADF754142AF2F0F5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/jcms.12109","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/144935526/pub10.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Centre for European Politics","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Social Sciences, Department of Political Science, Department of Political Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Henrik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"36bbf99a-f2ff-4406-b1ca-f9cb7be18f17","name":"Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/jcms.12109","issn":["00219886","14685965"],"issn_org":["00219886"],"issue":"4","journal":"Journal of Common Market Studies","pages":"896-910","paperid":"13","status":"p","title":"Journal of Common Market Studies","volume":"52"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84901836020"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-4e7f1162-7285-4a55-92d5-ed81b01de335"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"The EU as a Normative Power and the Research on External Perceptions: the Missing Link","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-440263","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"The criteria for headache attributed to cervical artery dissection have been changed in the new third edition of the International Classification of Headache Disorders (ICHD-III beta). We have retrospectively investigated 19 patients diagnosed from 2001 to 2006 with cervical artery dissection at onset and followed them up six months after dissection. At dissection onset 17/19 patients were classified as headache probably attributed to vascular disorder at the time of dissection using the ICHD second edition (ICHD-II) criteria. In contrast, 17/19 of patients fulfilled the ICHD-III beta criteria for Headache or facial or neck pain attributed to cervical carotid or vertebral artery dissection or Headache attributed to intracranial arterial dissection. Six months after dissection five of 19 patients still reported persistent headache attributed to dissection. The study demonstrates that the ICHD-III beta criteria for cervical artery dissection are useful for classifying patients at the first encounter. We show for the first time that persistent headache attributed to arterial dissection is frequent.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Schytz, Henrik W","Ashina, Messoud","Magyari, Melinda","Larsen, Vibeke A","Olesen, Jes","Iversen, Helle Klingenberg"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-490418"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"acute headache and persistent headache attributed to cervical artery dissection field testing of ichd iii beta","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/0333102414520767","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-490418","identifier":[{"id":"84904700571","type":"scopus"},{"id":"24500814","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-a243bb0b-73e5-4d7c-b501-0f2ab4d2abfc"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E1FB98241A05BE01CD89EDA57FC4E1A8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1177/0333102414520767","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Henrik W","key":"schytzpau","last":"Schytz","name":"Schytz, Henrik W","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Messoud","key":"ashinapau","last":"Ashina","locid":"0e941844-26c5-4777-a66a-64a163c19cd2","name":"Ashina, Messoud","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Melinda","key":"magyaripau","last":"Magyari","name":"Magyari, Melinda","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Vibeke A","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Vibeke A","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jes","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","locid":"c5fe564b-1354-4d3c-8173-9778df35d33f","name":"Olesen, Jes","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Helle Klingenberg","key":"iversenpau","last":"Iversen","locid":"02552302-5333-48e0-acde-b9a821eab783","name":"Iversen, Helle Klingenberg","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24500814"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1177/0333102414520767","issn":["03331024","08001952"],"issn_org":["03331024"],"issue":"9","journal":"Cephalalgia","pages":"712-716","status":"p","title":"Cephalalgia","title_org":"Cephalalgia : an international journal of headache","volume":"34"}