nflammatory effects of the organo-modified Montmorillonite Cloisite® 30B","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-308469","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Can the design models for offshore wind turbine wave loads be improved? And how will that change the overall load picture? Core questions of the Wave Loads project which was finalised in 2013 with two PhD theses, response calculations for jackets and monopiles, a detailed set of experiments and a3D coupled CFD wave solver","author_count":4,"contributors":["Bredmose, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-319955"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"wave loads on offshore wind turbines accurate tools and structural response","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dra","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/92545416/Wind_Annual_Report_2013.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-319955","ids":["dtu-33a4af14-058d-4214-9b07-6029354b1110"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7DC05A4778C9975790937A5CD88FA92C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/92545416/Wind_Annual_Report_2013.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Wind Energy","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Wind Energy, Fluid Mechanics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"bredmosepau","last":"Bredmose","locid":"a46a2dd1-d040-4240-8dfb-bdb22c646a47","name":"Bredmose, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6961-0753","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Berit C.","key":"larsenpedh","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Berit C.","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Jens Carsten","key":"hansenpedh","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Jens Carsten","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Tom","key":"croninpedh","last":"Cronin","name":"Cronin, Tom","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788792896797"],"pages":"20","publisher":"DTU Wind Energy","status":"p","title":"Department of Wind Energy Annual Report 2013"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-33a4af14-058d-4214-9b07-6029354b1110"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Wave loads on offshore wind turbines: Accurate tools and structural response","type":"Report Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-319955","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"In the early 2000s, a particular MRSA clonal complex (CC398) was found mainly in pigs and pig farmers in Europe. Since then, CC398 has been detected among a wide variety of animal species worldwide. We investigated the population structure of CC398 through mutation discovery at 97 genetic housekeeping loci, which are distributed along the CC398 chromosome within 195 CC398 isolates, collected from various countries and host species, including humans. Most of the isolates in this collection were received from collaborating microbiologists, who had preserved them over years. We discovered 96 bi-allelic polymorphisms, and phylogenetic analyses revealed that an epidemic sub-clone within CC398 (dubbed 'clade (C)') has spread within and between equine hospitals, where it causes nosocomial infections in horses and colonises the personnel. While clade (C) was strongly associated with S. aureus from horses in veterinary-care settings (p = 2x10(-7)), it remained extremely rare among S. aureus isolates from human infections.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Abdelbary, Mohamed M. H.","Wittenberg, Anne","Cuny, Christiane","Layer, Franziska","Kurt, Kevin","Wieler, Lothar H.","Walther, Birgit","Skov, Robert","Larsen, Jesper","Hasman, Henrik","Fitzgerald, J. Ross","Smith, Tara C.","Wagenaar, J. A.","Pantosti, Annalisa","Hallin, Marie","Struelens, Marc J.","Edwards, Giles","Boese, R.","Nuebel, Ulrich","Witte, Wolfgang"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-320286"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Belgium","Germany","Italy","Netherlands","Sweden","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","European Centre for Disease Prevention and Control","Free University of Berlin","Istituto Superiore di Sanita","Labor Dr. Böse GmbH","Robert Koch Institute","Scottish MRSA Reference Laboratory","University of Edinburgh","University of Iowa","Université libre de Bruxelles","Utrecht University"],"keyword":["Animals","Colonization","Emergence","MRSA","Multidisciplinary","Risk Factors","Slaughter pigs","methicillin resistant"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-U"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-SSI"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-SSI","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"phylogenetic analysis of staphylococcus aureus cc000000000398 reveals a sub lineage epidemiologically associated with infections in horses","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/97169384/pone.0088083.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-320286","identifier":[{"id":"000336971300051","type":"wos"},{"id":"84894613414","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-34c550af-7f5a-4dcb-a184-950b7319877c"],"keyword":["ANIMALS","COLONIZATION","EMERGENCE","HUMAN TRANSMISSION","METHICILLIN-RESISTANT","MRSA","MULTIDISCIPLINARY","RISK-FACTORS","SLAUGHTER PIGS","STRAIN ST398","VETERINARY PERSONNEL"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-47947082C5ECF9FF207B43E79236D2D2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/97169384/pone.0088083.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC3913741/pdf/pone.0088083.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0088083","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"robert koch institute","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Robert Koch Institute","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"free university of berlin","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Free University of Berlin","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"ssi statens serum institut","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-SSI","l3nn":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SSI Statens Serum Institut","namevar":["Statens Serum Institut"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-SSI","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Food Institute, Division of Epidemiology and Microbial Genomics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"gb","key":"university of edinburgh","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Edinburgh","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"us","key":"university of iowa","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Iowa","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"nl","key":"utrecht university","loc":["Netherlands","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Utrecht University","used":1},{"affno":"8","country":"it","key":"istituto superiore di sanita","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Istituto Superiore di Sanita","used":1},{"affno":"9","country":"be","key":"université libre de bruxelles","loc":["Belgium","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Université libre de Bruxelles","used":1},{"affno":"10","country":"se","key":"european centre for disease prevention and control","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"European Centre for Disease Prevention and Control","used":1},{"affno":"11","country":"gb","key":"scottish mrsa reference laboratory","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Scottish MRSA Reference Labora