{"abstract":"According to the article 3(4) of the Kyoto Protocol, Denmark is obliged to document sequestration and emission of carbon dioxide from land use and land cover and changes in these. This report documents and describes applied data end developed methods aiming at estimating amounts and changes in land use and land cover for Denmark for since 1990. Estimation of land use and land cover categories and changes in these is predominantly based on existing categorical (i.e. pre-classified) geographical information. Estimations are elaborated for the period from 1990 to 2005, from 2005 to 2011 and from 2011 to 2012. Due to limited availability of historical spatially explicit information, estimations of change in land use and land cover from 1990 up to 2011 do, to some degree, involve decisions based on expert knowledge. Due to a significant increase in the availability of detailed spatially specific categorical information, estimations of annual changes in land use and land cover from 2011 and onwards are based on identification of changes in land use and land cover based spatial on overlays with updated input layers.","author_count":13,"contributors":["Levin, Gregor","Kastrup Blemmer, Morten","Gyldenkærne, Steen","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Caspersen, Ole Hjort","Petersen, Hans Skov","Karlsson Nyed, Partik","Becker, Thomas","Bruun, Henrik Gundorph","Fuglsang, Morten","Münier, Bernd","Bastrup-Birk, Annemarie","Nord-Larsen, Thomas"],"cuid":["S02-095.90-021854"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Trier University"],"keyword":["Land cover change","Land cover classification","Land use change"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"estimating land use land cover changes in denmark from 000000001990 000000002012 technical documentation for the assessment of land use land cover changes for estimation of carbon dioxide fixation in soil","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/TR38.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-095.90-021854","ids":["au-7de37feb-c7db-42e5-9d5f-d4c5c73f942b","ku-ba2ebed2-a4f1-445f-8afc-22cf8f8158a1"],"keyword":["Land cover classification","Land cover mapping","Land use change","land cover change"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-2-7906FF974CCFCE711A4814F9C65FE356"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://dce2.au.dk/pub/TR38.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, DCE - Danish Centre for Environment and Energy"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Geosciences and Natural Resource Management, Geography"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Gregor","key":"levinpau","last":"Levin","locid":"64497988-a46c-415b-bcfe-9b09efad5289","name":"Levin, Gregor","orcid":"0000-0002-5223-914X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"kastrupblemmerpau","last":"Kastrup Blemmer","locid":"da3fc06d-c120-4