{"abstract":"This paper introduces a distributed component for social network analysis (SNA) and visualization. The component separates light-weight from heavy-weight computation mea- sures within a client-server solution. The component includes a browser-based client that allows its integration in larger projects. Our current protptype has been specially designed to ease its integration within the VIRTUOSO project [4]. The prototype will allow security analysts to quickly visualize social networks and perform certain measures on them.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ortiz Arroyo, Daniel","Larsen, Henrik Legind","Davidsen, Søren Atmakuri"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-082808"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a distributed framework for social network analysis and visualization","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/295476695/SNA_paper_working.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-082808","ids":["aau-707d553a-5198-4a87-a452-5b0c2aa5ca94"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-C01B889C53FED146F676FE1C65C5EF3C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://vbn.aau.dk/ws/files/295476695/SNA_paper_working.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Engineering and Science","Aalborg Univer