{"abstract":"Henrik Smith-Sivertsen bruger Povl Dissings “Lad mig blive noget” som udgangspunkt for en række diskussioner. Den første handler om versioneringspraksisser, dvs. oversættelser af udenlandske sange, og indeholder en analyse af forholdet mellem kopi og original samt de ejerskabsforhold og autenticitetsforestillinger, som uafværgeligt bliver tematiseret i oversættelsen. Den anden handler om de krydsninger mellem høj og lav, let og seriøs, som indspilningen indeholder. Tekstforfatter var Thøger Olesen, producer var Gustav Winckler, backing bandet var de psykedeliske The Beefeaters og forsanger var folk-musikeren Povl Dissing. En pointe er, at en opdeling i klart adskilte musikkulturer ikke holder for en nærmere analyse.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Smith-Sivertsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-549128"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Populærmusik","Rockhistorie"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-KUM"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-KUM"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"lad mig blive noget originalitets og autenticitetsforestillinger i det populærmusikalske felt","src":["kum"],"src-code":["DI-GV-KUM"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-549128","ids":["kum-7090a1ce-4fa0-4f7b-b1e1-a49ff199bade"],"keyword":["Authenticitet","Populærmusik","Rockhistorie"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-644394A9D89805C0848FE16F8E127E4E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"kum ministry of culture archives museums and royal library denmark","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-KUM","l3nn":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark","namevar":["Ministry of Culture Denmark, The Royal Library"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-KUM","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"smithsivertsenpau","last":"Smith-Sivertsen","locid":"7a9d3028-cb24-4e43-bb57-9c6d8f768a83","name":"Smith-Sivertsen, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-6132-0487","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten","key":"michelsenpedh","last":"Michelsen","name":"Michelsen, Morten","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Charlotte","key":"rørdamlarsenpedh","last":"Rørdam Larsen","name":"Rørdam Larsen, Charlotte","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Annemette","key":"kirkegaardpedh","last":"Kirkegaard,","name":"Kirkegaard,, Annemette","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Lisbeth","key":"ihlemannpedh","last":"Ihlemann","name":"Ihlemann, Lisbeth","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Gestur","key":"gudmundssonpedh","last":"Gudmundsson","name":"Gudmundsson, Gestur","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"bødkerpedh","last":"Bødker","name":"Bødker, Henrik","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["978 87 7674 668 1"],"issn":["16025962"],"pages":"175-221","publisher":"Syddansk Universitetsforlag","series":"University of Southern Denmark Studies in History and Social Sciences","status":"p","title":"Rock i Danmark: Studier i populærmusik fra 1950'erne til årtusindskiftet"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","Governmental Institutions"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["kum-7090a1ce-4fa0-4f7b-b1e1-a49ff199bade"],"src":["KUM Ministry of Culture - Archives, Museums, and Royal Library Denmark"],"title":"“Lad mig blive noget” : Originalitets- og autenticitetsforestillinger i det populærmusikalske felt","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-549128","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Background and aims Spine stability is affected in low back (LB) pain and potentially by muscle fatigue and soreness. This study assessed motor control responses to unexpected surface perturbations during stance during experimental LB muscle pain combined with fatigue and muscle soreness. Methods Nineteen healthy participants were examined day 1-3 before and after bilateral injections of hypertonic saline into m. longissimus. Pain intensity was scored on a visual analogue scale (VAS). Day 2 included injections during post-exercise LB muscle fatigue and day 3 during delayed onset back muscle soreness (DOMS). Twenty perturbations were conducted randomly with tilts in sagittal and frontal plane or displacements in the frontal plane. Bilateral electromyography (EMG) was recorded from 12 trunk muscles. The root-mean-square (RMS-EMG) was extracted. Changes (DeltaRMS) and absolute changes (DeltaRMSabs) in the RMS-EMG from the baseline of the day were calculated and averaged among back and abdominal muscles. Results VAS scores during fatigue and DOMS were significantly higher compared with day-1 (P<0.01). Back muscle RMS-EMG decreased and abdominal muscle RMS-EMG increased during DOMS, compared with pain-free conditions (P<0.01). Experimental LB pain increased DeltaRMS in the abdominal muscles day 1 (P<0.01) and in the fatigued back muscles day 2 (P<0.01). Pain increased DeltaRMSabs in day 1-3 in both muscle groups compared to baseline (P<0.01) with a minor effect of pain in the DOMS condition (P<0.01). Conclusions Pain-related reorganization may challenge spine stability during motor tasks in acute pain conditions and this seems to be even further implicated after fatigue and muscle soreness.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Larsen, Lars Henrik","Hirata, Rogerio Pessoto","Graven-Nielsen, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-652727"],"filters":{"added":"2023-01","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Diagnosis","Physiotherapy","Smerte undersøgelse diagnostik ræsonnering"],"level":"sci","oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"complex muscular adaptation to perturbations after induction of experimental low back pain in healthy participants","src":["ucn"],"src-code":["DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.ucn.dk/ws/files/45714166/EFIC_POSTER_2013_Lars_Henrik_Larsen.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-652727","ids":["ucn-fb8af4af-987b-4eeb-a51e-0f5223aca7ba"],"keyword":["Diagnosis","Smerte, undersøgelse, diagnostik, ræsonnering","physiotherapy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-ED4CF41AE79F3DDC314D1F7B099E03E2"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://ucviden.ucn.dk/ws/files/45714166/EFIC_POSTER_2013_Lars_Henrik_Larsen.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN Velfærd, Fysioterapeutuddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Henrik","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"a997ad4d-e8d1-47b2-8b96-d5b9b748e4c5","name":"Larsen, Lars Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-7830-1186","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rogerio Pessoto","key":"hiratapau","last":"Hirata","name":"Hirata, Rogerio Pessoto","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"gravennielsenpau","last":"Graven-Nielsen","name":"Graven-Nielsen, Thomas","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","Universities","University College of Northern Denmark","University Colleges"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ucn-fb8af4af-987b-4eeb-a51e-0f5223aca7ba"],"src":["UCN University College of Northern Denmark"],"title":"Complex muscular adaptation to perturbations after induction of experimental low back pain in healthy participants.","type":"Conference Poster","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-652727","year":"2013","yearsub":"2014"}
