{"abstract":"This work describes the design of a quadrature surface coil constituted by a circular loop and a butterfly coil, employed in transmit/receive (TX/RX) mode for hyperpolarized 13C studies of pig heart with a clinical 3T scanner. The coil characterization is performed by developing an SNR model for coil performance evaluation in terms of coil resistance, sample-induced resistance and magnetic field pattern. Experimental SNR-vs.-depth profiles, extracted from the [1-13C]acetate phantom chemical shift image (CSI), showed good agreement with the theoretical SNR-vs.-depth profiles. Moreover, the performance of the quadrature coil was compared with the single TX/RX circular and TX/RX butterfly coil, in order to verify the advantage of the proposed configuration over the single coils throughout the volume of interest for cardiac imaging in pig. Finally, the quadrature surface coil was tested by acquiring metabolic maps with hyperpolarized [1-13C]pyruvate injected i.v. in a pig. © 2013 Wiley Periodicals, Inc.","author_count":16,"contributors":["Giovannetti, G.","Frijia, F.","Hartwig, V.","Attanasio, S.","Menichetti, L.","Vanello, N.","Positano, V.","Ardenkjær-Larsen, Jan Henrik","Lionetti, V.","Aquaro, G. D.","De Marchi, D.","Schulte, R. F.","Wiesinger, F.","Landini, L.","Lombardi, M.","Santarelli, M. F."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381105"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany","Italy"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Fondazione G. Monasterio","GE Global Research","National Research Council of Italy","Sant'Anna School of Advanced Studies","University of Pisa"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"design of a quadrature surface coil for hyperpolarized 000000000013c mrs cardiac metabolism studies in pigs","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84876991093","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381105","identifier":[{"id":"84876991093","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-ff8c1b4f-73d3-4f71-ab11-91b2fed77d3b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-122B2BCCE320B28AB847514C2259239F"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"it","key":"national research council of italy","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"National Research Council of Italy","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"it","key":"university of pisa","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Pisa","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"it","key":"fondazione g monasterio","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Fondazione G. Monasterio","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Biomedical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"it","key":"sant anna school of advanced studies","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Sant'Anna School of Advanced Studies","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"de","key":"ge global research","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"GE Global Research","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"G.","key":"giovannettipau","last":"Giovannetti","name":"Giovannetti, G.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","correspondin