{"abstract":"Based on previous experience from working on a task-based search engine, we present a list of suggestions and ideas for an Information Retrieval (IR) framework that could inform the development of next generation professional search systems. The specific task that we start from is the clinicians' information need in finding rare disease diagnostic hypotheses at the time and place where medical decisions are made. Our experience from the development of a search engine focused on supporting clinicians in completing this task has provided us valuable insights in what aspects should be considered by the developers of vertical search engines.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Petcu, Paula","Dragusin, Radu"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-412084"],"event":{"end":"2013-03-24","place":"Moskva, ru","start":"2013-03-24","title":"2013 Workshop on Integrating IR Technologies for Professional Search","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Findwise"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"considerations for the development of task based search engines","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://ceur-ws.org/Vol-968/irps_14.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-412084","identifier":[{"id":"84922661308","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-1f51978a-2a3a-45c6-90bb-63d005113691"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-92FCB989CA173F9733880E1F8AD611A0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"se","key":"findwise","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Findwise","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Paula","key":"petcupau","last":"Petcu","name":"Petcu, Paula","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Radu","key":"dragusinpau","last":"Dragusin","locid":"8ca82089-6ed3-4171-bf69-965ec7f618ea","name":"Dragusin, Radu","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Mihai","key":"lupupedh","last":"Lupu","name":"Lupu, Mihai","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Michail","key":"salampasispedh","last":"Salampasis","name":"Salampasis, Michail","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Norbert","key":"fuhrpedh","last":"Fuhr","name":"Fuhr, Norbert","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Allan","key":"hanburypedh","last":"Hanbury","name":"Hanbury, Allan","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Birger","key":"larsenpedh","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Birger","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Henrik","key":"strindbergpedh","last":"Strindberg","name":"Strindberg, Henrik","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"issn":["16130073"],"pages":"84-87","series":"CEUR Workshop Proceedings","status":"p","subtitle":"Proceedings of the Workshop on Integrating IR technologies for Professional Search","title":"IRPS 2013","volume":"968"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84922661308"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"