-33","publisher":"Humana Press","series":"Methods in Molecular Biology","status":"p","title":"Nanotechnology for nucleic acid delivery","volume":"948"},"review":"No Review","scoID":["2-s2.0-84934435186"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-f7ab37be-df53-47a6-81f4-94180baa9a7a"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Combined fluorimetric caspase 3/7 assay and bradford protein determination for assessment of polycation-mediated cytotoxicity","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-541310","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
