{"abstract":"This report is Denmark’s National Inventory Report 2012. The report contains information on Denmark’s emission inventories for all years’ from 1990 to 2010 for CO2, CH4, N2O, HFCs, PFCs and SF6, NOx, CO, NMVOC, SO2","author_count":25,"contributors":["Nielsen, Ole-Kenneth","Mikkelsen, Mette Hjorth","Hoffmann, Leif","Gyldenkærne, Steen","Winther, Morten","Nielsen, Malene","Fauser, Patrik","Thomsen, Marianne","Plejdrup, Marlene Schmidt","Albrektsen, Rikke","Hjelgaard, Katja Hossy","Bruun, Henrik Gundorph","Johannsen, Vivian Kvist","Nord-Larsen, Thomas","Bastrup-Birk, Annemarie","Vesterdal, Lars","Møller, Inge Stupak","Rasmussen, Erik","Arfaoui, Karim","Baunbæk, Lene","Hansen, Maria Gunnleivsdóttir"],"cuid":["S03-089.83-672719"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic"],"country":["Faroe Islands","Greenland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Statistics Greenland","Umhvørvisstovan","Umhvørvistovan (The Environmental Agency)"],"keyword":["CH4","CO2","Drivhusgasser","Emissionsopgørelser","Klima","N2O","UNFCCC"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"denmark s national inventory report 000000002012 emission inventories 000000001990 000000002010 submitted under the united nations framework convention on climate change and the kyoto protocol","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www2.dmu.dk/Pub/SR19.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-089.83-672719","ids":["au-8b440646-6584-4892-bb09-ebcef027022f","ku-0e7fad36-64ae-4481-8412-1167e9c78987","ku-1eab3343-5ee5-4ccd-ad8b-0548442a040d"],"keyword":["CH4","