{"abstract":"Hvordan historielæreren i dagligdagen holder sig opdateret og udvikler praksis i historiefaget.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Larsen, Henrik Smedegaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-660183"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Faghæfter","Fagteam","Historie","Historiebevidsthed","Historiebrug","Historiedidaktik","Historiekanon","KIE modellen","Kanon","Kompetencer","Kulturarv","Læreruddannelse","Læreruddannelsen","Profession","Professionsudvikling","historielærere","historiesyn","kontrafaktion","kontrafaktisk"],"level":"sci","oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-UC"],"level3":{"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"professionsudvikling i bogen historiepædagogik red binderup thomas og troelsen børge kvan","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-660183","ids":["via-ba9eace4-6185-4136-962e-b5ad607b5fef"],"keyword":["KIE-modellen","Profession","faghæfte","faghæfter","fagteam","historie","historiebevidsthed","historiebrug","historiedidaktik","historiedidaktisk","historiekanon","historielærer","historielærere","historiepædagogik","historiesyn","kanon","kanonpunkter","kompetencer","kontrafaktion","kontrafaktisk","kulturarv","læreruddannelse","læreruddannelsen","professionsudvikling"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","noi":["Local-1-1-302FCE6921498DAE67826017AB8EE18A"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Uddannelser, Læreruddannelsen, HF og FIF-kurser, Læreruddannelsen Skive alle fag"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-VIA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik Smedegaard","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"979be23f-372e-42c4-b96a-a4517db8f2e8","name":"Larsen, Henrik Smedegaard","orcid":"0000-0002-0881-9745","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788792871114"],"pages":"10","place":"Aarhus","publisher":"KvaN","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All University Colleges","DI-ALL","DI-UC","DI-UC-ALL","University Colleges","VIA University College"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["via-ba9eace4-6185-4136-962e-b5ad607b5fef"],"src":["VIA University College"],"title":"”Professionsudvikling” i bogen ”Historiepædagogik\". Red. Binderup, Thomas og Troelsen, Børge. Kvan.","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-660183","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"The C-C motif chemokine ligand 3-like (CCL3L) protein is a potent chemoattractant which by binding to C-C chemokine receptor type 5 (CCR5) inhibits human immunodeficiency virus (HIV) entry. Copy number variation (CNV) of the CCL3L has been shown to be associated with HIV susceptibility and progression to AIDS, but these results have been inconsistent. We examined a Zimbabwean study population for an association of CCL3L CNV with HIV status, progression (CD4 T-cells and viral load), and survival. Another aim was to investigate the possible effects of CCL3L CNV on CCL3 protein concentration. A treatment-naïve cohort, which included 153 HIV infected and 159 HIV uninfected individuals, was followed for up to 4.3years. The CNV of the CCL3L was determined by duplex real-time polymerase chain reaction. We found no association between four CCL3L CNV strata and HIV status (P=0.7), CD4 T-cell count (P=0.9), viral load (P=0.9), or CCL3 protein levels (P=1.0). Survival among the HIV infected individuals did not differ according to CCL3L copy number. In this cohort, CCL3L CNV did not affect HIV status, pathogenesis, or survival.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Larsen, Margit Hørup","Thørner, Lise Wegner","Zinyama, Rutendo","Amstrup, Janne","Kallestrup, Per","Gerstoft, Jan","Gomo, Exnevia","Erikstrup, Christian","Ullum, Henrik"],"cuid":["S02-089.79-020446"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Institut for Klinisk Medicin - Klinisk Immunologisk Afdeling, SKS"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ccl000000000003l gene copy number and survival in an hiv 000000000001 infected zimbabwean population","src":["au","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.meegid.2012.03.013","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-089.79-020446","identifier":[{"id":"84860384646","type":"scopus"},{"id":"22484760","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-6ad0ac0d-6d61-47b8-972c-6ec837900647","ku-58211a74-237a-4f94-98b5-ac445ab84dc8"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-68C19C072BFD9B4F1F00C9BD604F6D60"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.meegid.2012.03.013","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Public Health","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Public Health, Department of Public Health - Almen medicin, Specialeuddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["University of Copenhagen"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Institut for Klinisk Medicin - Klinisk Immunologisk Afdeling, SKS"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Margit Hørup","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Margit Hørup","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Lise Wegner","key":"thørnerpau","last":"Thørner","name":"Thørner, Lise Wegner","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"