Copenhagen"],"title":"EU to the Rescue? EU Support in National Foreign Policy Crises and the Danish Mohammed Cartoon Case","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-463823","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Treatment with some types of antidepressants has been associated with sudden cardiac death. It is unknown whether the increased risk is due to a class effect or related to specific antidepressants within drug classes. All patients in Denmark with an out-of-hospital cardiac arrest (OHCA) were identified (2001-2007). Association between treatment with specific antidepressants and OHCA was examined by conditional logistic regression in case-time-control models. We identified 19,110 patients with an OHCA; 2,913 (15.2%) were receiving antidepressant treatment at the time of OHCA, with citalopram being the most frequently used type of antidepressant (50.8%). Tricyclic antidepressants (TCAs; odds ratio (OR) = 1.69, confidence interval (CI): 1.14-2.50) and selective serotonin reuptake inhibitors (SSRIs; OR = 1.21, CI: 1.00-1.47) were both associated with comparable increases in risk of OHCA, whereas no association was found for serotonin-norepinephrine reuptake inhibitors/noradrenergic and specific serotonergic antidepressants (SNRIs/NaSSAs; OR = 1.06, CI: 0.81-1.39). The increased risks were primarily driven by: citalopram (OR = 1.29, CI: 1.02-1.63) and nortriptyline (OR = 5.14, CI: 2.17-12.2). An association between cardiac arrest and antidepressant use could be documented in both the SSRI and TCA classes of drugs.","author_count":17,"contributors":["Weeke, P","Jensen, Aksel Karl Georg","Folke, F","Gislason, G H","Olesen, J B","Andersson, C","Fosbøl, E L","Larsen, J K","Lippert, Freddy","Nielsen, S L","Gerds, Thomas Alexander","Andersen, Per Kragh","Kanters, Jørgen K.","Poulsen, Henrik Enghusen","Pehrson, S","Køber, L","Torp-Pedersen, C"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-477539"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"antidepressant use and risk of out of hospital cardiac arrest a nationwide case time control study","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/clpt.2011.368","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-477539","identifier":[{"id":"84862590416","type":"scopus"},{"id":"22588605","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-8ca119b6-7154-431f-88b3-736af947aa8e"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-9759D1CABA4F1B45F6E57B8484F89697"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/clpt.2011.368","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Public Health, Section of Biostatistics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"P","key":"weekepau","last":"Weeke","name":"Weeke, P","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Aksel Karl Georg","key":"jensenpau","last":"Jensen","locid":"b0add8ae-69a3-472b-ab21-e2a53d1f4315","name":"Jensen, Aksel Karl Georg","orcid":"0000-0002-1459-0465","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"F","key":"folkepau","last":"Folke","name":"Folke, F","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"G H","key":"gislasonpau","last":"Gislason","name":"Gislason, G H","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"J B","key":"olesenpau","last":"Olesen","name":"Olesen, J B","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"C","key":"anderssonpau","last":"Andersson","name":"Andersson, C","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"E L","key":"fosbølpau","last":"Fosbøl","name":"Fosbøl, E L","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno