sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-158369","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"A welfare assessment system should be \"high\" in validity, robustness and feasibility - the latter both as regards time and costs. Therefore, observers must be able to perform the on-farm assessment with acceptable validity after some training. Based on empiric data this paper evaluates the consequences of operating with several observers. Animal based measures on 9 Danish mink farms were taken in November 2011. Eight observers individually, but in paris on herd level, carried out data collection on the measures involving subjective grading, e.g. mink \"activity\", \"injuries\" and \"fur-chewing\" on approximately 120 cages with mink per farm. The assessment of the two observers gave similar frequencies of welfare problems and thus similar welfare assessments. The individual problems observed were however, not the same leading to poor or fair, but rarely good inter observer reliability. Despite the skilled assessors, the short training was not sufficient to get highly reliable results. No overall difference was found between the inter observer reliability of cages with ≤2 or ≥3 mink in a cage. More training and better training material and, for some measures, observation procedures are needed in order to increase reliability of the difficult subjective measures.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Møller, Steen Henrik","Rousing, Tine","Hansen, Steffen W"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-201738"],"event":{"end":"2012-08-24","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2012-08-21","title":"IFASA congress","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Kappa","Neovison vison","Welfare"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"welfur mink inter observer reliability of on farm welfare assessment in the growth season","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-201738","ids":["au-7e8fd58a-90d3-4a9b-9b10-a44b80632d55"],"keyword":["Kappa","Neovison vison","index of concordance","welfare"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-6E255DEB7778F909D9DD0CC57B56D4BD"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Technical Sciences, Department of Animal and Veterinary Sciences, Department of Animal and Veterinary Sciences - ANIS Welfare"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Steen Henrik","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"a76a2e86-c4b8-4a28-b835-e93cb9042c81","name":"Møller, Steen Henrik","orcid":"0000-0003-3086-753X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Tine","key":"rousingpau","last":"Rousing","locid":"554ba778-7b4c-49e5-b19f-b54d6f09e7ec","name":"Rousing, Tine","orcid":"0000-0001-8619-6996","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Steffen W","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"c5e7f61e-9285-4d61-b555-040eeda1dce0","name":"Hansen, Steffen W","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"P.F.","key":"larsenpedh","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, P.F.","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"S.H.","key":"møllerpedh","last":"Møller","name":"Møller, S.H.","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"T.","key":"clausenpedh","last":"Clausen","name":"Clausen, T.","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"A.S.","key":"hammerpedh","last":"Hammer","name":"Hammer, A.S.","rank":7,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"T.M.","key":"lássenpedh","last":"Lássen","name":"Lássen, T.M.","rank":8,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"V.H.","key":"nielsenpedh","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, V.H.","rank":9,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"A.H.","key":"tausonpedh","last":"Tauson","name":"Tauson, A.H.","rank":10,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"L.L.","key":"jeppesenpedh","last":"Jeppesen","name":"Jeppesen, L.L.","rank":11,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"S.W.","key":"hansenpedh","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, S.W.","rank":12,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"J.","key":"elnifpedh","last":"Elnif","name":"Elnif, J.","rank":13,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"J.","key":"malmkvistpedh","last":"Malmkvist","name":"Malmkvist, J.","rank":14,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"edition":"3/4","eisbn":["9789086867608"],"isbn":["9789086862054"],"pages":"469-476","publisher":"Wageningen Academic Publishers","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the Xth International Scientific Congress in fur animal production","volume":"36"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-7e8fd58a-90d3-4a9b-9b10-a44b80632d55"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"WelFur-mink: inter-observer reliability of on-farm welfare assessment in the growth season","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-201738","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"We wanted to test the hypothesis that treatment with amiloride or spironolactone reduced ambulatory (ABP) and central blood pressure (CBP) and that tubular transport via ENaCγ and AQP2 was increased after furosemide treatment. During baseline conditions, there were no differences in ABP, CBP, renal tubular function, or plasma concentrations of vasoactive hormones. After furosemide treatment, an increase in CBP, CH(2)o, FE(Na), FE(K), u-AQP2/min, u-ENaCγ/min, PRC, p-Ang II, and p-Aldo was observed. The increases in water and sodium absorption via AQP2 and ENaC after furosemide treatment most likely are compensatory phenomena to antagonize water and sodium depletion.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Matthesen, Solveig Klok","Larsen, Thomas","Lauridsen, Thomas Guldager","Vase, Henrik","Gjørup, Pia Holland","Nykjær, Karen Marie","Nielsen, Søren","Pedersen, Erling Bjerregaard"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-263151"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effect of amiloride and spironolactone on renal tubular function ambulatory blood pressure and pulse wave velocity in healthy participants in a double blinded randomized placebo controlled crossover trial","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/10641963.2012.681730","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-263151","identifier":[{"id":"22591021","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84870443355","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-ea744a45-36fd-4a25-a6b6-37d0a31c855a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-E887E1B42FF3EA10E021FAB69490BE22"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.3109/10641963.2012.681730","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus University, Faculty of Health Sciences, Medicinsk Forskning, Holstebro"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Solveig Klok","key":"matthesenpau","last":"Matthesen","locid":"dc97e5a1-7cf6-4278-9191-b16215f9148f","name":"Matthesen, Solveig Klok","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Thomas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas Guldager","key":"lauridsenpau","last":"Lauridsen","locid":"244f4e22-4278-4de4-b1a5-f1f717be5054","name":"Lauridsen, Thomas Guldager","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"vasepau","last":"Vase","locid":"1c1976b0-bcb2-47da-8f68-b2a753437368","name":"Vase, Henrik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Pia Holland","key":"gjøruppau","last":"Gjørup","locid":"f2909ad6-ff24-449d-aa24-8dbe0b61f9aa","name":"Gjørup, Pia Holland","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen Marie","key":"nykjærpau","last":"Nykjær","name":"Nykjær, Karen Marie","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren","key":"nielsenpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"765038c1-8bb4-4ae3-b64a-365760747b1f","name":"Nielsen, Søren","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erling Bjerregaard","key":"pedersenpau","last":"Pedersen","locid":"cee973dd-c4aa-4dc2-aad4-c1c021f0b508","name":"Pedersen, Erling Bjerregaard","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22591021"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3109/10641963.2012.681730","issn":["10641963","15256006"],"issn_org":["10641963"],"issue":"8","journal":"Clinical and Experimental Hypertension","pages":"588-600","publisher":"Taylor & Francis Group LLC Philadelphia","status":"p","title":"Clinical and Experimental Hypertension","volume":"34"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84870443355"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-ea744a45-36fd-4a25-a6b6-37d0a31c855a"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Effect of amiloride and spironolactone on renal tubular function, ambulatory blood pressure, and pulse wave velocity in healthy participants in a double-blinded, randomized, placebo-controlled, crossover trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-263151","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Det kan være svært at se det positive i en krise – men selv traumatiske begivenheder rummer et læringspotentiale, som på sigt gør organisationen stærkere. Henrik Holt Larsen deler her en række pointer omkring ”traumatisk læring”.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Holt Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-281319"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-CBS"]},"level3all":["DI-U-CBS"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"hvad kan vi lære af ekstreme begivenheder","src":["cbs"],"src-code":["DI-U-CBS"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-281319","ids":["cbs-3e608bc1-51bb-45ac-bdad-bbedc1ca162a"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5336605F91FB8B32FF8DA9200B1C5D22"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"cbs copenhagen business school","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-CBS","l3nl":"Copenhagen Business School","l3nn":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"CBS Copenhagen Business School","namevar":["Copenhagen Business School, Department of Organization"],"nora_code":"DI-U-CBS","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"holtlarsenpau","last":"Holt Larsen","locid":"8ae11131-8aa8-43f3-a839-8e8910f1cf07","name":"Holt Larsen, Henrik","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["19040962"],"issue":"2","journal":"Ledelseidag.dk","status":"p","title":"Ledelseidag.dk","title_org":"Ledelse i Dag"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","Copenhagen Business School","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["cbs-3e608bc1-51bb-45ac-bdad-bbedc1ca162a"],"src":["CBS Copenhagen Business School"],"title":"Hvad kan vi lære af ekstreme begivenheder?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-281319","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
