{"abstract":"Rapporten indeholder en evaluering af et projekt på Vesterbro, gennemført af DGI-Byen, som tog sigte på at fremme vanskeligt stillede børns deltagelse i idræt og fysisk aktivitet samt sundhed mere generelt.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Ibsen, Bjarne","Simovska, Venka","M. Larsen, Henrik"],"cuid":["S02-092.65-013035"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Børn og unge","Deltagelse","Idræt","Partnerskab","Sundhedsfremme","Tilgængelighed"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"tilgængelighed til og deltagelse i idræt blandt børn og unge på vesterbro evaluering af dgi byens børne og ungeprojekt go active","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/51085076/Tilg_ngelighed_til_og_deltagelse_i_idr_t_blandt_b_rn_og_unge_p_Vesterbro.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S02-092.65-013035","ids":["au-05f7f669-255b-4930-8682-f374ebc6579b","sdu-30250534-e5ce-48d4-861f-5106c30f5864"],"keyword":["Børn og unge","Idræt","Sundhedsfremme","deltagelse","forsøgs- og udviklingsprojekt","partnerskab","tilgængelighed"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Medical Science"],"noi":["Local-1-2-61B5538D9110EBB8ABA6C1370D8EF7BA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://static.sdu.dk/mediafiles//6/C/4/%7B6C4F809F-A597-4633-AA90-78205AE1C0E7%7DMovements2012Nr8.pdf","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.sdu.dk/Om_SDU/Institutter_centre/C_Isc/Publikationer/Movements%20","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.au.dk/ws/files/51085076/Tilg_ngelighed_til_og_deltagelse_i_idr_t_blandt_b_rn_og_unge_p_Vesterbro.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics, Centre for Sports, Health and Civil Society","SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Sports Science and Clinical Biomechanics, Movement, Sport and Society"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Department of Education - Curriculum Research"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Bjarne","key":"ibsenpau","last":"Ibsen","locid":"f75f735a-cd43-46c6-93ab-e5ec963bca43","name":"Ibsen, Bjarne","orcid":"0000-0003-4326-4252","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Venka","key":"simovskapau","last":"Simovska","locid":"3fa7b3d7-0f48-4529-b978-d667187bf858","name":"Simovska, Venka","orcid":"0000-0003-1391-9182","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"mlarsenpau","last":"M. Larsen","name":"M. Larsen, Henrik","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik M.","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","name":"Larsen, Henrik M.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788792646507"],"issue":"8","pages":"159","place":"Odense","publisher":"Center for Forskning i Idræt, Sundhed og Civilsamfund, SDU","repno":"Movements, No. 8","series":"Movements","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-05f7f669-255b-4930-8682-f374ebc6579b","sdu-30250534-e5ce-48d4-861f-5106c30f5864"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Tilgængelighed til og deltagelse i idræt blandt børn og unge på Vesterbro : Evaluering af DGI-byens børne- og ungeprojekt Go-Active","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-092.65-013035","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"Accurate strain identification is essential for anyone working with bacteria. For many species, multilocus sequence typing (MLST) is considered the \"gold standard\" of typing, but it is traditionally performed in an expensive and time-consuming manner. As the costs of whole-genome sequencing (WGS) continue to decline, it becomes increasingly available to scientists and routine diagnostic laboratories. Currently, the cost is below that of traditional MLST. The new challenges will be how to extract the relevant information from the large amount of data so as to allow for comparison over time and between laboratories. Ideally, this information should also allow for comparison to historical data. We developed a Web-based method for MLST of 66 bacterial species based on WGS data. As input, the method uses short sequence reads from four sequencing platforms or preassembled genomes. Updates from the MLST databases are downloaded monthly, and the best-matching MLST alleles of the specified MLST scheme are found using a BLAST-based ranking method. The sequence type is then determined by the combination of alleles identified. The method was tested on preassembled genomes from 336 isolates covering 56 MLST schemes, on short sequence reads from 387 isolates covering 10 schemes, and on a small test set of short sequence reads from 29 isolates for which the sequence type had been determined by traditional methods. The method presented here enables investigators to determine the sequence types of their isolates on the basis of WGS data. This method is publicly available at www.cbs.dtu.dk/services/MLST.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Larsen, Mette Voldby","Cosentino, Salvatore","Rasmussen, Simon","Rundsten, Carsten Friis","Hasman, Henrik","Marvig, Rasmus Lykke","Jelsbak, Lars","Sicheritz-Pontén, Thomas","Ussery, David","Aarestrup, Frank Møller","Lund, Ole"],"cuid":["S02-096.91-037833"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Bacteria classification","Bacterial Typing Techniques","Contig Mapping","Databases Genetic","Genes Bacterial","Genome Bacterial","High Throughput Nucleotide Sequencing","Multilocus Sequence Typing"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"multilocus sequence typing of total genome sequenced bacteria","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1128/JCM.06094-11","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-096.91-037833","identifier":[{"id":"22238442","type":"pmid"},{"id":"PMC3318499","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"84858600509","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-eb703606-a1f5-4453-ac8e-b07fa3bfc426","ku-6bcb60b6-ac90-4d1e-870b-ac70a2bb98a5"],"keyword":["Bacteria/classification","Bacterial Typing Techniques","Contig Mapping","Databases, Genetic","Genes, Bacterial","Genome, Bacterial","High-Throughput Nucleotide Sequencing","Multilocus Sequence Typing"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-0DA4D7257DB1970C1D637DA3BF6DEE9C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1128/JCM.06094-11","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Systems Biology, Center for Biological Sequence Analysis"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"Mette Voldby","key":"larsenpau","last":"Larsen","locid":"48f90aec-1c95-444e-a7e5-d7b3ddcf1b7e","name":"Larsen, Mette Voldby","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Salvatore","key":"cosentinopau","last":"Cosentino","locid":"4bb9e1cb-cf15-49ec-8242-51af37011a9b","name":"Cosentino, Salvatore","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Simon","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"7dcb9d6e-8054-4bcf-a087-82517b291a32","name":"Rasmussen, Simon","orcid":"0000-0001-6323-9041","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten Friis","key":"rundstenpau","last":"Rundsten","locid":"79395461-b12e-4b1a-a046-7097fa8d258c","name":"Rundsten, Carsten Friis","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Carsten","key":"friispau","last":"Friis","locid":"72933237-3b8f-492c-8c31-ab8d2fc151cb","name":"Rundsten, Carsten Friis","name_org":"Friis, Carsten","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Henrik","key":"hasmanpau","last":"Hasman","locid":"2aeb80b4-d42a-4da2-9212-86b697184f40","name":"Hasman, Henrik","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rasmus Lykke","key":"marvigpau","last":"Marvig","locid":"a8d2665d-de10-4dd3-bea5-832b1e78ac2f","name":"Marvig, Rasmus Lykke","orcid":"0000-0002-5267-3173","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"jelsbakpau","last":"Jelsbak","locid":"0f152051-d6ff-4b86-b98f-2ce118ee9ee1","name":"Jelsbak, Lars","orcid":"