"Kipp","name":"Kipp, Nicolai Anders","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Hans","key":"abildgaardhanspau","last":"Abildgaard","name":"Abildgaard, Hans","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788755039636"],"issn":["01062840"],"issue":"1804(EN)","pages":"142","place":"Roskilde","publisher":"Danmarks Tekniske Universitet, Risø Nationallaboratoriet for Bæredygtig Energi","repno":"Denmark. Forskningscenter Risoe. Risoe-R, 1804(EN)","series":"Denmark. Forskningscenter Risoe. Risoe-R","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Energinet SOV","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-2864354d-f582-4fb1-82f7-a836b4c98f7b"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Electricity for Road Transport, Flexible Power Systems and Wind Power","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-316588","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"In this paper we describe a computer vision system based on SLS (Subsurface Laser Scattering) for industrial food inspection. To ob- tain high and uniform quality, in for example dairy products like yoghurt and cheese, it is important to monitor the change in size and shape of microscopic particles over time. In this paper we demonstrate the use- fulness of our SLS system for characterizing food items. We use a laser source that can be tuned to any wavelength in the range of 455 nm - 1020 nm by applying an AOTF (Acousto-Optical Tunable Filter) to an optical beam generated by a SuperK (supercontinuum) laser system. In our experiments we show how the system can be used for discriminating dairy products with dierent structure and how the structural change of a foam can be monitored over time. Time stability of the system is essential for measurements over several hours, and we demonstrate the time stability by measuring the re ectance prole of an inorganic phan- tom. The SLS technique is a very promising technique for non-intrusive food inspection, especially for homogenous products where particle size and shape are important parameters.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Nielsen, Otto Højager Attermann","Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","Larsen, Rasmus","Møller, Flemming","Nielsen, Frederik Donbæk","Thomsen, Carsten L.","Aanæs, Henrik","Carstensen, Jens Michael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-320327"],"event":{"end":"2011-05-27","place":"Ystad, se","start":"2011-05-27","title":"Scandinavian Workshop on Imaging Food Quality 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-NKT","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-NKT","DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"in depth analysis of food structures hyperspectral subsurface laser scattering","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/5666111/Pages%20from%20tr11_15-3.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-320327","ids":["dtu-34ea609a-4816-4f2b-892c-1a42bf6cf127"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5FCC99AF9BF17371BB69A2F0947CBEDE"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/5666111/Pages%20from%20tr11_15-3.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www2.imm.dtu.dk/projects/SWIFQ/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Informatics and Mathematical Modeling","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Informatics and Mathematical Modeling, Image Analysis and Computer Graphics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Danisco AS"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"nkt holding","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-NKT","l3nl":"NKT Group","l3nn":"NKT Holding","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"NKT Holding","namevar":["NKT Group"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-NKT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Otto Højager Attermann","key":"nielsenottohøjagerattermannpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"aab6d868-8739-49c7-b41f-8afbacf3cc3f","name":"Nielsen, Otto Højager Attermann","orcid":"0000-0003-2741-3174","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Lindbjerg","key":"dahlandersbjorholmpau","last":"Dahl","locid":"c2bad3c8-b172-481b-bb99-d3c2bc4004ef","name":"Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","name_org":"Dahl, Anders Lindbjerg","orcid":"0000-0002-0068-8170","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus","key":"larsenrasmuspau","last":"Larsen","locid":"b3ea098f-fc7a-48a0-94ae-ae033577d7f1","name":"Larsen, Rasmus","orcid":"0000-0001-8507-0523","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Flemming","key":"møllerflemmingpau","last":"Møller","name":"Møller, Flemming","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Frederik Donbæk","key":"nielsenfrederikdonbækpau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Frederik Donbæk","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten L.","key":"thomsencarstenlpau","last":"Thomsen","name":"Thomsen, Carsten L.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henrik","key":"aanæshenrikpau","last":"Aanæs","locid":"82129afb-048a-424a-ba22-419bd0bab56f","name":"Aanæs, Henrik","orcid":"0000-0001-7547-4743","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jens Michael","key":"carstensenjensmichaelpau","last":"Carstensen","locid":"81e6af6e-2673-4f75-a894-82a7506ef55f","name":"Carstensen, Jens Michael","orcid":"0000-0002-2535-3908","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issue":"15","pages":"29-34","place":"Kgs. Lyngby, Denmark","publisher":"Technical University of Denmark","series":"IMM-Technical Report","status":"p","subtitle":"Ystad, May 27, 2011 - Proceedings","title":"Scandinavian Workshop on Imaging Food Quality 2011"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","NKT Group","Other Companies","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","danisco as"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-34ea609a-4816-4f2b-892c-1a42bf6cf127"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"In Depth Analysis of Food Structures : Hyperspectral Subsurface Laser Scattering","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-320327","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"A materials structural and chemical composition influences its optical scattering properties. In this paper we investigate the use of subsurface laser scattering (SLS) for inferring structural and chemical information of food products. We have constructed a computer vision system based on a supercontinuum laser light source and an Acousto- Optic Tunable Filter (AOTF) to provide a collimated light source, which can be tuned to any wavelength in the range from 480 to 900 nm. We present the newly developed hyperspectral vision system together with a proof-of-principle study of its ability to discriminate between dairy products with either similar chemical or structural composition. The combined vision system is a new way for industrial food inspection allowing non-intrusive online process inspection of parameters that is hard with existing technology.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Nielsen, Otto Højager Attermann","Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","Larsen, Rasmus","Møller, Flemming","Nielsen, Frederik Donbæk","Thomsen, Carsten L.","Aanæs, Henrik","Carstensen, Jens Michael"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-320359"],"event":{"end":"2011-05-27","place":"Ystad, se","start":"2011-05-23","title":"17th Scandinavian Conference on Image Analysis (SCIA)","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-NKT"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-NKT","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"supercontinuum light sources for hyperspectral subsurface laser scattering applications for food inspection","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-21227-7_31","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-320359","identifier":[{"id":"79957514981","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-3507dc32-1068-43e0-bb2f-6278384db27a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-4D4B779C2B276B32293995A912B7470B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-21227-7_31","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.maths.lth.se/vision/scia2011/","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Informatics and Mathematical Modeling","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Informatics and Mathematical Modeling, Image Analysis and Computer Graphics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"nkt holding","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-NKT","l3nl":"NKT Group","l3nn":"NKT Holding","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"NKT Holding","namevar":["NKT Group"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-NKT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Otto Højager Attermann","key":"nielsenottohøjagerattermannpau","last":"Nielsen","locid":"aab6d868-8739-49c7-b41f-8afbacf3cc3f","name":"Nielsen, Otto Højager Attermann","orcid":"0000-0003-2741-3174","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anders Lindbjerg","key":"dahlandersbjorholmpau","last":"Dahl","locid":"c2bad3c8-b172-481b-bb99-d3c2bc4004ef","name":"Dahl, Anders Bjorholm","name_org":"Dahl, Anders Lindbjerg","orcid":"0000-0002-0068-8170","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rasmus","key":"larsenrasmuspau","last":"Larsen","locid":"b3ea098f-fc7a-48a0-94ae-ae033577d7f1","name":"Larsen, Rasmus","orcid":"0000-0001-8507-0523","rank":3,"ro