{"abstract":"We determined the impact of three factors on mortality in HIV-infected patients who had been on highly active antiretroviral therapy (HAART) for at least one year: (1) insufficient response to (HAART) and presence of AIDS-defining diseases, (2) comorbidity, and (3) drug and alcohol abuse and compared the mortality to that of the general population.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Obel, Niels","Omland, Lars Haukali","Kronborg, Gitte","Larsen, Carsten Schade","Pedersen, Court","Pedersen, Gitte","Sørensen, Henrik Toft","Gerstoft, Jan"],"cuid":["S03-088.91-030932"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"impact of non hiv and hiv risk factors on survival in hiv infected patients on haart a population based nationwide cohort study","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0022698","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-088.91-030932","identifier":[{"id":"PMC3143183","type":"pmcid"},{"id":"21799935","type":"pmid"},{"id":"79960713621","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-fe706146-d18a-4267-9442-796ed96962e5","ku-496c23b9-53b5-4f3c-bda8-7f942a221584","sdu-fd5d6bbb-0112-4caa-b9ff-3fc3223bbf99"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-6-EBA9DDDF738440340BB0C05F5B0AC846"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0022698","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["De